<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">- Mpoto Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Utumbulilu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Utumbulilu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Utumbulilu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Utum</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Utumbulilu</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Lihina Utumbulilu libhi na ndandi ja “Kutumbula” na chenjenu nde chitabu cha kutumbula mu Lulaghilu lwa Mwande la Bibilia. Kiebulania cha kutumbula chitumbula na malobhi “Pakutumbula hapa.” Ilangiha kubha nde kwako kila chindu chakahumike na nakanopi ntundu mahengu ghaka Chapanga na bhandu moyatumbulile. Bhasomi bha lalenu bhabhi na maholalelu ghabhu panani jaka mundu au bhandu bhabhalembiki Chitabu cha Kutumbula na kabhete chikahi pachalembakike. Bhangi bhahobhalela kubha pangi chakabhonginwi kuhuma mu mahighalilu gha malembu gha mwande mu kaline ya 5-6 K. K. Ku Babeli hoku. Bhangi bhajetakela uhobhalelu wa kintetu kubha Musa nde joakachilembike, na bhelabhela Chitabu cha Kubhoka, Mambu gha Bhalawi, Ubhalangiku, na Ukombukelu mu hyaka ya 1300 au 1400 K. K.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Kutumbula chibhi na mambu ghamaheli namaa gha kubhajangatila Bhakristo kujimanya Bibilia jokapi, Lulaghilu lwa Mwande, na Lulaghilu Lwahenu. Chitulangiha ntundu ghamboni na mahakau moghajingalile pundema na kupalakika kwa Mkengalela kwa ndandi ja bhandu bhokapi. Kabhete chilangiha mpangu waka Chapanga wa kubhakengalela bhandu. Haleli liweza kubhonikana kuhuma mu ulota wa kutumbula kubhokana na Yesu (Utumbulilu 3:15), na chilanga chaka Chapanga kwaka Ibulahimu kubhapengalela bhandu bha mataifa ghokapi pundema (Utumbulilu 12:3).</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghaghabhihomu</para>
  <para style="io">Chapanga akaubhombiki ndema, na Adamu na Eva, ngati moilembakike mu sula ja 1 na 2.</para>
  <para style="io">Sula na 3 mbaka 5 jabhalandila Adamu na Eva, mahoku ghabhu, na Lubheleku lwabhu.</para>
  <para style="io">Sula ja 6 mbaka 9 jundandila Nuhu na iyula ngolongwa na kutwelela kwa machi ghamaheli pundema pokapi.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabhete Chitabu cha Kutumbula chilandila mambu ghala ghaghapitalile mu chikahi chaka Nuhu na chikahi chaka Ibulahimu, papamu na mnala wa Babeli mu sula ja 10 na 11.</para>
  <para style="io">Sula ja 12 mbaka 50 yundandila Ibulahimu, familia jaki, na kutumbula kwa bhandu bha litaifa la Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="io">Matamu ghaka Ibulahimu na nhwanu waki Sala ghalongaliki mu sula ja 12 mbaka 25.</para>
  <para style="io">Matatu ghaka Isaka na nhwanu waki Lebeka ghalongaliki mu sula ja 21 mbaka 28, na kupotela kwaki kulongaliki mu sula ja 35.</para>
  <para style="io">Matamu ghaka Yakobo, bhana bhaki, na kuhama kwabhu kuhuma ku Kanaani kujenda ku Misili ghalongaliki mu sula ja 25 mbaka 50.</para>
  <para style="io">Sula ja 37 mbaka 50 ilongalela matamu ghaka mwana mpalu waka Yakobo, yani Yusufu na ntundu moakabhelile mtawala wa ku inchi ja Misili.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s">Kubhombakeka kwa ndema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Pakutumbula hapa Chapanga akabhombiki mbengu na ndema. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Ndema ukabhi panga liumbo na utopu. Lubhendu lukabhi luyekiki panani ja machi, na Roho waka Chapanga akabhi atumbile panani ja machi. <verse eid="GEN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Bhela, Chapanga akapwaghike, “Kubya na unang'anu.” Na unang'anu ukabhile. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Chapanga akaweni kubha unang'anu ghola nde unyahi. Bhela Chapanga akaulekanishi unang'anu na lubhendu. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />Chapanga akaulohiki unang'anu “Muhe” na lubhendu akalulohiki “Ikilu.” Kukabhi pakamihi, kukabhi lukela, lichobha la kutumbula.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Bhela, Chapanga akapwaghike, “Kubya na mbekenyu pachilanda ja machi, jighabhanisha machi na machi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Chapanga akajitendiki mbekenyu, na kughalekanisha machi ghaghabhi panani ja mbekenyu heji na machi ghala ghaghabhi pahi. Na kukabhi bhenibhela. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Chapanga akajilohiki mbekenyu heji “Lianga.” Kukabhi pakamihi, kukabhi lukela, lichobha la kabhele.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Chapanga akapwaghike, “Machi ghaghabhi pahi ja lianga ghalibhonganaje pandu pamu, nahuli pabya na pandu pajomu.” Na kukabhi bhenibhela. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Chapanga akapalohiki pandu pajomu “Inchi” na lipogha la machi akalilohiki “Bahali.” Chapanga akaweni kubha nde inyahi. <verse eid="GEN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Bhela, Chapanga akapwaghike, “Inchi na jipihaje mimea. Mimea jejipiha imbeju, mikongu jejipiha mapambiku ghaghabhi na imbeki mkati jaki, na kila nkongu kulengana na ntundu waki patali patali.” Na kukabhi bhenibhela. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Inchi jakamelihi mimea, mimea jejipiha imbeju kulengana na ntundu waki na mikongu jejipiha mapambiku kulengana na ntundu waki. Chapanga akaweni kubha nde inyahi. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Kukabhi pakamihi, kukabhi lukela, lichobha la katatu.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Chapanga akapwaghike, “Kubya na minang'anu mu lianga la kunani nahuli kughabhanisha ikilu na muhi, nayombi ibya nde nginyulila ya kulangiha ikahi patali patali, machobha na hyaka, <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />jinang'anaje kunani na kuumulakila ndema.” Na kukabhi bhenibhela. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Chapanga akatendiki minang'anu jibheli mikolongwa, unang'anu ukolongwa utawala muhi, na unang'anu uchoku utawala ikilu. Bhelabhela akatendiki ndondwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Chapanga akajibhekiki minang'anu jeniheji ku lianga jimulakya ndema, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />jipata kunang'ana ikilu na muhi, na kulekanesha unang'anu na lubhendu. Chapanga akaweni kubha nde inyahi. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Kukabhi pakamihi, kukabhi lukela, lichobha la kacheche.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Chapanga akapwaghike, “Kubyaje na mapogha gha ihumbi yomi yamaheli mu machi, na hijuni igholukaje pachilanda ja lianga la kunani.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Bhela, Chapanga akaibhombiki ihumbi ikolongwa namaa ya mubahali, na kila ntundu wa ihumbi yomi yeijenda mkati ja machi. Na akabhombiki kila ntundu wa hijuni. Chapanga akaweni kubha nde inyahi. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Chapanga akaipengalili ihumbi heyi yokapi, na kupwagha, “Mbelakanaje, mkajonjukikaje, mkaghatwelakya machi gha bahali, na hijuni ijonjukikaje pundema.” <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Kukabhi pakamihi, kukabhi lukela, lichobha la kahanu.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Chapanga akapwaghike, “Inchi na jipihaje kila ntundu wa ihumbi yomi: Hinyama ya kudimakika, ihumbi yeikwabha, na hinyama ya muchitengu kwa ntundu waki.” Na kukabhi bhenibhela. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Chapanga akaibhombiki hinyama ya muchitengu kwa ntundu waki, hinyama ya kudimakika kwa ntundu waki, na ihumbi yokapi yeikwabha kwa ntundu waki. Chapanga akaweni kubha nde inyahi.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Bhela Chapanga akapwaghike, “Tumbombaje mundu kwa ulenganesu witu, na kwa sula jitu, bhakatawala homba ya mubahali, na hijuni ya kunani, na hinyama ya kudimakika na hinyama ya muchitengu, na ndema wokapi, na kila chiumbi chechikwabha panani ja ndema.” <verse eid="GEN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Chapanga akumbombiki mundu kwa ulenganesu waki, ena, kwa ulenganesu waka Chapanga akumbombiki. Akabhabhombiki mwanalomi na mbomba. <verse eid="GEN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Chapanga akabhapengalili na kubhapwaghila, “Mbelakanaje, mkajonjukikaje, mkautwelakya ndema na kuutawala. Mkatawala homba ya mubahali, na hijuni ya kunani, na kila chiumbi chomi chechijenda panani ja ndema.” <verse eid="GEN 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Bhela Chapanga akapwaghike, “Lingalya, numpeki kila mmea ghoupiha imbeju panani ja ndema wokapi na kila nkongu ghoubhi na mapambiku ghaghabhi na imbeki mkati jaki. Yeniheyi anaibya chilebhi chinu, <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />na chilebhi cha hinyama yokapi ya pundema, na chilebhi cha kila chijuni cha kunani, na chilebhi cha kila chiumbi chechikwabha panani ja ndema chechibhi na womi, numpekeha kila nkongu wa mahamba kubha chilebhi chinu.” Na kukabhi bhenibhela. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Chapanga akaweni kubha kila chindu cheachibhombiki kubha nde chinyahi namaa. Kukabhi pakamihi, kukabhi lukela, lichobha la sita.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Na bhenibhela nde ntundu Chapanga moakajomuli kubhomba kunani na ndema papamu na hindu yokapi yeibhi mkati jaki. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Na mu lichobha la saba Chapanga akabhi ajomwili lihengu laki lokapi leakahengike. Mu lichobha heli la saba Chapanga akakotwiki kuhenga mahengu ghaki ghokapi ghaakahengike. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Chapanga akalipengalili lichobha la saba na kuligholola, maghambu mu lichobha leniheli Chapanga akapomulili, paakajomwili kuhenga lihengu laki lokapi la kubhomba leakabhi ahenga. <verse eid="GEN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Bhenibhela nde kunani na ndema moyabhombakike.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="GEN 2:4">Chijongu cha Edeni</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Bambo Chapanga paakabhombiki kunani na pundema, <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />ngachepakabhi na mmea pundema ghoukabhi upitalile pundema, wala ngachepabhili na mmea pundema ghoukabhi umelike, maghambu Bambo Chapanga akabhi ngacheajitonyihi iyula panani ja ndema, na wala ngachepabhili na mundu wa kujilema. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Nambu machi ghaghabhi pahi ja ndema ghakapitiki na kutonyela paluhombi pokapi. <verse eid="GEN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Bambo Chapanga akumbombiki mundu kuhuma mu luhombi lwa lutopi, akumpulalili muimbulu mbomu ja womi, na mundu hoju akabhi chiumbi chomi.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akapandiki chijongu ku Edeni kola, upambala wa kolipita lyobha, na kumbeka mkati jaki mundu hoju joakumbombike. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />Bambo Chapanga akamelihi kila ntundu wa nkongu kuhuma muluhombi, mikongu jejinyambiha mihu na jejipalika kwa chilebhe. Pachilanda ja chijongu hechi kukabhi na nkongu wa womi na nkongu wa umanyi wa ghamboni na mahakau.<verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Kukabhi na nkoka ghounyilika machi na kujitalila chijongu cha Edeni, kuhuma konihoku nkoka hoghu ukaghabhaniki kubha mikoka ncheche. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Nkoka wa kutumbula ukalowakiki Pishoni, ghonihoghu nde ghouyongalota inchi jokapi ja Havila ambaku kubhi na zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Zahabu ja inchi jeniheji nde jinyahi. Konihoku kabheti kubhi na manungilu ghaghalowakeka bedola na maganga gha mbija yamaheli ghaghalowakeka shohamu. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Nkoka wa kabheli nde Gihoni, ambau uyongalota inchi jokapi ja Kushi. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Lihina la nkoka wa katatu nde Tigilisi, nawombi unyilika upambala wa kolipita lyobha ku inchi ja Ashulu. Na nkoka wa kacheche nde Eufulati.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akuntoliki mundu hoju, na kumbeka mu chijongu cha Edeni, achilemaje na kuchighoha. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Bambo Chapanga akundaghalaki mundu hoju, akapwaghaje, “Uweza kula mapambiku gha nkongu wokapi wa muchijongu, <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />nambu ngawikula mapambiku gha nkongu wa umanyi wa ghamboni na mahakau ng'o, maghambu lichobha pawikulaje mapambiku gha nkongu ghonihoghu, anaupotilaje chakaka.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akapwaghike, “Nga wichu mundu ajoju abya kanjika jaki, ananuntendila njangatila wa kulengana naku.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Bambo Chapanga akabhi abhombiki kuhuma mu lutopi kila chinyama cha muchitengu na kila chijuni cha kunani, akundetili Adamu nahuli abhonaje anaabhaloha mahina bhole, na kila lihina leakachilohiki kila chiumbi chomi, lakabhi nde lihina laki. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Bhela, Adamu akabhapekihi mahina ghabhu kila chinyama cha kudimakika, ijuni ya kunani, na hinyama yokapi ya muchitengu. Nambu Adamu ngacheakumbweni njangatila wa kupalika.<verse eid="GEN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akundetili Adamu lughonu lukolongwa, najombi paakabhi aghonile akatoliki lundeta lwaki lumu, na kupayekalela pandu pala kwa inyama. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akuntendiki mbomba kuhuma mu lundeta loakalutoliki kuhuma kwaka Adamu lola, na kundeta mbomba hoju kwaka Adamu. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Panihapa Adamu akapwaghike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">“Sajenu ajoju nde chihupa kuhuma mu ihupa yangu, na inyama kuhuma mu inyama jangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">Ajoju anaalowakika ‘Mbomba’,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">maghambu akabhowakiki kuhuma muka mwanalomi.”<verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Kwa ndandi ajeji mwanalomi anaandeka tati waki na mabhu waki na kulombana na nhwanu waki, nabhombi anabhakubha hyegha jimu. <verse eid="GEN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Adamu na nhwanu waki bhokapi bhakabhi heu, nambu ngachebhaweni iyoni.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s">Adamu na Eva bhunhokela Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Bhela lijoka lakabhi lichenjile kupeta hinyama yokapi ya muchitengu yeyabhombakiki na Bambo Chapanga. Lijoka lakumpwaghi mbomba, “Eti! Chakaka le kubha Chapanga akapwaghiki, ‘Ngamwikula mapambiku gha nkongu wokapi ghola wa muchijongu?’ ”<verse eid="GEN 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Mbomba akamuyangiki lijoka, “Mapambiku gha mikongu ja muchijongu tuweza kula, <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />nambu Chapanga akatupwaghili, ‘Ngamwikula mapambiku gha nkongu ghoubhi pachilanda ja chijongu, wala ngamwigusa, ngamwihika kupotela.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Lijoka lakumpwaghi mbomba, “Chakaka ngamwipotele! <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Maghambu Chapanga amanyi kubha lichobha pamwikulaje mapambiku gha nkongu ghonihoghu, anamuyekuliwa mihu, nanamu anambya ngati Chapanga, mkamanya ghamboni na mahakau.”<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Mbomba paakaweni kubha lipambiku la nkongu ghonihoghu lakabhi linyahi kwa chilebhi na linyambiha mihu, na litokuleka kwa kujipatila mbulau, bhela akatongwi lipambiku la nkongu hoghu, na kula, akumpeki na ndomi waki, najombi bhelabhela akakulike. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Palapala mihu ghabhu ghakayekuliwi, bhakamanyi kubha bhabhi heu, bhela bhakalilokili mahamba gha nkongu ghoulowakeka mtini, na kulilenganakela ingobhu.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Panihapa mwanalomi na nhwanu waki bhakajowini sauti jaka Bambo Chapanga akajendaje muchijongu chikahi cha lyobha la pakamihi, Adamu na nhwanu waki bhakalihiiki mu mikongu ja chijongu, Bambo Chapanga ngaabhabhona. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Nambu Bambo Chapanga akundohiki Adamu, “Bho, ubhi kwako?”<verse eid="GEN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Najombi akayangiki, “Nakajowini sauti ja kujenda kwaku muchijongu, nakajowipi maghambu nepani mi heu, bhela nakalihiike.”<verse eid="GEN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Chapanga akundalukile, “Bho, nde nane joakupwaghile kubha ubhi heu? Bho, ukuliki le mapambiku gha nkongu ghonukulaghalakile ngawikula?”<verse eid="GEN 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Adamu akapwaghike, “Mbomba ajoju joumbekihe abya papamu na nepani nde joambekihe lipambiku la nkongu ghonihoghu, nanatu nakakulike.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akundaluki mbomba, “Henu uhengiki kike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Mbomba akayangike, “Lijoka lakangolwihe, nanatu nakakulike.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chapanga atemula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi lijoka, “Kwa kubha uhengiki bhenibhela, upekiwi masolu kupeta hinyama yokapi ya kudimakika, na hinyama yokapi ya muchitengu. Anaukwabhaje kwa lutumbu lwako, na anaukulaje luhombi machobha ghokapi gha matamu ghaku. <verse eid="GEN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Nanatu ananuntenda muhakalanya pachilanda jaku na mbomba hoju, na pachilanda ja lubheleku lwaki na lubheleku lwaku. Jombi anaakutimba mmutu waku, nanawu anaunduma kinjekinjeki.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Kabhete akumpwaghi mbomba, “Chakaka ananukujonjukya mabhinilu gha kubheleka kwaku, kwa mabhinilu anaubhelaka bhana. Na utokulelu waku anaubya kwaka ndomi waku, najombi anaakutawalaje.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Chapanga akumpwaghi Adamu, “Kwa kubha wehapa unjowanili nhwanu waku, na kula mapambiku gha nkongu ambau nakakulaghalaki, nakapwaghaje, ‘Ngawikula,’ bhela, luhombi lupekiwi masolu kwa ndandi jaku. Kwa lihoghatela anaulipatila chilebhi chaku monihomu, machobha ghokapi gha matamu ghaku. <verse eid="GEN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Luhombi analukubhelakya mingwandu na miha, nanawu anaukula mahamba gha mungonda. <verse eid="GEN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Kwa lihoghatela la pamihu jaku anaulipatila chilebhe, mbaka pawikelabhukaje mulutopi, maghambu ukatolakiki monihomu. Kwa kubha wehapa nde lutopi, nanawu mulutopi anaukelabhuka kabhete.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Adamu akundohiki nhwanu waki lihina Eva, maghambu jombi akabhi nde mabhu wa bhandu bhokapi. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Bambo Chapanga akabhalenganakili Adamu na nhwanu waki ingobhu ya chingumba, na kubhawatika.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu na Eva bhatopuleka muchijongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akapwaghike, “Sajenu mundu ajoju abhi ngati jumu witu, kwa kumanya ghamboni na mahakau. Ipalika kunhibhalila ngayihatambula chiwoku chaki na kutongola lipambiku kuhuma mu nkongu wa womi, maghambu anaakuliki anaatama mileli.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akuntopwili Adamu kuhuma mu Chijongu cha Edeni, nahuli akalemaje lutopi ambamu akabhombakike. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Paakuntopwili Adamu, Chapanga akabhekiki makelubi upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa Chijongu cha Edeni, papamu na lipanga la moto lelakabhi ling'anambuka akwo na akwo, kujilenda indela ja kujenda ku nkongu wa womi.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s">Kaini na Abeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Adamu akaghonili na nhwanu waki Eva, najombi akapatiki chitumbu, na kumbeleka Kaini. Eva akapwaghike, “Numpatiki mwana wa chikambaku kwa ujangatilu waka Bambo.” <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Panakatai akumbeliki ndongu waki Abeli. Abeli akabhi mdima wa mambelele, na Kaini akabhi ndemi. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Chikahi pachapetiki, Kaini akaletiki ilebhi ya mungonda ngati nyambiku kwaka Bambo. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Abeli najombi akaletiki bhabhelakeka bha kutumbula bha mambeleli ghaki na pandu papanonike pa mambeleli ghaki. Bambo akanyambakiki na Abeli papamu na nyambiku jaki, <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />nambu Chapanga ngacheakunjetakili Kaini papamu na nyamabiku jaki. Bhela Kaini akahakali namaa, na pamihu jaki pakabhi na ngwinyanila. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Panihapa Bambo akumpwaghi Kaini, “Bho, maghambu kiki utehi kuhakalila? Na maghambu kiki pamihu jaku pabhi na ngwinyanila? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Bho, anauhengiki lamboni le ngawijetakalewe? Na nangakuhenga lamboni, bhela, lihoku lukujobhalela pundyangu, najombi jukutokulela wehapa, nambu ikupalika ujiwezaje.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Bhela Kaini akumpwaghi ndongu waki Abeli, “Tumboka kuuwanda.” Chikahi pabhakabhi kuuwanda, Kaini akundapwi ndongu waki Abeli na kunkoma.<verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Panihapa Bambo akundaluki Kaini, “Bho, ndongu waku Abeli abhi kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:9">Akayangiki, “Nepani ngachemanye. Bho, nepani le nde mlonda waka ndongu wango?”<verse eid="GEN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />Bambo akapwaghike, “Henu uhengiki kike? Jowanyaje! Mwahi waka ndongu waku unelela nepani kuhuma mu luhombi. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Henu wehapa upekiwi masolu na kubhohakeka kuhuma mu luhombi, ambalu lukahipiki na kujopalela mwahi waka ndongu waku jounkomike. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Pawilema luhombi, ngalwakupekehi kabhete ilebhi yaki. Anaubya mundu wa kupotoka potoka, na mundu wanga kutamakila pandu pamu.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Kaini akumpwaghi Bambo Chapanga, “Utemulu wangu nde ukolongwa nakanope, ngachenhweza kuhinakila. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Lalenu, undopwili kuhuma pamihu ja luhombi londone, nanatu ananhiyakika kutali na pamihu jako. Anamya mundu wa kupotoka potoka, na jwanga kutamakila pandu pamu na jokapi joanamonaje anaangomaje.”<verse eid="GEN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Nambu Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Ngabhela! Mundu jokapi joanaakukoma wehapa wa Kaini anaalepishwa mala saba nakanopi.” Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumbekiki Kaini alama nahuli mundu jokapi joanaambonaje ngaankoma. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Panihapa Kaini akabhokiki palongi jaka Bambo, akapiti kutama ku inchi ja Nodi, upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa Edeni.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhabhelakeka bhaka Kaini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Kaini akaghoni na nhwanu waki, najombi akapatiki chitumbu, na kumbeleka Henoko. Chikahi hechi Kaini akachengiki muchi, na akaulohiki muchi ghonihoghu Henoko, lihina laka mwana waki. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Henoko akumbeliki Iladi, na Iladi akumbeliki Mahuyaeli, na Mahuyaeli akumbeliki Mesushaeli, najombi Mesushaeli akumbeliki Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lameki akatoghwi akambomba bhabheli, jumu akalowakiki Ada, na jongi akalowakiki Sila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Ada akumbeliki Yabali, jonihoju nde akabhi hokolu wa bhadima bha hinyama bhabhatamika mu mahema. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Ndongu waki akalowakiki Yubali, jonihoju nde akabhi hokolu wabhu bhabhahona lipenga na filimbe. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Sila najombi akumbeliki mwana wa chikambaku joakundohiki Tubali Kaini, jonihoju akabhi nde joaponda hindu ya kila ntundu ya madini gha shaba na choma. Na ndombu waka Tubali Kaini akabhi Naama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Lameki akabhapwaghi akabhahanu bhaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">“Ada na Sila munyowanyaje. Mwenga akabhahanu bhaka Lameki, njowanya malobhi ghango. Nepani nakunkomiki mundu kwa ndandi ja kunapula, ena, nakunkomiki nkombu kwa ndandi ja kumboteka.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Ngati Kaini anaalepishwi mala saba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">chakaka Lameki anaalepishwa mala sabini na saba.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seti na Enosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Adamu akaghonili kabheti na nhwanu waki Eva, najombi akumbeliki mwana wa chikambaku, akundohiki Seti akapwaghaje, “Chapanga anyangatili kupata mwana jongi pandu paka Abeli joakakomakiki na Kaini.” <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Seti najombi akapatiki mwana wa chikambaku, akundohiki lihina laki Enosi. Panihapa nde bhandu pabhatumbula kundobha Bambo kwa lihina laki.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s">Ibheleku yaka Adamu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:1-4">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 1:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Chenjenu nde chitabu chechalembakiki cha ibheleku yaka Adamu. Lichobha lela Chapanga paakumbombiki mundu, akumbombiki kwa sula jaki. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Akabhabhombiki mwanalomi na mbomba, akabhapengalili na kubhapekeha lihina “Adamu.” <verse eid="GEN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Adamu paakabhi na hyaka mia moja na selasini, akumbeliki mwana joalengini naku, joakabhi na sula ngati jaki, akundohiki Seti. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Paakabhelakiki Seti, Adamu akatami hyaka yengi mia nane, na kubheleka bhana bhangi bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Adamu akatami kwa hyaka mia tisa na selasini, na akapotile.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Seti paakabhi na hyaka mia moja na nhwanu, akumbeliki Enoshi. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Paakabhelakiki Enoshi, Seti akatami hyaka yengi mia nane na saba, na kubheleka bhana bhangi bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Seti akatami hyaka mia tisa komi na jibheli, na akapotile.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Enoshi paakabhi na hyaka tisini, akumbeliki Kenani. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Paakumbeliki Kenani, Enoshi akatami hyaka yengi mia nane kumi na nhwanu, na kubheleka bhana bhangi bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Enoshi akatami hyaka mia tisa na nhwanu, na akapotile.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Kenani paakatami hyaka sabini, akumbeliki Mahalaleli. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Paakumbeliki Mahalaleli, Kenani akatami hyaka yengi mia nane na alobaini, na kubheleka bhana bhangi bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Kenani akatami hyaka mia tisa na komi, na akapotile.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Mahalaleli paakabhi na hyaka sitini na nhwanu, akumbeliki Yaledi. <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Paakumbeliki Yaledi, Mahalaleli akatami hyaka yengi mia nane na selasini, na kubheleka bhana bhangi bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Mahalaleli akatami hyaka mia nane tisini na nhwanu, na akapotile.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Yaledi paakabhi na hyaka mia moja sitini na jibheli, akumbeliki Henoko. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Paakumbeliki Henoko, Yaledi akatami hyaka yengi mia nane, na kubheleka bhana bhangi bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Yaledi akatami hyaka mia tisa sitini na jibheli, na akapotile.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Henoko paakatami hyaka sitini na nhwanu, akumbeliki Metusela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Paakumbeliki Metusela, Henoko akabhi ndongwana kwaka Chapanga kwa hyaka mia tatu, na kubheleka bhana bhangi bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Henoko akatami hyaka mia tatu sitini na nhwanu. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Henoko akabhi ndongwana kwaka Chapanga, na akahobhike, maghambu Chapanga akuntolike.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Metusela paakatami hyaka mia moja semanini na saba, akumbeliki Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Paakumbeliki Lameki, Metusela akatami hyaka yengi mia saba semanini na jibheli, na kubheleka bhana bhangi bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Metusela akatami hyaka mia tisa sitini na tisa, na akapotile.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Lameki paakatami hyaka mia moja semanini na jibheli, akumbeliki mwana wa chikambaku. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Akundohiki lihina laki Nuhu, akapwaghaje, “Mwana ajoju nde joanatujeghala mtima kubhokana na lihengu litu lelinonwipi letulihenga kwa mabhoku ghitu, mu inchi ambaju Bambo Chapanga akajipeki masolu.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Paakabhelakiki Nuhu, Lameki akatami hyaka yengi mia tano tisini na nhwanu, na kubheleka bhana bhangi bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Lameki akatami hyaka mia saba sabini na saba, na akapotile.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Nuhu paakabhi na hyaka mia tano, akabhabheliki Shemu, Hamu na Yafeti.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s">Uhakau wa bhandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Chikahi bhandu pabhajonjukiki pundema na kubheleka bhana bha chimbomba, <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Chapanga bhakabhaweni akakamwali bha bhandu habha kubha nde bhanyahi, bhakabhatoliki bhala bhabhapala kubha bhahanu bhabhu. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Bambo Chapanga akapwaghike, “Roho jangu ngajipengani na mundu mileli, maghambu jombi nde wa kupotela pela. Bhela, machobha ghaki gha kutama anaghabya mia moja na ishilini.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Bhanefili bhakabhi pundema mu machobha ghanihagha, na pakalongi, bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Chapanga bhakaghonili na akakamwali bha bhandu na kubheleka nabhu. Bhanefili bhakabhi bhana makili na bhandu bhabhamanyakini bha mwande.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />Bambo Chapanga paakabhaweni kubha bhandu bhahenga kila ntundu wa mahakau pundema, na kubha kila lijambu lealiholalelala muntima waki nde lihakau pela machobha ghokapi. <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />Bambo akasikitiki namaa kwa kumbomba mundu pundema, na ukumbiniki namaa mtima waki. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />Bhela akapwaghike, “Ananumuyonanga mundu jonumbombiki panani ja ndema, papamu na hinyama ya muchitengu, ihumbi yeikwabha, na hijuni ya kunani. Nzikitika kwa kumbomba pundema.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Nambu Nuhu akapati chihomu pamihu jaka Chapanga.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Ayeyi nde ibheleku yaka Nuhu. Nuhu akabhi mundu joajetakaliwi palongi jaka Chapanga na ndongwana pachilanda ja bhandu bha chikahi chaki, Nuhu akatami matamu gha kunyambiha Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Nuhu akabhi na bhana bhatatu bha chikambaku, Shemu, Hamu na Jafeti. <verse eid="GEN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Chapanga akaweni kubha ndema utehi kuyonangeka na utweli uhakau ukolongwa. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Chapanga akaweni ntundu ndema mouyonangakile, maghambu kila mundu pundema akajengalili indela jaki jihakau.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Bhela Chapanga akumpwaghi Nuhu, “Ananabhayonanga bhandu bhokapi, maghambu ndema utweli uhakau kwa ndandi jabhu. Chakaka nepani ananabhayonanga bhandu papamu na ndema. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Bhela, ulilenganakya safina ngolongwa kwa mbau ya nkongu wa mvinje, ulenganakya yumba mkati jaki na ujipaka lami mkati na kunja. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Anana nde mowajilenganakyaje: Safina jibya na ulachu wa mikwamba mia tatu, upana waki mikwamba hamsini, na kinyoleka kwaki mikwamba selasini. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Safina jeniheji jibya ja gholofa itatu, na jibya na ndyangu punkeghi. Ujilenganakya unhwaghala, na ujileka mbekenyu ngati nusu nkwamba pachilanda ja nhwaghala na dali. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Lingalya, ananeta ghalika ja machi panani ja ndema, ananiyonanga kila chindu chechibhi na hyegha na mbomu ja womi, ngachikubha pundema. Kila chindu panani ja ndema anachipotilaje. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Nambu anameka lulaghilu lwangu na wehapa. Anaujingala mu safina, wehapa papamu na nhwanu waku, bhana bhaku na akabhahanu bhabhu. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Wijingiha mkati ja safina kila ntundu wa chiumbe, chikambaku na chimbomba, na kuighoha ibya yomi papamu na wehapa. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Wijingiha ihumbi ibheli ibheli kwa kila ntundu wa hijuni, kila ntundu wa hinyama, kila ntundu wa chiumbi chechikwabha paluhombi anaihika kwaku nahuli ighohakika kubha yomi. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Utola chilebhi cha kila ntundu chechilelakeka, ukabhonganaje, nachombi anachibya nde chilebhi chinu na chabhu.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Nuhu akahengiki ghokapi wichu ngati Chapanga moakundaghalakile.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s">Machi ghamaheli ghauyeka ndema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Nuhu, “Ujingala mkati ja safina wehapa papamu na bhana bhaku bhokapi, maghambu pachilanda ja bhandu bhokapi bhabhatama mu chibheleku chenjenu, nukuweni wehapa kanjika jaku nde undongwana palongi jangu. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Utolaje hinyama yokapi yeibhi inyahi, chikambaku na chimbomba, saba saba, nambu hinyama ihakau, utola chikambaku na chimbomba, ibheli ibheli. <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Bhelabhela utola hijuni ya kunani chikambaku na chimbomba, saba saba, nahuli kuilenda ibya yomi imbeju yabhu panani ja ndema wokapi. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Kwa ndandi paghipeta machobha saba, ananijitenda iyula kutonya pundema kwa machobha alobaini muhi na ikilu, na kila chiumbi chechibhi chomi chenichibhombiki panani ja ndema ananichiyonangaje.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Nuhu akahengiki ghokapi ngati Bambo moakundaghalakile.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Nuhu akabhi na hyaka mia sita chikahi ghalika pajapitalili panani ja ndema. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Nuhu na nhwanu waki, bhana bhaki na akabhahanu bhabhu bhakajingili mkati ja safina nahuli kujijepa ghalika. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Hinyama yeibhi inyahi, hinyama ihakau, hijuni na ihumbi yokapi yeikwabha panani ja ndema, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />ibheli ibheli, chimbomba na chikambaku, yakajingili mu safina papamu na Nuhu, ngati Chapanga moakundaghalaki Nuhu. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Paghapetiki machobha saba ghala, machi gha ghalika ghakatweli pundema.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Mu chaka cha mia sita cha matamu ghaka Nuhu, mwehi wa kabheli, lichobha la kumi na saba la mwehi ghonihoghu, lichobha leniheli chemichemi yokapi hata yeibhi pahi nakanopi ja luhombi yakapitiki kwa makili, na madilisha gha kunani kumahunde ghakahowike. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Iyula jakatonyiki panani ja ndema, machobha alobaini muhi na ikilu. <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Lichobha lelalela iyula pajitumbula kutonya, Nuhu na nhwanu waki, Shemu, Hamu na Yafeti, papamu na akabhahanu bhabhu, bhakajingili mkati ja safina. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Bhakajingi bhombi papamu na kila ntundu wa chinyama cha muchitengu, hinyama yeidimakika, hinyama yokapi yeikwabha na kila ntundu wa ijuni. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Na ihumbi yokapi yeibhi yomi yakahiki kwaka Nuhu ibheli ibheli, na kujingila mu safina. <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />Kila ntundu wa hinyama yakajingili chikambaku na chimbomba, ngati Chapanga moakundaghalaki Nuhu. Na panihapa Bambo akunjighali mkati.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Ghalika jakajendali kubha panani ja ndema kwa machobha alobaini. Machi ghakajonjukiki na kujijinula safina, na kujebhela panani ja ndema. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Machi ghakatwelili na kujonjukeka nakanopi panani ja ndema, na safina jakajebhili panani ja machi. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Machi ghakajonjukiki namaa kutwelela panani ja ndema, na kuiyeka itombi yokapi ilachu yeibhi pundema. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Machi ghakajendali kutwelela hata kuiyeka itombi kwa mikwamba kumi na nhwanu kujenda pahi. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Kila chiumbi chomi chekijenda panani ja ndema chakapotile: Hijuni, hinyama ya kudimakika, hinyama ya muchitengu, kila chiumbi chechikwabha panani ja ndema na bhandu bhokapi. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Kila chiumbi chechibhi na mbomu ja womi muimbuulu jaki chakapotile, na kila chechabhili panani ja ndema chakapotile. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Chapanga akayoningi kila chindu chechabhi chomi pundema: Bhandu, hinyama, ihumbi yeikwabha na hijuni ya kunani. Yokapi yakayonangike pundema. Nuhu pela nde joakahighalile papamu na bhala bhabhakabhi papamu naku mu safina. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Machi ghanihagha ghakajendali kutamakila panani ja ndema kwa machobha mia moja na hamsini.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s">Kujomalela kwa machi ghamahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Bhela, Chapanga akunkombwiki Nuhu, na hinyama yokapi ya muchitengu na hinyama ya kudimakika yeyakabhi papamu naku mkati ja safina. Chapanga akautendiki mpongu kupogha panani ja ndema, na machi ghakatumbwi kujomalela. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Chemichemi ya machi yeibhi pahi nakanopi ja ndema na madilisha gha kunani kumahunde ghakajighalike. Ihula jakahibhalike, <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />na machi ghakajendali kujomalela mbolimboli pundema. Paghapetiki machobha mia moja na hamsini, machi ghakajomali nakanope. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Mu lichobha la kumi na saba la mwehi wa saba, safina jakajemiki panani ja chitombi cha Alalati. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Machi ghakajendali kujomalela mbaka mwehi wa kumi, na lichobha la kutumbula la mwehi wa kumi, panani ja itombi pakabhonakine.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Paghapetiki machobha alobaini, Nuhu akalihowi lidilisha leakabhi alenganakile mu safina heji, <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />na kulipiha likongolu kunja, nalombi lakabhi ligholoka kola na kola mbaka machi paghajomalile panani ja ndema. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Bhela, Nuhu akajipihiki ngunda nahuli abhonaje ngati machi ghakabhi ghajomalile panani ja ndema. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Nambu kwa kubha machi ghakabhi ghakali ghayekiki ndema wokapi, ngunda heji ngachejapatiki pandu pa kumetela, bhela jakakelawiki kwaka Nuhu mkati ja safina. Nuhu akahatambwi chibhoku chaki, akajitoliki ngunda heji na kujikelabhuha mu safina. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Nuhu akalendalili kwa machobha ghangi saba, na kujipiha kabhete ngunda heji kuhuma mu safina. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Chikahi ngunda heji pajakelawiki kwaka Nuhu pakamihi, jakabhi na lihamba libhei mundomu waki. Bhela, Nuhu akamanyi kubha machi ghakabhi ghajomalile panani ja ndema. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Panihapa akalendalili kwa machobha ghangi saba, akajitumiki kabhete ngunda jela, nambu chikahi chenu ngunda ngachejakelawiki kabheti ng'o.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Mu lichobha la kutumbula la mwehi wa kutumbula la chaka cha mia sita na moja, la kutama kwaka Nuhu, machi ghakabhi ghajomalile pundema. Nuhu akayekwili mfuniku wa safina, na paakalingalili, akaweni kubha ndema ukabhi ujomike. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Mu lichobha la ishilini na saba la mwehi wa kabheli, inchi jakabhi jijomiki nakanope.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Panihapa Chapanga akumpwaghi Nuhu, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“Upitaje mu safina, wehapa papamu na nhwanu waku, bhana bhaku na akabhahanu bhabhu. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Kabhete upiha ihumbi yokapi yeibhi yomi yeibhi papamu na wehapa, hijuni, hinyama na ihumbi yokapi yeikwabha panani ja ndema, nahuli ikabhelakanaje na kujonjukeka na kuutwelakela kabhete ndema.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Bhela, Nuhu akapitiki mu safina papamu na nhwanu waki, bhana bhaki na akabhahanu bhabhu. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Hinyama yokapi na ihumbi yokapi yeikwabha panani ja ndema na hijuni yokapi, na kila chindu chechijenda panani ja ndema kwa ntundu waki, yakapitiki kuhuma mu safina.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu ambokeha Chapanga nyambiku ja kujochakeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Bhela Nuhu akunchengi Chapanga chihanja cha nyambiku, na kutola chinyama chimu mu kila ntundu wa hinyama yeibhi inyahi na ijuni yeibhi inyahi, na kumbokeha Chapanga nyambiku ja kujochakeka panani ja chihanja cha nyambiku. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Bambo akajowini unungilu unyahi wa kunyambiha, najombi akapwaghiki muntima waki, “Nganaupekehi masolu kabhete ndema kwa ndandi jaka mundu, maghambu manyi kubha maholalelu gha mtima waka mundu nde mahakau kutumbu umwana waki. Wala nganailapuli kabhete ihumbi yokapi ngati mondendile. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Henu kwa ntundu ndema moujendalela kubha, chikahi cha kupanda na kuhuna, chikahi cha imbepu na kupyopa, chikahi cha kungonde na kunkachi, muhi na ikilu, ngaikotoki ng'o.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga atenda lulaghilu na Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Chapanga akumpengalili Nuhu na bhana bhaki, akabhapwaghilaje, “Mbelakanaje na kujonjukeka, mkautwelakya ndema. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Kila chinyama cha pundema, hijuni yokapi ya kunani, ihumbi yokapi yeikwabha panani ja ndema na homba yokapi ya mubahali anayunjoghupa na kunhola mwehapa. Yokapi ibhekakiki pahi ja lujiniku lwinu. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Hinyama yokapi yeibhi yomi anaibya chilebhi chinu, ngati monakumpekihe makolu gha mahamba kubha chilebhi chinu, bhelabhela numpekeha na ayeyi yokapi. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Nambu ngamwikula chinyama chechibhi na mwahi ng'o, maghambu mwahi nde womi. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Chakaka mwahi wa womi winu ananundayaje. Ananundaya kuhuma kwa kila chinyama na kila mundu. Na mundu joanaankoma njaki, ananundaya womi waki. <verse eid="GEN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />Jokapi joanaajitala mwahi waka mundu, najombi mwahi waki anaujitalika na mundu, maghambu mundu akabhombakiki kwa ulenganesu waka Chapanga.<verse eid="GEN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />“Mwehapa, mbelakanaje na kujonjukeka, mbelakanaje pundema na kujonjukeka pundema.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Panihapa Chapanga akumpwaghi Nuhu na bhana bhaki, akapwaghaje, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />“Lingalya! Nepani meka lulaghilu lwangu na mwehapa, papamu na lubheleku lwinu baada jinu mwehapa, <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />na kila chiumbi chomi chechibhi papamu na mwehapa, hijuni, hinyama ya kudimakika na hinyama ya muchitengu, yokapi yeipita mu safina, na kila chiumbi chomi pundema. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Meka lulaghilu lwangu na mwehapa: Ihumbi yomi yokapi ngaiyonangeki kwa ghalika, wala ngajipitalili kabhete ghalika kuuyonanga ndema ng'o.” <verse eid="GEN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Kabhete Chapanga akapwaghike, “Hajeji nde nginyulila ja lulaghilu jemeka pachilanda jangu nepani na mwehapa na kila chiumbi chechibhi chomi papamu na mwehapa kwa ibheleku yokapi yeihika hata mileli. <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />Meka lusisi lwangu kumahunde, nalwombi analubya nginyulila ja lulaghilu pachilanda jangu nepani na ndema. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Kila panauyekaje ndema kwa mahundi gha iyula, na lusisi lwa ihula kubhonikana kumahunde, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />anangombukaje lulaghilu lwangu lomekiki pachilanda jangu nepani na mwehapa, na ihumbi yokapi yeibhi na womi. Machi ngaghikubhi kabhete ghalika ja kuyonanga ihumbi yokapi yeibhi na womi ng'o. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Chikahi chokapi lusisi lwa ihula palwibhonikanaje kumahunde, ananulubhonaje na kulukomboka lulaghilu loniholu lwa mileli pachilanda jangu nepani na ihumbi yokapi yeibhi na womi pundema.” <verse eid="GEN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Bhela Chapanga akapwaghike, “Hajeji nde nginyulila ja lulaghilu lomekiki pachilanda jangu nepani na ihumbi yokapi yeibhi na womi pundema.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu na bhana bhaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Bhana bhaka Nuhu bhabhapitiki mu safina bhakabhi Shemu, Hamu na Yafeti. Hamu akabhi tati waka Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Bhanihabha nde bhana bhatatu bhaka Nuhu, na kubhokana na bhanihabha bhandu bhakajendali kujonjukeka pundema pokapi.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Nuhu akabhi ndemi wa kutumbula, na akalemiki ngonda wa mizabibu. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Akanywi divai na kulobhela, bhela akaghonili heu mkati ja lihema laki. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Hamu, tati waka Kanaani, akauweni utopu waka tati waki, akapitiki kunja na kubhapwaghila bhalongu bhaki bhabheli. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Nambu Shemu na Yafeti bhakatoliki lishuka na kulibheka mumabhegha ghabhu bhokapi bhabheli, bhakajendiki chihanganyuma, na kuuyeka utopu waka tati wabhu. Bhakalingalili kunkeghi, wala ngachebhuweni utopu waka tati wabhu. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Nuhu paakapatiki malangu kuhuma mu kulobhela kwaki, akamanyi ntundu mwana waki nchoku moakuntendile. <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />Akapwaghike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">“Kanaani apata masolu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">Anaabya mtumwa wa pahi nakanope kwa bhalongu bhaki.”<verse eid="GEN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Kabhete akapwaghike, “Apengalikaje Bambo, Chapanga waka Shemu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanaani na abya mtumwa waka Shemu.<verse eid="GEN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Chapanga na ajonjukya malindakanilu ghaka Yafeti!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">Yafeti na atamaje na bhandu bhaka Shemu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">Na Kanaani abya mtumwa waka Yafeti.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Pajajomwiki ghalika Nuhu akatami hyaka mia tatu na hamsini. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Nuhu akatami hyaka mia tisa na hamsini, panihapa akapotile.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s">Ibheluku yaka Nuhu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:5-23">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 1:5-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Bhana bhaka Nuhu bhakabhi, Shemu, Hamu na Yafeti, ambabhu pajajomwiki ghalika bhakabheliki bhana bha chikambaku.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Yafeti bhakabhi, Gomeli, Magogu, Madai, Yavani, Tubali, Meshaki na Tilasi. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Gomeli bhakabhi, Ashikenazi, Lifati na Togama. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Yavani bhakabhi Elisha, Tashishi, Kitimu na Bhalodani. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Abhabha nde utumbulilu wa kujaghanila kwa bhandu pandu pa mumaheku na mchilu, kila bhandu kwa lukolu lwabhu, kwa lugha jabhu na kwa inchi yabhu.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Hamu bhakabhi Kushi, Misili, Putu na Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Kushi bhakabhi Seba, Havila, Sabuta, Laama na Sabuteka. Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Laama bhakabhi Sheba na Dedani. <verse eid="GEN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kushi akumbeliki Nimulodi, ambaju akabhi wa kutumbula kumanyikana kuwa makili ghaki. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Akabhi mwana makili kwa kubhenga hinyama palongi jaka Bambo. Nde ndandi bhandu bhapwagha, “Ngati Nimulodi, mwana makili kwa kubhenga hinyama palongi jaka Bambo.” <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Michi ja kutumbula ja utawala waki jakabhi Babeli, Eleki, Akadi na Kaline mu inchi ja Shinali. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Kuhuma ku inchi jeniheji akapiti ku Ashulu, ambaku akauchengiki muchi wa Ninawi, Leoboti Ili, na Kala, <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />na Leseni ghoubhi pachilanda ja Ninawi na Kala, ambau nde muchi ukolongwa.<verse eid="GEN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Misili akabhabheliki Bhaludi, Bhaanami, Bhalehabi, Bhanafutuhi, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />na Bhapatilusi, Bhakasiluhi, bhanihabha bhakakabhi nde utumbulilu wa Bhafilisti na Bhakafutoli.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Kanaani akumbeliki Sodoni, mwana waki wa kutumbula, na Hesi, <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />na Bhayebusi, Bhaamoli, Bhagiligashi, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />na Bhahivi, Bhaaliki, Bhasini, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />na Baalivadi, Bhasemali na Bhahamati. Palongi lukolu ya bhandu bha Kanaani lukaghatawanyike. <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />Malindakanilu gha Bhakanaani ghakajaghanili kuhuma ku Sidoni kujenda ku Gelali mbaka ku Gaza, na kujendalela upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa ku Sodoma na Gomola, ku Adima na ku Seboimu mbaka ku Lasha. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Abhabha nde bhabhelakeka bha chikambaku bhaka Hamu, kujengalanela na lukolu yabhu, lugha yabhu, mu inchi yabhu na mataifa ghabhu.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Shemu ambaju nde mbeli waka Yafeti, akabhi tati wa Bhaebulania bhokapi. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Shemu bhakabhi Elamu, Ashulu, Alifakisadi, Ludi na Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Alamu bhakabhi Usi, Huli, Geseli na Mashi. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Alifakisadi akumbeliki Sela, na Sela akumbeliki Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Ebeli akabhabheliki bhana bhabheli bha chikambaku: Wa kutumbula akalowakiki Pelegi maghambu chikahi chenihechi bhandu bha pundema bhakatei kughabhanika, na wa kabheli akalowakiki Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Yokitani akabhabheliki Alimodadi, Shelefu, Hasalimawesi, Yela, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Hadolamu, Uzali na Dikila, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obali, Abimaeli na Seba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ofili, na Havila na Yobabi. Abhabha bhokapi bhakabhi bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Bhandu bhanihabha bhakatami ku inchi ja Mesha mbaka ku Sefali ku inchi ja itombi, jejibhi upambala wa kolipita lyobha. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Bhanihabha nde bhana bhaka Shemu, kujengalanela na lukolu yabhu, lugha yabhu, mu inchi yabhu na mataifa ghabhu.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Hayeyi nde ibheleku yaka Nuhu, kujengalanela na ibheleku yabhu, mu mataifa ghabhu. Kubhokana na bhanihabha mataifa ghakajaghanili kundema wokapi kutumbu pajajomwiki ghalika.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s">Mnala wa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Kutumbula, bhandu bhokapi bha pundema bhakabhi na lugha jimu na bhakatumili malobhi ghalaghala. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Bhela, chikahi bhandu pabhakabhi bhajenda ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha, bhakajiweni inchi jejibhi na uwanda mu inchi ja Shinali, bhakatami konihoku. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Bhakapwaghanile, “Haya! Na tulenganakya matofale tukaghajocha kwa moto.” Bhakabhi na matofale pandu pa maganga, na lami pandu pa chokaa. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Bhela bhakapwaghike, “Haya! Na tulichengila muchi na mnala ambau kunani ja mnala hoghu anakuhika mbaka kunani kumahunde, nahuli tumanyikanaje, ngatwihika kupechangana pundema pokapi.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akahelili nahuli abhonaje muchi na mnala ghobhakabhi bhauchenga bhandu. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />Bambo Chapanga akapwaghike, “Lingalya, bhandu abhabha nde bhamu, na lugha jabhu nde jimu, na aghagha nde ghabhatumbula kughahenga, wala sajenu ngabhahibhalakiki lilobhi lokapi lebhaholalela kulihenga. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Haya, na tuhelala konihoku, tukabhachanganya lugha jabhu nahuli ngabhijongana malobhi bheni kwa bheni.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akabhapechangini kuhuma konihoku bhajendaje pundema pokapi, nabhombi bhakakotwiki kuuchenga muchi ghola. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Bhenibhela nde ndandi muchi ghonihoghu ukalowakiki Babeli, maghambu panihapa nde Bambo Chapanga paakajichanginyi lugha ja ndema wokapi. Na kuhuma konihoku Bambo Chapanga akabhapechangini bhandu bhajendaje pundema wokapi.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhabhelakeka bhaka Shemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:24-27">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 1:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Hayeyi nde ibheleku yaka Shemu. Hyaka ibheli kutumbu pajajomwiki ghalika, Shemu paakabhi na hyaka mia jimu, akumbeliki Alifakisadi. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Paakumbeliki Alifakisadi, Shemu akatami hyaka yengi mia nhwanu na kupata bhana bhangi bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Alifakisadi akatami hyaka semanini na nhwanu, na kumbeleka Sela. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Paakumbeliki Sela, Alifakisadi akatami hyaka yengi mia ncheche na jitatu na kupata bhana bhangi bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Sela akatami hyaka selasini, na kumbeleka Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Paakumbeliki Ebeli, Sela akatami hyaka yengi mia nchechi na jitatu na kupata bhana bhangi bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Ebeli akatami hyaka selasini na ncheche, na kumbeleka Pelegi. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Paakumbeliki Pelegi, Ebeli akatami hyaka mia nchechi na selasini na kupata bhana bhangi bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Pelegi akatami hyaka selasini, na kumbeleka Leu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Paakumbeliki Leu, Pelegi akatami hyaka yengi mia ibheli na tisa na kupata bhana bhangi bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Leu akatami hyaka selasini na ibheli, na kumbeleka Selugi. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Paakumbeliki Selugi, Leu akatami hyaka yengi mia ibheli na saba na kupata bhana bhangi bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Selugi akatami hyaka selasini, na kumbeleka Naholi. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Paakumbeliki Naholi, Selugi akatami hyaka yengi mia ibheli na kupata bhana bhangi bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Naholi akatami hyaka ishilini na tisa, na kumbeleka Tela. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Paakumbeliki Tela, Naholi akatami hyaka yengi mia jimu komi na tisa na kupata bhana bhangi bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Tela akatami hyaka sabini, na kubhabheleka Abulamu, Naholi na Halani.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhabhelakeka bhaka Tela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Hayeyi nde ibheleku yaka Tela. Tela akabhabheliki Abulamu, Naholi na Halani. Halani akumbeliki Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Halani akapotili chikahi Tela tati waki paakabhi atama ku inchi jeakabhelakike, yani mu inchi ja Ulu ja Bhakalidayo. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Abulamu na Naholi bhakatowile. Nhwanu waka Abulamu akalowakiki Salai, na lihina laka nhwanu waka Naholi akalowakiki Milika, mwali waka Halani, joakabhi tati waka Milika na Isika. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Salai akabhi ngulumba, ngacheakabhi na mwana.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Tela akuntoliki Abulamu mwana waki, Lutu nchokolu waki, joakabhi mwana waka Halani, na Salai nkowanu waki, na nhwanu waka Abulamu mwana waki, bhakabhokiki bhokapi kuhuma mu inchi ja Ulu ja Bhakalidayo, na kujenda ku inchi ja Kanaani. Nambu pabhakahikiki ku inchi ja Halani, bhakatami panihapa. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Tela akapotili ku inchi ja Halani, chikahi paakabhi na hyaka mia ibheli na nhwanu.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga andoha Abulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Abulamu, “Ubhokaje mu inchi jako, ubhalekaje bhandu bhako na nyumba jako, na ujendaje mbaka ku inchi jenakulangihaje. <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Nepani ananukutenda wehapa kubha litaifa likolongwa. Ananukupengalyaje, na kulitenda lihina laku libya likolongwa, nanau anaubya upengalelu.<verse eid="GEN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Ananabhapengalya bhala bhabhukupengalela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">na mundu jokapi joanaakupekya masolu, nanatu ananumpekya masolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">Na kupetela kwaku wehapa mataifa ghokapi gha pundema anaghapengalikaje.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Bhela Abulamu akabhokiki ngati Bambo Chapanga moakundaghalakile, najombi Lutu akabhokiki papamu naku. Abulamu akabhi na hyaka sabini na nhwanu chikahi paakabhokiki ku inchi ja Halani. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Abulamu akuntoliki nhwanu waki Salai, papamu na Lutu mwana waka ndongu wake, na hindu yokapi yebhakabhi nayu papamu na bhandu bhala bhaakabhapatiki ku inchi ja Halani hoku, bhakajendiki mbaka ku inchi ja Kanaani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 12:5">Pabhakahikiki ku Kanaani, <verse eid="GEN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Abulamu akapetiki pachilanda ja inchi jeniheji na kuhika mbaka ku Shekemu, pandu pahuhu, papabhi na nkongu wa mwaloni waka Mole. Chikahi chenihechi Bhakanaani bhakabhi bhatama mu inchi jeniheji. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Bambo Chapanga akumpitalili Abulamu, na kumpwaghila, “Ananabhapekya lubheleku lwaku inchi jenjenu.” Bhela, Abulamu akachengiki chihanja cha nyambiku kwa ndandi jaka Bambo joakumpitalile. <verse eid="GEN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Kuhuma konihoku Abulamu akapiti mbaka ku chitombi chekibhi upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa muchi wa Beseli, na kuchenga lihema laki, upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha ukabhi muchi wa Beseli, na muchi wa Ai upambala wa kolipita lyobha. Panihapa akunchengi Bambo chihanja cha nyambiku na kulobha kwa lihina laka Bambo. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Bhela, Abulamu akatendiki mwanja kujenda upambala wa kunkachi.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abulamu ku inchi ja Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Chikahi chenihechi jakapitali injala mu inchi ja Kanaani. Injala heji jakabhi ngolongwa namaa, bhela Abulamu ikampaliki kuhelela kujenda kutama ku inchi ja Misili kwa chikahi. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Paakabhi aheghalili kujingila mu inchi ja Misili, akumpwaghi Salai nhwanu waki, “Manyi kubha wehapa nde umbomba mnyahi kwa sula. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Chikahi Bhamisili pabhakubhonaje, anabhapwaghaje, ‘Ajoju nhwanu wake.’ Bhela nepani anabhangomaje, nambu wehapa anabhakuleka mwomi. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Chondi nukujopa upwagha kubha wehapa undombu wango, nahuli bhanhengila ghambone kwa ndandi jako, na matamu ghangu anaghajendalyaje kwa ndandi jako.” <verse eid="GEN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Bhela, Abulamu paakahikiki mu inchi ja Misili, Bhamisili bhakumbweni Salai kubha nde mbomba mnyahi namaa kwa sula. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Bhatumika bhaka Falao pabhakumbweni Salai, bhakundumbalili kwaka Falao. Bhela, Salai akatolakiki na kumpeleka mu nyumba jaka Falao. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Kwa ndandi jaka Salai, Falao akuntendi Abulamu ghambone, akumpekihi mambeleli, ng'ombi, maponda makambaku, bhatumika bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba, maponda mambomba na ngamia.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Nambu Bambo Chapanga akundapwili Falao na bhandu bhokapi bha munyumba jaki kwa chitamu chikolongwa kwa ndandi jaka Salai, nhwanu waka Abulamu. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Panihapa Falao akundohiki Abulamu, na kundalukila, “Bho, unhengi chindu bhole? Bho, maghambu kiki ngachewambwaghile kubha Salai nde nhwanu wako? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Bho, maghambu kiki ukapwaghiki, ‘Jombi nde ndombu wango,’ mbaka nakuntoliki na kubha nhwanu wango? Henu, nhwanu wako ajo apapa. Untolaje na ubhoka nako!” <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Panihapa Falao akabhalaghalaki bhandu bhaki, nabhombi bhakunhindaki Abulamu mwindela akabya na nhwanu waki, na kila chindu cheakabhi nachu.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s">Abulamu alekana na Lutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Bhela, Abulamu akakelawiki kuhuma ku Misili kujenda ku upambala wa Negebu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Negebu ndandi jaki nde kunkachi</char></note> Akabhi jombi na nhwanu waki na hindu yaki yokapi, papamu na Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Abulamu akabhi na hindu yamaheli namaa, akabhi na mambeleli, imbuhi na ng'ombi, na mbija na madini gha zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Akajendali na mwanja kuhuma ku Negebu mbaka ku muchi wa Beseli. Na akahikiki pandu paakabhekiki likambi pakutumbula hapa, pachilanda ja muchi wa Beseli na muchi wa Ai, <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />pandu ambapu akabhi achengiki chihanja cha nyambiku pakutumbula hapa. Panihapa Abulamu akalobhiki kwa lihina laka Bambo.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Bhelabhela Lutu joakapiti papamu na Abulamu, najombi akabhi na mapogha gha imbuhi, mambeleli, ng'ombi na mahema. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Ubhalangiku wa hinyama yabhu wakabhi ukolongwa namaa hata inchi jela ngachejaweziki kujaghanila Abulamu na Lutu kutama papamu. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Bhela, kukapitali kulochana pachilanda ja bhadima bhaka Abulamu na bhadima bhaka Lutu. Chikahi chenihechi, Bhakanaani na Bhapelizi nde bhabhakabhi bhenei bha inchi jeniheji.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Panihapa Abulamu akumpwaghi Lutu, “Ngakwikubha na kulochana pachilanda jaku wehapa na nepani, wala pachilanda ja bhadima bhangu na bhadima bhaku, maghambu tepani tabhalongo. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Bho, inchi jenjenu jokapi le ngachejibhi palongi jako? Chondi nukujopa tulekanaje. Anaupiti upambala wa kumangeja, nepani ananyenda upambala wa kumalelelu, na anaupiti upambala wa kumalelelu, nepani ananyenda upambala wa kumangeja.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Lutu akalingalili na kulibhona libondi lokapi la nkoka Yoludani, akaweni kubha libhi na machi ghamaheli, ngati Chijongu chaka Bambo na ngati inchi ja Misili upambala wa Soali. Mambu ghanihagha ghakahengakiki mangani Chapanga ngacheayoningi michi ja Sodoma na Gomola. <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Bhela, Lutu akahawili libondi lokapi la nkoka Yoludani, upambala wa kolipita lyobha, na panihapa bhakalekine. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Abulamu akatami mu inchi ja Kanaani, na Lutu akatami pachilanda ja michi ja libondi jela, na kuhamila na mahema ghaki pambipi na Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Nambu bhandu bha ku Sodoma bhakabhi bhahakau, na kuhenga namaa mahoku palongi jaka Bambo.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abulamu ahamila ku Hebuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Lutu paakalekini na Abulamu, Bambo akumpwaghi Abulamu, “Ubhoka kuhuma paubhi hapa ulingaje ipambala yokapi: Upambala wa Kunkachi, wa Kungonde, wa Kolipita lyobha na Kolijibhi lyobha. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Inchi jokapi jeujibhona ananukupekya wehapa na lubheleku lwaku hata mileli. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Lubheleku lwaku ananulutenda kubha lukolongwa ngati luhombi lwa ndema, ngati mundu aweza kulubhalanga luhombi lwa ndema, bhela bhela na lubheleku lwaku analubhalangikaje. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Ubhokaje, ukajendaje mu inchi ajeji kwa upana na ulachu waki, maghambu ananukupekya wehapa inchi jeniheji.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Panihapa Abulamu akabhohiki mahema ghaki, na kujenda kutama pambipi na mialoni ja Mamile ku Hebuloni hoku, na konihoku akunchengi Bambo Chapanga chihanja cha nyambiku.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s">Abulamu ankengalela Lutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Chikahi chenihechi, nkolongwa Amulafeli wa ku Shinali, nkolongwa Alioko wa ku Elasali, nkolongwa Kedolaoma wa ku Elamu, na nkolongwa Tidali wa ku Goimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />kwa papamu bhakapiti kukomana ngondo na Bela nkolongwa wa ku Sodoma, Bilisha nkolongwa wa ku Gomola, Shinabu nkolongwa wa ku Adima, Shemebeli nkolongwa wa ku Seboimu, na nkolongwa wa ku Bela, yani Soali. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Bhakolongwa bhahanu bha kujomukela habha bhakalombanishi manjolinjoli ghabhu ku libondi la Sidimu, yani Bahali ja Mwinyu. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Kwa chikahi cha hyaka komi na ibheli bhakabhi bhatawaliwa na nkolongwa Kedolaoma, nambu mu chaka cha komi na tatu bhakung'anambwike. <verse eid="GEN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Mu chaka cha komi na nchechi, nkolongwa Kedolaoma, na bhakolongwa bhabhakalombini naku bhakapiti kubhalapula Bhafelai ku inchi ja Ashitalosi Kanaimu, Bhazuzi mu inchi ja Hamu, Bhaemi mu inchi ja Shawe Kiliyasaimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />na Bhaholi mu inchi ja chitombi chabhu Seili, mbaka ku Eli Palani jejibhi pambipi na lipololu. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Bhela, bhakakelawiki kunyuma mbaka ku Eni Mishipati, yani Kadeshi, bhakajilapwi inchi jokapi ja Bhaamaleki papamu na Bhaamoli bhabhakabhi bhatama ku Hasasoni Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Panihapa nkolongwa wa ku Sodoma, na nkolongwa wa ku Gomola, na nkolongwa wa ku Adima, na nkolongwa wa ku Seboimu na nkolongwa wa ku Bela, yani Soali, bhakabhokiki kujenda kughapanga manjolinjoli ghabhu ku Libondi la Sidimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />nahuli bhakomanaje na Kedolaoma, nkolongwa wa ku Elamu, Tidali nkolongwa wa ku Goimu, Amilafeli nkolongwa wa ku Shinali na Alioko nkolongwa wa ku Elasali, yani bhakolongwa ncheche kwa bhakolongwa nhwanu. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Libondi la Sidimu lakabhi litweli mabhomba gha lami, bhela bhakolongwa bha Sodoma na Gomola pabhakabhi bhatila ngondo, bhakajibhili monihomu, nambu bhangi bhakatilili ku itombi. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Bhela, bhakolongwa ncheche bhala bhakatoliki hindu yokapi ya Sodoma na Gomola papamu na hilebhi yabhu yokapi, na kubhoka. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Bhelabhela bhakuntoliki mateka Lutu, mwana waka ndongu waka Abulamu papamu na hindu yaki yokapi, kwa ndandi akabhi atama ku Sodoma.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Mundu jumu joakatiliki, akapiti kumpekeha Abulamu Muebulania ubholu. Chikahi chenihechi Abulamu akabhi atama pambipi na mialoni ja Mamile, Mwamoli jola. Mamile akabhi ndongu waka Eshikoli na Aneli. Bhokapi abhabha bhakabhi bhajetanganile na Abulamu. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Abulamu paakajowini kubha mwana waka nung'una waki atolakiki mateka, akabhalohiki bhandu mia tatu komi na nane bha munyumba jaki bhabhakabhi bhabholakiki kukomana ngondo, na kubhajengalela bhakolongwa nchechi bhala mbaka ku Dani. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Chikahi cha ikilu Abulamu akabhaghabhiki bhandu bhaki mu mapogha nahuli abhalapulaje adui bhaki, akabhaweziki na kubhatopola mbaka ku muchi wa Hoba, ghoubhi upambala wa kungonde ja Damasko. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Bhela, Abulamu akakelawi hindu yokapi yeyatolakiki, akunkengali Lutu na hindu yaki, papamu na akambomba na bhandu bhangi.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Melekizedeki ampengalela Abulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Abulamu paakakelawiki kuhuma kundapula nkolongwa Kedolaoma na bhakolongwa bhabhakabhi papamu naku, nkolongwa wa ku Sodoma akabhokiki kujenda kunjopalela ku Libondi la Shawe, yani Libondi laka Nkolongwa. <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Bhela Melikizedeki nkolongwa wa ku muchi wa Salemu, ambaju akabhi mpenganyambiku waka Chapanga Joabhi Kunani Nakanope, akaletiki libumunda na divai. <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />Akumpengalili Abulamu, akapwaghaje, “Abulamu na apengalikaje na Chapanga Joabhi Kunani Nakanope, joabhombiki kunani na pundema! <verse eid="GEN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Alumbalikaje Chapanga Joabhi Kunani Nakanope, ambaju abhabhekiki maadui bhaku mu mabhoku ghaku!” Najombi Abulamu akumpeki Melikizedeki pandu pamu pa komi pa hindu yokapi yeakatoliki kungondo.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Nkolongwa wa ku Sodoma akumpwaghi Abulamu, “Umbekya bhandu bhanihabha, nambu hindu yokapi utola wamwete.”<verse eid="GEN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Nambu Abulamu akumpwaghi nkolongwa wa ku Sodoma, “Napa kwaka Bambo, Chapanga Joabhi Kunani Nakanope, joabhombiki kunani na ndema, <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />kubha nganitoli uzi wala ngoji wa kukongela lugubasi laku, wala chokapi chechibhi chaku, ngawihika kulilumbalila na kupwagha, ‘Nuntendiki Abulamu kubha na hindu yamaheli.’ <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Nganyopi chokapi, nambu chela pela chebhakuliki bhandu bhangu na pandu ambapu nde lifungu la bhandu bhabhapiti papamu na nepani, ambabhu nde Aneli, Eshikoli na Mamile. Bhombi na bhapekiwaje lifungu labhu.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga atenda lulaghilu na Abulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Paghapetiki mambu ghanihagha, lilobhi laka Chapanga lakunhiki Abulamu mu mabhono, lakapwaghaje, “Ngawijoghopa! Abulamu! Nepani nde ngau jaku. Nhupu jaku anajibya ngolongwa namaa.”<verse eid="GEN 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Nambu Abulamu akapwaghike, “Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, bho, anaumbekya kike na nepani ngachemi na mwana, na joanapwelilaje nyumba jangu nde Eliezeli wa ku Damasko?” <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Abulamu akajendali kupwagha, “Lingalya! Ngacheumbeki mwana, na mtumika joabhelakiki munyumba jangu nde joanakubha mpwelelu wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Bhela, lilobhi laka Bambo lakunhiki Abulamu lakapwaghaje, “Mundu ajoju ngaikubhi mpwelelu waku ng'o, nambu mwana joanaapitaje mu chibhunu chaku nde joanakubha mpwelelu waku wehapa.” <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Panihapa Chapanga akundetiki Abulamu kunja na kumpwaghila, “Ulingalyaje kunani kumahunde na ubhalanga ndondwa, ngati anauweza kuibhalanga. Bhenibhela nde bhabhelakeka bhaku mobhibhelila bhamaheli.”<verse eid="GEN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Abulamu akunhobhali Bambo, na Bambo akumbalangili lijambu lenu kubha ajetakaliwi palongi jaki.<verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Kabhete akumpwaghile, “Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, nenukuletiki kuhuma ku Uli, muchi wa Bhakalidayo, nahuli nukupekya inchi jenjenu ujipwelilaje.”<verse eid="GEN 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Nambu Abulamu akapwaghike, “Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, anamanya bhole kubha anambwelilaje inchi jenjeno?”<verse eid="GEN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Panihapa Bambo akumpwaghi Abulamu, “Unetilaje litoli limbomba la hyaka itatu, na imbuhi jimbomba ja hyaka itatu, na limbelele likambaku la hyaka itatu, na ngunda na injebha.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Abulamu akundetili Bambo hinyama yeniheyi yokapi, akaighangiki ipandi ibheli, na kuibheka ipandi heyi kulengana na chijaki, nambu hijuni ngacheaghangike. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Bhela ngwahe yakametili panani ja inyama heyi, nambu Abulamu akaitopwile.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Lyobha palakabhi lijibhila, Abulamu lwakunkamwi lughono lukolongwa, lubhendu lukolongwa na lwa kujoghoha lukatehi kumuyeka. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Abulamu, “Chakaka umanyaje kubha lubheleku lwaku analukubha lugheni ku inchi ambaju nga jabho, anabhakubha bhatumwa na kung'ahakika kwa chikahi cha hyaka mia ncheche. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Nambu hata bhela, ananilitemulaje litaifa lela lebhalitumakyaje, pakujomukela anabhabhokaje konihoku bhakabya na hindu yamaheli. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Nambu wehapa wamwete anautamaje kwa hyaka yamaheli, na kupotela na kutaghakika kwa lukwale. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Bhabhelakeka bhaku anabhakelabhukaje pambani mu chibheleku cha kacheche, maghambu mahoku gha Bhaamoli ghakali ngacheghatwelili chipemu chake.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Chikahi lyobha palakabhi lijibhili na lubhendu kujingila, mvune ghouhuka lyohi na lumuli lolubhele moto yakapetiki pachilanda ja ipandi ya hinyama yela. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Lichobha leniheli Bambo Chapanga akatendiki lulaghilu na Abulamu, na kumpwaghila, “Lubheleku lwaku nabhapekihi inchi janjenu, kutumbula nkoka wa Misili mbaka ku nkoka ukolongwa wa Eufulate, <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />yani inchi ja Bhakeni, Bhakenizi, na Bhakadimoni, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />na Bhahiti, Bhapelizi, na Bhalefai, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />na Bhaamoli, Bhakanaani, Bhagiligashi na Bhayebusi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s">Hajili na Ishimaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Bhela Salai nhwanu waka Abulamu, akabhi akali ngacheambelaki ndomi waki mwana. Nambu akabhi na mtumika wa chimbomba wa ku Misili, lihina laki akalowakiki Hajili. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Salai akumpwaghi Abulamu, “Umanyi kubha Bambo ngacheanyangatili kupata mwana. Untolaje Hajili mtumika wangu wa chimbomba, pangi nhweza kupata bhana kwaki.” Abulamu akaghajetakili malobhi ghaakalongi Salai. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Bhela, Abulamu paakatami mu inchi ja Kanaani hyaka komi, Salai akuntoliki mtumika waki wa chimbomba wa ku Misili, yani Hajili na kumpekeha Abulamu ndomi waki, abya nhwanu wake. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Abulamu akaghonili na Hajili, najombi Hajili akapatiki chitumbu. Nambu chikahi pela Hajili paakamanyi kubha abhi na chitumbu, akatumbwili kulilumbalila na kumpoha lihamu Salai.<verse eid="GEN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Panihapa Salai akumpwaghi Abulamu, “Uhakau ghonupata na ubya panani jaku wehapa. Nepani nakukupekihi mtumika wangu, sajenu kwa kubha amanyi kubha abhi na chitumbu, amboha lihamu nepani. Bambo Chapanga na atemulaje pachilanda jaku wehapa na nepani!”<verse eid="GEN 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Abulamu akumpwaghi Salai, “Mtumika waku abhi pahi ja lujiniku lwaku. Untendilaje lijambu lokapi lela leubhona kubha nde lambone nakanope.” Bhela, Salai akung'ahiki Hajili mbaka akatilike.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Mtumika wa kunani waka Bambo Chapanga akumbweni Hajili pambipi na chemichemi ja machi kulipololu hoku, chemichemi jejibhi ku indela jejijenda ku muchi wa Shuli. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Mtumika waka Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Hajili, mtumika waka Salai, uhuma kwako, na ujenda kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Hajili akayangiki, “Nepani nuntila mbuja wangu Salai.”<verse eid="GEN 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Panihapa mtumika wa kunani waka Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Ukelabhukaje kwaka mbuja waku Salai na ukaliheliyaje na kumtii.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Mtumika wa kunani waka Bambo Chapanga jola akajendali kupwagha, “Ananyonjukya bhabhelakeka bhaku hata ngabhiwezi kubhalangika kwa ntundu mobhijolukyaje.” <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Kabhete mtumika wa kunani waka Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Wehapa sajenu ubhi na chitumbu, na anaubhelakaje mwana wa chikambaku. Wandoha lihina laki Ishimaeli, maghambu Bambo Chapanga ajowini chilelu cha mang'ahiku ghaku. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Ishimaeli anaakubha ngati liponda la muchitengu pachilanda ja bhandu, anaakubha adui waka kila mundu, na kila mundu anaakubha adui waki. Najombi anaatamaje kwa kuhakalanila na bhalongu bhaki bhokapi.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Bhela, Hajili akumpeki Bambo Chapanga lihina aleli, “Wehapa nde Chapanga weubhona,” kwa ndandi akapwaghiki, “Sajenu numbweni jombi joamona nepani.” <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Bhela chilibha chenihechi chakalowakiki Beel Lahai Loi. Chilibha chenihechi chakali chibhile pachilanda ja Kadeshi na Beledi mbaka lalenu.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Hajili akumbelakili Abulamu mwana wa chikambaku, na Abulamu akundohiki mwana hoju lihina laki Ishimaeli. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Abulamu akabhi na hyaka semanini na sita chikahi Hajili paakumbeliki Ishimaeli.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s">Lulaghilu na jando</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Chikahi Abulamu paakabhi na hyaka tisini na tisa, Bambo akumpitalili Abulamu, na kumpwaghila, “Nepani nde Chapanga Mwene Makili, ujengalyaje indela jangu na utamaje matamu gha ulongwana. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Nanatu anandendaje lulaghilu pachilanda jangu na wehapa, nanatu ananukujonjukya bhabhelakeka bhaku nakanope.” <verse eid="GEN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Abulamu akajinimi ukutama, na Chapanga akumpwaghile, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />“Nepani ndenda lulaghilu alolu na wehapa: Wehapa anaukubha tati wa mataifa ghamaheli. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />Lihina laku ngawilohakeki kabheti Abulamu, nambu lihina laku anaulowakika Ibulahimu, maghambu nukutendiki wehapa kubha tati wa mataifa ghamaheli. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Ananukutendaje ubya na lubheleku lwamaheli namaa, ananukutenda kubha mataifa, na bhakolongwa anabhapita kuhuma kwaku wehapa.<verse eid="GEN 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />“Ananulutenda lulaghilu lwangu kutamakila mileli pachilanda jangu na wehapa, na bhabhelakeka bhaku, na ibheleku yabhu, anamya Chapanga waku na Chapanga wa bhabhelakeka bhaku. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Inchi jokapi ja Kanaani, koutama sajenu ngati ungeni, ananukupekya wehapa jibya jaku mileli, na lubheleku lwaku, nanatu anamya Chapanga wabhu.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Bhela, Chapanga akumpwaghi Ibulahimu, “Kwa upambala waku ikupalika kukamula lulaghilu lwangu, wehapa na bhabhelakeka bhaku kwa ndandi ja ibheleku yeihika. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Londoni nde lulaghilu lwangu lowalukamulaje, pachilanda jangu nepani na wehapa, na lubheleku lwaku baada jaku wehapa: Kila mwanalomi pachilanda jinu anaimpalika kuheketa jando. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Anaimpalika kuheketwa jando, na lijambu aleli analibya nginyulila ja lulaghilu pachilanda jangu nepani na mwehapa. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Kwa ibheleku yeanaihikaje, kila mwana wa chikambaku pachilanda jinu joabhi na machobha nane anaimpalika kuheketa jando. Kila mwanalomi mu ibheleku yinu, akubhi mbelakeka wa munyumba au joahemaliki kwa mbija kuhuma kwaka ngeni, jola ambaju nga mbelakeka wako. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Akubhi abhelakiki munyumba jaku au ahemaliki kwa mbija jaku, anaimpalika kuheketa jando. Lulaghilu lwangu mu hyegha yinu analukubha lulaghilu lwa mileli. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Kila mwanalomi jwangakuheketa jando anaatengakika na bhandu bhaki, maghambu anaabya ahekiti lulaghilu lwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Kabhete Bambo akumpwaghi Ibulahimu, “Kwa upambala waka nhwanu waku Salai, ngawandohi kabhete lihina laki Salai, nambu lihina laki analowakika Sala. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Ananumpengalyaje, na ananukupekya mwana kwake, ena, ananumpengalya Sala, najombi anaakubha mabhu wa mataifa ghamaheli, na bhakolongwa bha makabila gha bhandu anabhapita kwake.”<verse eid="GEN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Ibulahimu akachikimi ukutama, akahekiki na kupwagha muntima waki, “Bho, iwezikana le mundu wa hyaka mia jimu kubheleka mwana? Bho, na Sala joabhi na hyaka tisini le aweza kubheleka mwana?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Panihapa Ibulahimu akumpwaghi Chapanga, “Anangati Ishimaeli najombi akashiliki mbengalelu jaku!”<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Bhela Chapanga akayangike, “Ngabhela! Nambu nhwanu waku Sala anaakubhelakya mwana wa chikambaku, nanau wandoha lihina laki Isaka. Nanatu anandenda lulaghilu lwangu lutamakyaje kwaki kubha lulaghilu lwa mileli kwa ndandi jaki na babhelakeka bhaki bhabhihikaje. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Kwa upambala waka Ishimaeli nukujowine, ananumpengalyaje, na ananuntenda akubha na lubheleku lwamaheli na ananunjonjukyaje namaa ubhalangiku waki. Anaakubha tati wa bhatawala komi na bhabheli, nanatu ananuntendaje akubha litaifa likolongwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Nambu lulaghilu lwangu lola ananulutenda kutamakila kwaka Isaka, ambaju Sala anaakubhelakyaje mu chaka chechihika mu chikahi ngati chenjeno.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Bhela, Chapanga paakajomwi kulongela na Ibulahimu, akabhokike kuhuma kwaka Ibulahimu.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Mu lichobha lela lela, Ibulahimu akuntoliki mwana waki Ishimaeli na bhokapi bhabhabhelakiki munyumba jaki papamu na bhabhahemaliki kwa mbija yake, kila mwanalomi wa munyumba jaki, akabhahekiti jando, ngati Chapanga moakumpwaghile. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Chikahi Ibulahimu paakahekitwi jando, akabhi na hyaka tisini na tisa. <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Na mwana waki Ishimaeli akabhi na hyaka komi ja itatu chikahi paakahekitwi jando. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Ibulahimu na mwana waki Ishimaeli bhakahekitwi jando mu lichobha lela lela. <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />Kila mwanalomi munyumba jaka Ibulahimu, papamu na bhokapi bhabhabhelakiki munyumba jaki au bhabhahemaliki kwa mbija yaki kuhuma kwaka ngeni, bhakahekitwi jando papamu naku.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s">Chilanga chaka mwana kwaka Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Bambo Chapanga akumpitali Ibulahimu pambipi na mialoni ja Mamile, chikahi paakabhi atami pundyangu wa lihema laki chikahi cha kupyopa cha muhe. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />Ibulahimu paakajinwi mihu ghaki, akabhaweni bhandu bhatatu bhajemiki palongi jaki. Pala pala akakembili imbelu kuhuma pundyangu wa lihema laki na kujenda kubhajopalela. Na paakabhahikili akachikimi ukutama, <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />na kupwagha, “Bambo bhangu, nepani nuntumika wino. Chondi nunjopa ngamwimbeta, nambu nhwika kwangu. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Anabhundetila machi machokopi nahuli nchamba magholu ghinu, na mpomulyaje pahi ja nkongu aghoghu. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Nyetakalyaje nundetila chilebhi kichokopi nkulaje, nahuli mpata makili gha kujendalela na mwanja winu, maghambu nhwikiki kwaka mtumika winu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Nabhombi bhakayangike, “Ena, uhenga ngati moupwaghile.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Panihapa Ibulahimu akajombatiki kujingila mulihema laka Sala, na kupwagha, “Utola kilu komi na sita ya uhembi unyahi, ukandaje na ulenganakya mabumunda manyata.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Kabhete Ibulahimu akakembili kujenda ku lipogha la ng'ombi na kuhaghula litoli linyahi, lelinenipe na kumpekeha mtumika waki, najombi akajombatiki kujenda kuchinja na kuteleka. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Panihapa Ibulahimu akatoliki siagi na mahibha, na inyama jela jejaandaliwe, na kuibheka palongi ja bhaghene. Pabhakabhi bhakula, Ibulahimu akajemiki pambipi nabhu kubhatumakila pahi ja nkongo.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Bhagheni bhala bhakundalukile, “Bho, nhwanu waku Sala abhi kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Ibulahimu akayangike, “Abhi kola, mkati ja lihema.”<verse eid="GEN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Panihapa Bambo akapwaghike, “Chakaka anangelabhuka kabhete kwaku mu chikahi ngati chenjenu mu chaka chechihika, na nhwanu waku Sala anaabya na mwana wa chikambako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Sala akabhi abhajowanela kundyangu wa lihema lelakabhi kunyuma jake. <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Ibulahimu na Sala bhakabhi bhasejike, na bhakabhi bhakongapile, na Sala akabhi akotwiki mambu gha ntetu wa akambomba. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Bhela, Sala akahekiki chumuntima waki, akapwaghaje, “Nepani ngongapili anana, na ndomi wangu asejike, bho, ananhweza le kuhekalela lijambu alele?”<verse eid="GEN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Ibulahimu, “Bho, maghambu kiki Sala atehi kuheka na kupwagha, ‘Bho, nepani le nhweza kupata mwana, koni nzejike?’ <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Bho, kubhi le na lijambu lokapi lela langakuwezikana kwaka Bambo? Anangelabhuka kabhete mu chikahi ngati chenjenu mu chaka chechihika, na Sala anaapata mwana wa chikambako.”<verse eid="GEN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Bhela Sala akatehi kujoghopa maghambu akatehi kukoloha, na kupwagha, “Nepani ngachenahekike.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">Nambu Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Ena, ukahekike.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibulahimu aulobhela muchi wa Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Bhela bhandu bhanihabha bhakabhokiki konihoku, na kulingalila mihu ghabhu ku muchi wa Sodoma, najombi Ibulahimu akabhokiki papamu nabhu nahuli kubhahindakila. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akapwaghike, “Bho, nunhiya le Ibulahimu lijambu lembangiki kulihenga? <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Chakaka Ibulahimu anaakubha litaifa likolongwa na lelibhi na makili, na kupetela kwaki mataifa ghokapi gha pundema anaghapengalikaje. <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Maghambu nunhawi jombi nahuli abhalonguhaje bhana bhaki na bhandu bha munyumba jaki kumtii Bambo, bhabya bhalongwana na kuhenga ghambone, nahuli Bambo atimizaje chilanga chaki kwaka Ibulahimu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Panihapa Bambo Chapanga akapwaghike, “Kwa kubha chilelu kwa muchi wa Sodoma na Gomola chitehi kujonjukeka, na mahoku ghabhu ghajonjukiki nakanope, <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />bhela, ananhelalaje sajenu nahuli monaje ngati ghabhaghahenga hagha nde chipemu cha chilelu chechinhikile, na ngati ngabhela, anamanyaje.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Panihapa bhandu bhanihabha bhakabhokiki panihapa na kujenda ku Sodoma, nambu Ibulahimu akabhi akali ajemiki palongi jaka Bambo. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Bhela, Ibulahimu akunheghali Bambo na kumpwaghila, “Bho, anaubhayonanga le bhandu bhabhajetakaliwi palongi jaku papamu na bhandu bhahakau? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Bho, ngati anakubhi na bhandu bhabhajetakaliwi palongi jaku hamsini mu muchi ghonihoghu, chakaka le anauyonanga muchi wokapi na wala ngawauleki kwa ndandi ja bhandu bhabhajetakaliwi palongi jaku hamsini habha bhabhabhi monihomo? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Ngawihenga bhenibhela, kubhakoma bhandu bhabhajetakaliwi palongi jaku papamu na bhahakau, kubhahengela bhabhajetakaliwi palongi jaku kulengana na bhahakau. Ngabhela! Bho, Mtemula wa ndema wokapi le ngayihengi lelipalika palongi jaki?”<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Bambo Chapanga akapwaghike, “Ngati anambatiki bhandu bhabhajetakaliwi palongi jangu hamsini mu muchi wa Sodoma, ananuleka muchi ghonihoghu wokapi kwa ndandi jabhu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Panihapa Ibulahimu akapwaghiki kabhete, “Sajenu nepani mi na ukangamalu wa kulongela na Bambo, hata ngati nepani nde luhombi na ilihu pela. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Bho, ngati anabhakepiki bhandu nhwanu mu bhandu hamsini, anauyonanga le muchi wokapi maghambu bhakepiki bhandu nhwano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">Bambo akayangike, “Ngati ananabhahimani bhandu alobaini na nhwanu bhabhajetakaliwi palongi jangu mu muchi ghonihoghu, nganauyonange.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Ibulahimu akajonjuki kabhete kupwagha, “Bho, ngati anabhapatakini bhandu alobaini pela?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Bambo akayangike, “Kwa ndandi ja bhandu alobaini habha, nganauyonange.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Ibulahimu akapwaghike, “Chondi Bambo nukujopa ngawihakalila, nambu uneka nongila kabhete. Bho, ngati anabhapatakini bhandu selasini pela konihoko?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Bambo akayangike, “Nganauyonangi muchi ghonihoghu ngati anabhapatakini bhandu selasini konihoko.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Ibulahimu akapwaghike, “Sajenu kwa kubha mi na ukangamalu nakanopi wa kulongela na Bambo, bho, ngati anabhapatakini bhandu bhambone ishilini pela konihoko?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Bambo akayangike, “Kwa ndandi ja bhandu bhambone ishilini habha, nganauyonange.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Ibulahimu akapwaghike, “Chondi Bambo, nukujopa ngawiyoma, nambu uneka nongilaje mala punkamu pela. Bho, ngati anabhapatakini bhandu bhambone komi pela konihoko?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Bambo akayangike, “Kwa ndandi ja bhandu bhambone komi habha, nganauyonange.” <verse eid="GEN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Bhela Bambo paakajomwili kulongela na Ibulahimu, akabhokike, najombi Ibulahimu akakelawiki kunyumba jake.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s">Mahoku gha bhandu bha ku Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Bhatumika bha kunani kumahundi bhabheli bhala bhakahikiki ku muchi wa Sodoma chikahi cha pakamihe. Na Lutu akabhi atami pundyangu wa kujingalila mu muchi wa Sodoma. Chikahi paakabhaweni, akabhokiki kujenda kubhajopalela na kuchikama na jinama mbaka pahi. <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />Lutu akapwaghike, “Bambo bhangu, chondi nunjopa njingalaje munyumba jaka mtumika winu. Muweza kuchamba magholu ghinu na kughonela pambani na lukela pachibhombu kujendalela na mwanja wino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Nambu bhombi bhakayangike, “Ngabhela, tepani anatughonila palubhanja pani ikilu jokapi.”<verse eid="GEN 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Nambu Lutu akabhapembalaki namaa, nabhombi bhakapiti na kujingila munyumba jake. Lutu akabhaandali chilebhi, akabhatelaki mabumunda ghangakujeghaleka amila, na bhakakulike.<verse eid="GEN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Nambu mangani ja kujenda kughonela, bhandu bhokapi kuhuma mu muchi wa Sodoma, bhakajiyongalwiti nyumba jaka Lutu, akakombu kwa bhazee, bhandu bhabhakahumiki ku ipambala yokapi. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Bhakundohiki Lutu bhakapwaghaje, “Bho, bhabhi kwako bhandu bhala bhabhahikiki kwako ikilu jeno? Ubhapiha kwitu, nahuli tughonila nabhu kihyegha.”<verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Lutu akapitiki kunja kubhonana nabhu, na kujighila ndyangu kunyuma jake. <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />Lutu akapwaghike, “Ngabhela, bhakochi bhangu, ngamwihenga lijambu aleli lihakau. <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Lingalya, nepani mi na akamwali bhabheli ambabhu ngachebhalabhali kughonela na mwanalomi kihyegha. Nunjopa nyetakalya nabhapiha kwino, nanamu muweza kubhahengela lijambu lokapi lemulipala. Nambu ngamwihenga lijambu lokapi lela kwa bhandu abhabha, maghambu bhombi nde bhagheni bhango.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Nambu bhombi bhakayangike, “Ubhoka pambane! Wehapa ungeni pa muchi ghongone. Ngacheikupalika kutupwaghila tepani chetupalika kuchihenga. Ulilingalyaje, maghambu tuweza kukuhengela wehapa mahakau kupeta bhombe.” Panihapa bhakunkangiki Lutu kunyuma na kujendalela kulongi nahuli kubhombola ndyango. <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Nambu bhandu bhabheli bhabhakabhi munyumba bhala bhakahowi ndyandu na kuhatambula mabhoku ghabhu, na kumhutila Lutu mkati na kujighila ndyango. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Panihapa bhakabhalapwi bhandu bhabhakabhi pundyango bhala kwa ungalola, bhachoku kwa bhakolongwa, hata bhakang'ahakiki kuulonda ndyango, na kulepalela kuubhona.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lutu abhoka ku Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Bhandu bhabheli bhala bhakumpwaghi Lutu, “Bho, ubhi na mundu jongi nakanopi pambane? Ngati, akaakowanu bhaku, akakombu bhaku, akakamwali bhaku au mundu jongi jokapi jola mu muchi ghongone? Ubhabhohaje mu muchi ghongone, <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />maghambu tepani anatupayonanga pandu pambane. Chilelu kwaka Bambo Chapanga kwa ndandi ja bhandu bha pambane nde chikolongwa nakanope, najombi Bambo atutumiki tupayonangaje.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Bhela, Lutu akapiti kulongela na akaakowanu bhaki, bhabhakabhi bhabhoki chilipa bhana bhaki bha chimbomba, akapwaghaje, “Ntendaje manyata mbokanyaje pandu pambane, maghambu Bambo anauyonangaje muchi ghongone.” Nambu bhombi bhakaholaki kubha Lutu ahenga utane.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Pakwahiki lukela pachibhombu, bhatumika bha kunani kumahundi bhala bhakunjomalaki Lutu, bhakapwaghaje, “Ubhokaje, untola nhwanu waku, na akakamwali bhaku bhabheli bhabhabhi pambane, nanga bhela anauyonangikaje chikahi muchi ghongoni pawiyonangikaje.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Lutu paakabhi akabhakila, bhandu bhala bhakunkamwi Lutu chiwoku, na chiwoku chaka nhwanu waki, na mabhoku gha bhana bhaki bhabheli bha chimbomba, na kubhalongoha lukwale kunja ja muchi, maghambu Bambo akabhabhoni chiha namaa. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Pabhakajomwi kubhapiha kunja ja muchi, mtumika jumu wabhu wa kunani kumahunde akabhapwaghile, “Ntilaje kwa lukwale lwinu! Ngamwilinga kunyumba, wala ngamwijema pandu pokapi mu libondi. Ntililaje kuitombi, nanga bhela anamyonangikaje.”<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Nambu Lutu akabhayangike, “Ngabhela, chondi akabambo ngamwihenge bhenibhela. <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Lingalya, mtumika winu mmonili chiha palongi ja mihu ghinu, nanamu ndangihi wamboni ukolongwa kwangu nepane kwa kukengalela matamu ghango. Nambu ngachenhweza kutilila kuchitombi, lijambu aleli analimbataje, nanatu anambotilaje. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Lingalya, kola kubhi na muchi uchoku ambau nhweza kutilila konihoku maghambu ubhi pambipe. Nyetakalyaje ndilila konihoku, nawombi nde muchi uchoku namaa, mbona uchoku pela? Konihoku nhweza kulama.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Mtumika wa kunani kumahundi jola akumpwaghile, “Ena, nyetakile lilobhu lako. Nganauyonangi muchi hoghu ghoupwaghike. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Nambu ujombatikaje, utilila konihoku manyata, maghambu ngachenhweza kuhenga lijambu lokapi lela mbaka pawihika ku muchi ghonihogho.” Nde ndandi muchi ghonihogho ukalowakiki Soali.<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyonangeka kwa Sodoma na Gomola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Chikahi lyobha palakabhi lipita, Lutu akabhi ahikiki ku muchi wa Soali. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Panihapa Bambo akajitendiki ihula ja moto ukali na maganga woujaka wa bhaluti kutonya panani ja Sodoma na Gomola, kuhuma kunani kwaka Bambo. <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />Bhela, akajiyoningi michi jeniheji na libondi lokapi, papamu na bhandu bhokapi bhabhatamika mu muchi ghonihogho, na kila chindu chechameliki mu michi jeniheje. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Nambu paakabhi mwindela nhwanu waka Lutu akang'anambwiki kunyuma, na akabhi nguzu ja mwinyo.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Lukela pachibhombo mu lichobha lelijengalyaje, Ibulahimu akapiti pandu paakabhi ajemike palongi jaka Bambo. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Akalingalili upambala wa ku Sodoma na Gomola, na pandu pokapi pa libondi, akaweni lyohi likolongwa lakakwelaje kuhuma pa inchi, lyohi ngati la mvuni ukolongwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Chapanga paakajiyoningi michi ja kulibondi koakabhi atama Lutu, akunkombwiki Ibulahimu kwa kumboha Lutu kuhuma mu michi jeniheji, nahuli Lutu ngaiyonangeka papamu naju.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutumbula kwa Bhaamoli na Bhamoabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Lutu na akakamwali bhaki bhabheli bhakabhokiki ku Soali na kujenda kutama kuchitombi, maghambu akajowipi kutama ku muchi wa Soali. Akatami mu limbako, jombi papamu na akakamwali bhaki bhabheli. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Lichobha limu mwali waki nkolongwa akumpwaghi nchoku jola, “Atati witu asejike, na njeta mwanalomi jongi pandu pambane joanahimangana na tepani kihyegha, ngati moubheli ntetu wa pandu pokapi pundema. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Haya, tunkenga atati witu divai, ikale na tughonila naku, nahuli kulenda lubheleku lwitu kupetela atati witu.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Ikilu jela bhakunkengiki atati wabhu divai ikale, paakalobhile mwali waki nkolongwa akajingili na kughonela na atati waki. Nambu atati waki ngacheakamanyi chikahi mwali waki paakajingili kughonela naku wala paakabhokike.<verse eid="GEN 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Lichobha lelijengalyaje, mwali waki wa kutumbula akumpwaghi nchoku jola, “Lichu ikilu nepani nakaghonili na atati wangu, lalenu tunkenga divai ikalekabhete, na ikilu jenu nanau ukajingalaje na kughonela naku, nahuli tuwezaje kulenda lubheleku lwitu kupetela atati witu.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Bhakunkengiki kabhete atati wabhu divai ikale ikilu jela, na mwali waki nchoku akajingile na kughonela naku. Nambu atati wabhu ngacheakamanyi chikahi mwali waki paakaghoni naku, wala paakabhokike. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Bhela, akakamwali bhokapi bhaka Lutu bhakapatiki itumbo kupetela kwa atati wabhu. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Mwali waki wa kutumbula akumbeliki mwana wa chikambaku, akundohiki Moabu. Jonihoju nde atati wa Bhamoabu, mbaka laleno. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Mwali waki nchoku najombi akumbeliki mwana wa chikambaku, akundohiki lihina Benami. Jonihoju nde atati wa Bhaamoni, mbaka laleno.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s">Ibulahimu na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Kuhuma ku Mamile, Ibulahimu akapiti ku upambala wa Negebu, na kutenda matamu ghaki pachilanda ja Kadeshi na Shuli. Na kwa chikahi chijipi akapiti kutama ku muchi wa Gelali ngati ngeni. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Ibulahimu paakabhi konihoko, akapwaghiki panani jaka nhwanu waki Sala kubha nde ndombu waki. Bhela, Abimeleki nkolongwa wa ku Gelali akabhatumiki bhandu bhakundeta Sala, najombi akuntolike. <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Nambu Chapanga akunhiki Abimeleki ikilu na kumpwaghila, “Wehapa anaupotilaje kwa ndandi jaka mbomba jountolike, maghambu jombi nde nhwanu waka mundu.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Chikahi chenihechi Abimeleki akabhi akali ngacheaghoni na Sala, bhela, akayangike, “Bambo, bho, anauliyonanga le bhandu bhangakubha na mahakau? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Bho, ngacheakambwaghi mweni kubha ajoju nde ndombu waki? Kabhete hata Sala najombi akapwaghiki kubha Ibulahimu nde mbeli waki? Nepani nhengiki aghagha kwa ulongwana wangu, na kwa wamboni wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Bhela, Chapanga akamuyangiki mu mabhono, “Ena, manyi kubha ughahengiki aghagha kwa mtima wambone, nanatu nukuhibhalili ngawihenga lihoku. Nde ndandi ngachenukulekiki ugonalaje naku. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Henu unkelabhua nhwanu waka mundu, maghambu nde mlota, najombi anaakulobhila wehapa, nahuli upata kubha wamwome. Nambu nangakunkelabhua, umanya kubha chakaka anaupotilaje wehapa papamu na bhandu bhaku bhokapi.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Mu lichobha lelijengalyaje, Abimeleki akajumwiki lukela pachibhombu, akabhalohiki bhatumika bhaki bhokapi, na kubhapwaghila malobhi ghanihagha ghokapi ghaghapitalile mu ndotu, na bhandu bhanihabha bhakajowipi namaa. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Panihapa Abimeleki akundohiki Ibulahimu, na kumpwaghila, “Bho, utendiki kike? Nepani nukuhengiki kiki wehapa hata ukaletiki lihoku likolongwa anana kwangu nepani na ukolongwa wangu? Unhengili mambu ambaghu ngacheghapalika kuhengakeka. <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Abimeleki akumpwaghi kabhete Ibulahimu, ‘Bho, chindu bhole chechukutendiki mbaka ukahengiki bhenibhela?’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Ibulahimu akapwaghike, “Nakahengiki bhenibhela maghambu nikaholalili kubha njeta bhandu bhabhabhi na choghohi na Chapanga pandu pambane, nabhombi anabhangomaje kwa ndandi jaka nhwanu wangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Papamu na ghanihagha, chakaka jombi nde ndombu wangu. Tati waki na tati wangu nde jumo, nambu mawu kutalikutali, nde ndandi abhi nhwanu wangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Chikahi Bambo Chapanga paakandendiki mokaje kutali na nyumba ja atati wangu, nakumpwaghile, ‘Anana nde mowilangihaje upalu waku kwangu nepani: Kila pandu patwijendaje, chondi wipwaghaje kubha ajoju nde mbeli wangu.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Bhela, Abimeleki akatoliki mambelele, na ng'ombi, na bhatumwa bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba, na kumpekeha Ibulahimu na kunkelabhua Sala kwaka ndomi waki Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Abimeleki akapwaghike, “Inchi jangu jibhi palongi jaku, utamaje pandu pokapi paupala.” <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Na akumpwaghi Sala, “Lingalya, numpekeha mbeli waku ipandi elufu jimu ya madini gha feza nahuli kubhalangiha bhokapi bhabhabhi papamu na wehapa kubha ngacheubhi na lihakau palongi ja bhandu bhokapi.” <verse eid="GEN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Ibulahimu akundobhiki Chapanga, najombi Chapanga akundamihi Abimeleki, na nhwanu waki, na bhatumika bhaki bha chimbomba, nahuli bhaweza kupata bhana kabhete, <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />maghambu Bambo akabhi aghakongike matumbu gha bhakambomba bha munyumba jaka Abimeleki nahuli ngabhibheleka bhana, kwa ndandi akuntoliki Sala nhwanu waka Ibulahimu.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s">Kubhelakeka kwaka Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Bambo Chapanga akunkombwiki Sala ngati moakapwaghile, na Bambo akunhengi ngati moakapwaghile. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Sala akapatiki chitumbu, na akumbelakili Ibulahimu mwana wa chikambaku mu useja waki, mu chikahi chela chela cheakapwaghiki Bambo. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Ibulahimu akundohiki mwana joakumbeliki Sala jola lihina laki Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />Isaka paakabhi na machobha nane, Ibulahimu akunhekiti jando ngati Chapanga moakundaghalakile. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Ibulahimu akabhi na hyaka mia moja chikahi paakumbeliki mwana waki Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Sala akapwaghike, “Chapanga anetili chiheko, na kila mundu joanajowanaje lijambu lenu anahekaje papamu na nepani.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Kabhete akajonjuki kupwagha, “Bho, nde nane joakumpwaghila Ibulahimu kubha Sala anaajongiha bhana? Kwa ndandi numbelaki mwana mu useja wake.”<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Mwana akakoliki na kulekeshwa kujonga, na mu lichobha lekalekishwi kujonga, Ibulahimu akahengi uwangalalu ukolongwa.<verse eid="GEN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutopuleka kwaka Hajili na Ishimaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Nambu Sala akumbweni Ishimaeli mwana waka Hajili mundu waku Mmisili ambaju akumbelaki Ibulahimu, andongama Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />Panihapa Sala akumpwaghi Ibulahimu, “Untopulya kutali mbomba ajoju mtumwa na mwana wake. Maghambu mwana waka mbomba mtumwa ngaipweleli papamu na mwana wangu, nepani Isaka ng'o.” <verse eid="GEN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Lijambu aleli lakumbiniki namaa Ibulahimu mtima, maghambu Ishimaeli najombi akabhi mwana wake. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Nambu Chapanga akumpwaghi Ibulahimu, “Ngawakubhina mtima kwa ndandi jaka mwana wako na mtumika waku wa chimbomba. Ujowanyaje kila lilobhi leakupwaghi Sala, maghambu lubheleku lwaku analupitalyaje kupetela Isaka ngati monakakuleghili. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Ananuntenda mwana ajoju waka mtumika waku wa chimbomba kubha na bhandu bhamaheli, maghambu najombi nde lubheleku lwaku.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Bhela, Ibulahimu akajumwiki lukela pachibhombu, akatoliki libumunda na nteku wa machi, na kumpekeha Hajili. Akuntwekiki Hajili mumabhegha ghaki, na kubhatopola papamu na mwana waki. Hajili akatumbwi mwanja, na kupotokapotoka mu lipololu la Beel Sheba. <verse eid="GEN 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Chikahi machi paghajomwiki mu nteku mola, Hajili akungoniki mwana waki pahi ja chitutu. <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />Panihapa akapiti kutama cha patali, ngati utali wa mita mia moja, na kulipwaghila, “Ngachenhweza kundingalila mwana wangu paapotela.” Na paakabhi atami panipala, mbomba jola akajamalili na kulela.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Chapanga akunjowini mwana jola akalelaje, mtumika wa kunani waka Chapanga akundohiki Hajili kuhuma kunani kumahundi na kumpwaghila, “Bho, kubhi na kyane, Hajili? Ngawijoghopa, maghambu Chapanga ajowini sauti jaka nkombu waku akabya aghoni pala. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Ujumukaje, na unjumuhaje nkombu waku, maghambu ananuntenda kubha tati bha inchi ngolongwa.” <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Panihapa Chapanga akamuyekwi Hajili mihu ghaki, najombi akaweni chilibha cha machi. Bhela akapiti kutwelakela nteku waki wa machi na kumpekeha nkombu waki akunywaje. <verse eid="GEN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Chapanga akabhi papamu na nkombu jonihoju paakabhi ajendale kukola. Nkombu hoju akabhi atama kulipololu, na ahoma wichu namaa mshali. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Chikahi nkombu paakabhi atama kulipololu la Palani, mabhu waki akuntoghuki mbomba kuhuma ku Misili.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majonganu pachilanda jaka Ibulahimu na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Chikahi chenihechi Abimeleki na Fikoli nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli ghaki bhakumpwaghi Ibulahimu, “Chapanga abhi papamu na wehapa mu kila chindu cheuchihenga. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Bhela sajenu unapilaje kwaka Chapanga kubha ngawitendi mambu ja kungoloha nepani, wala bhana bhangu, wala bhachokolu bhangu. Undendila nepani na inchi ambaju utama ngati ungeni wamboni ghola ghola ambau nepani nukuhengile.”<verse eid="GEN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Ibulahimu akapwaghike, “Ena napa.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Palapala Ibulahimu akang'ong'utiki kwaka Abimeleki kubhokana na chilibha cha machi ambachu bhatumika bhaka Abimeleki bhakabhi bhachinyaghwile. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Abimeleki akapwaghike, “Nepani ngachemanyi joahengiki lijambu lenihele. Wala wehapa ngachewambwaghile, lalenu pela nde panyowana lijambu lendeno.” <verse eid="GEN 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Ibulahimu akatoliki mambelele na ng'ombi na kumpekeha Abimeleki, na bhabheli habha bhakatendiki majonganu. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Ibulahimu akabhekiki bhanambelele saba bha chimbomba kanjika jabhu. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Na Abimeleki akumpwaghi Ibulahimu, “Bho, bhanambelele saba abhabha, bhaubhabhekiki pakanjika jabhu, ndandi jaki kike?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Ibulahimu akayangike, “Utolaje bhanambelele saba bha chimbomba abhabha ghanikupekeha nepani, ngati ulandilu kubha chilibha achechi nakahembiki nepani.” <verse eid="GEN 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Bhela pandu panihapa akapalohiki Beel Sheba, maghambu bhandu bhabheli habha bhakalapiki panihapa.<verse eid="GEN 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Panihapa bhakatendiki majonganu ku Beel Sheba hoku. Abimeleki na Fikoli, nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli bhaki, bhakabhokiki kukelabhuka ku inchi ja Bhafilisti. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Ibulahimu akapandiki nkongu wa nkwachu ku Beel Sheba hoku, na panihapa akalilohiki lihina laka Bambo, Chapanga wa mileli. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Najombi Ibulahimu akatami ku inchi ja Bhafilisti kwa chikahi chilachu.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s">Ibulahimu amboha Isaka nyambiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Paghapetiki mambu ghanihagha ghokapi Chapanga akundengiki Ibulahimu, na kumpwaghila, “Ibulahimu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:1">Na Ibulahimu akayangike, “Nepambane!”<verse eid="GEN 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Panihapa Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Untola mwana waku, Isaka, mwana waku wa kanjika joumpala, na ukajenda mbaka ku inchi ja Molia. Ukumboha konihoku ngati nyambiku ja kujochakeka panani ja chitombi chimuchaki chenakupwaghilaje.”<verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Ibulahimu akajumwiki lukela pachibhombu lichobha lelijengalyaje, akaliandii liponda laki, akabhatoliki bhatumika bhaki bhabheli, papamu na mwana waki Isaka. Paakajomwi kuandaa hanju yamaheli kwa ndandi ja nyambiku ja kujochakeka, akabhokiki na kujenda mbaka pandu ambapu Chapanga akumpwaghile. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Lichobha la akatatu Ibulahimu akajinwihi mihu ghaki, na kupabhona pandu pala cha kutali. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Ibulahimu akabhapwaghi bhatumika bhaki, “Ntamanya pambane papamu na liponda, na nepani na mwana wangu tujenda kola kujojabhela, na anatukelabhuka kabhete.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Ibulahimu akatoliki hanju ya nyambiku heyi, na kuntweka mwana waki Isaka, jombi mweni akatoliki moto na mpamba mumabhoku ghaki, na bhokapi bhabheli bhakapiti papamu. <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Isaka akalongi na Ibulahimu atati waki, “Atati!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Ibulahimu akayangike, “Naam, mwanango!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Isaka akalalukile, “Lingalya, moto na hanju ibhile, nambu abhi kwaku mwanambelele wa nyambiku ja kujochakeka?”<verse eid="GEN 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Ibulahimu akayangike, “Mwanango, Chapanga mweni anaalipekya mwanambelele kwa ndandi ja nyambiku jeniheji.” Na bhokapi bhabheli bhakajendali na mwanja wabho papamu.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Na pabhakahikiki pandu pala ambapu Chapanga akumpwaghile, Ibulahimu akachengiki kwa maganga pandu pa kubhohakela nyambiku, na kuibheka hanju panani jake. Panihapa akunkongiki mwana waki Isaka mabhoku na mabholu, na kumbeka panani ja hanju yela. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Ibulahimu akatoliki mpamba nahuli kunchinja mwana waki. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Nambu mtumika wa kunani waka Bambo akundohiki Ibulahimu kuhuma kunani kumahunde, “Ibulahimu, Ibulahimu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Ibulahimu akayangike, “Ena Nepambanne.”<verse eid="GEN 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Mtumika wa kunani jola akumpwaghile, “Ngawamuyonanga nkombu, wala ngawantenda lijambu lokapi lela. Sajenu manyi kubha unjojabhela Chapanga, maghambu ngechewanhibhalili mwana waku, mwana waku wa kanjika.”<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Ibulahimu akajinwi mihu ghaki, akalingalili na akaweni limbelele likambaku kunyuma jaki, lipatile manyelu ghaki muchitutu. Panihapa Ibulahimu akapiti kulitola limbelele heli, na kulibhoha kubha nyambiku ja kujochakeka pandu paka mwana wake. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Ibulahimu akapalohiki pandu panihapa, “Yehova Yire,” yani, Bambo Chapanga anaatupekyaje. Ngati bhandu mobhapwaghila mbaka lalenu, “Pa chitombi chaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga abhapekeha bhandu bhaki.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Bhela mtumika wa kunani waka Bambo Chapanga akundohiki Ibulahimu kuhuma kunani kumahunde mala ja kabhele, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />akapwaghaje, “Nililapila namwete apwagha Bambo Chapanga, kwa kubha utendiki lijambu alele, wala ngachewanhibhalili mwana waku, mwana waku wa kanjika, <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />chakaka ananukupengalyaje, na ananyonjukyaje lubheleku lwaku ngati ndondwa ya kunani kumahunde, na ngati luhanga lwa mumaheku ja bahali. Na lubheleku lwaku analutawalaje michi ja bhandu bhabhunhakalila, <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />na kupetela lubheleku lwaku mataifa ghokapi gha pundema anaghapengalikaje, maghambu wehapa ujikamulakili amuli jangu.” <verse eid="GEN 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Panihapa Ibulahimu akakelawiki kwa bhatumika bhaki, nabhombi bhakabhokiki papamu na kujenda ku Beil Sheba. Na Ibulahimu akatami ku Beli Sheba.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhana bhaka Naholi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Paghapetiki mambu ghanihagha Ibulahimu akajowini kubha ndongu waku Naholi apatiki bhana bhachikambaku kuhuma kwaka Milika ndongu waku: <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Usi mbelakeka wa kutumbula, na Buzi ndongu waki, na Kemueli atati waka Alamu, <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />na Kesedi, na Hazo, na Pilidashi, na Yidilafu na Besueli. <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Besueli akumbeliki Lebeka. Bhela bhela Milika akumbelakili Naholi ndongu waka Ibulahimu bhana nane habha. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Bhela bhela lidaba laka Naholi, joakalowakiki Leuma, najombi akumbelakili bhana: Teba, na Gahamu, na Tahashi na Maaka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s">Kupotela kwaka Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Sala akatami hyaka mia moja na ishilini na saba. Na akapotela. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Sala akapotili ku Kiliasi Aliba hoku, yani Hebuloni mu inchi ja Kanaani. Ibulahimu akundeli Sala kwa machobha jatatu ngati moukabhelili ntetu.<verse eid="GEN 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Ibulahimu akabhokiki palongi ja ntuhi waka nhwanu waki, na kujenda kulongela na Bhahiti, akapwaghaje, <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />“Nepani ndama ngati nungeni pachilanda jino. Chondi, nunjopa pandu pa kutaghila, pabya pangu, nahuli mbata kuutagha ntuhi waka nhwanu wango.”<verse eid="GEN 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Bhahiti bhakamuyangiki Ibulahimu, na kumpwaghila, <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />“Wenga wa bambo witu, utujowanyaje tepani. Wehapa wa mundu nkolongwa namaa kwitu tepani, utagha ntuhi waku mu litengeli lokapi lela leulipala pachilanda ja matengeli ghitu. Njeta mundu pachilanda jitu joaweza kukuhibhalila litengeli laki, ngawitagha ntuhi waku.”<verse eid="GEN 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Panihapa Ibulahimu akajemiki na kuchikama palongi ja bhenei bha inchi jela, yani Bhahiti. <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />Najombi akalongi nabhu, akapwaghaje, “Ngati anamunyetakili nutagha ntuhi wangu abhoka palongi jangu, chondi munjopa Efuloni mwana waka Sohali kwa ndandi jangu, <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />nahuli anhemalyaje limbaku laki la Makipela, lelibhi mu malindakanilu gha ngonda waki. Mumpwaghila anhemalyaje kwa bei jejipalika nahuli jibya pandu pangu pa kutagha, ananepa pambane pachilanda jinu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Efuloni Mhiti akabhi atami pachilanda ja bhandu bhaki, akamuyangiki Ibulahimu palongi ja Bhahiti bhokapi bhabhakabhi pundyangu ukolongwa wa muchi. <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />“Ngabhela bambo wangu, unyowanyaje. Nukupekeha ngonda ghola waka, na limbaku lelibhi mkati jaki. Nukupekeha palongi ja Bhahiti bhokapi. Utagha ntuhi waku.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Ibulahimu akachikimi kabhete palongi ja bhandu bha inchi jenijela. <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />Ibulahimu akumpwaghi Efuloni, koni bhandu bhokapi bhakabya bhajowanela, “Chondi, nukulobha unyowanyaje. Ananukulepa mbija jejipalika ja ngonda wako. Na nukujopa ujopaje malepu ghani, nahuli nhwezaje kutagha ntuhi wango.”<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Efuloni akamuyangiki Ibulahimu, akapwaghaje, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />“Unyowanyaje bambo wango. Ngonda wa kuhemalela kwa mbija shekeli mia nne nde kike pachilanda jangu nepani na wehapa? Utaghaje ntuhi wako.” <verse eid="GEN 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Ibulahimu akajetakili malobhi ghaka Efuloni. Na Ibulahimu akumpemili Efuloni mbija jela jeakalowile palongi ja Bhahiti bhokapi, hipandi mia nne ja madini ja feza, kulengana na ipemu ya bhabhalombesa na kuhemela bha chikahi chenihechi. <verse eid="GEN 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Bhela ngonda waka Efuloni ghoukabhi ku Makipela pambipi na Mamile, limbaku na mikongu jokapi jejakabhi mkati ja malindakanilu gha ngonda hoghu, <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />kubha waka Ibulahimu, palongi ja Bhahiti bhokapi bhabhakabhi bhahikiki pundyangu ukolongwa wa muchi.<verse eid="GEN 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Bhela paghapetiki ghanihagha ghokapi Ibulahimu akuntaghiki Sala nhwanu waki mu limbaku mkati ja ngonda wa Makipela pambipi na Mamile, yani Hebuloni mu inchi ja Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Panihapa Bhahiti bhakumpeki Ibulahimu ngonda ghola papamu na limbaku lelakabhi monihomu kubha pandu paki pa kutagha.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s">Isaka antoghola Labeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Bhela Ibulahimu akabhi asejike na akabhi na hyaka yamaheli, na Bambo Chapanga ampengalile mu kila chindu. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Lichobha limu Ibulahimu akumpwaghi mtumika waki nkolongwa wa kujemalela hindu yokapi ya munyumba jaki, “Chondi ubheka chibhoku chaku pahi ja lipaja lango. <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />Mbala ulapaje kwaka Bambo Chapanga wa kunani na Chapanga wa ndema, kubha ngawantoleli mwana wangu mbomba wa kuntoghola kuhuma kwa akakamwali bha Bhakanaani, ambabhu ndama nabhu pachilanda jabhu. <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />Nambu wijendaje ku inchi jangu, na bhalongu bhangu, na ukuntolila mwana wangu Isaka mbomba wa kuntoghola.” <verse eid="GEN 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Mtumika jola akundaluki Ibulahimu, “Anakubhi, mbomba hoju anaakaniki kuhika papamu na nepani mu inchi jenjeno? Bho, nampelaka le mwana waku ku inchi jaku kouhumile?” <verse eid="GEN 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Ibulahimu akayangike, “Ngabhela! Ngawankelabhua mwana wangu konihoko. <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />Bambo Chapanga wa kunani, joakamohiki munyumba ja atati wangu na inchi jangu jenabhelakiki na joakalongi na nepani na kunaghila kwa kulapa, akapwaghaje, ‘Ananabhapekya bhana bhaku inchi jenjeno,’ anaabhatuma bhatumika bhaki bha kunani bhakulongulyaje nahuli undetilaje mwana wangu mbomba wa kuntoghola kuhuma konihoko. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Ngati mbomba jonihoju anaakaniki kulongana na wehapa, bhela anaubhopuliwaje kuhuma mu kulapa kwango. Nambu ngawankelabhua mwana wangu konihoko.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Bhela mtumika hoju akabhekiki chiwoku chaki pahi ja lipaja laka Ibulahimu bambo waki, na kundapila kubhokana na lijambu lenihele.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Panihapa mtumika hoju akatoliki ngamia komi pachilanda ja ngamia yaka bambo waki na kubhoka, akatoliki kila ntundu wa nhupu inyahi kuhuma kwaka bambo waki. Akapiti mbaka ku Mesopotamia, mbaka ku muchi wa Naholi. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Paakahikiki konihoku, akaitendiki ngamia yela kuchikama pambipi na chilibha cha machi kunja ja muchi chikahi cha pakamihe, chikahi ambachu akambomba bhajenda kuteka machi. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Bhela akalobhike, “Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waka bambo wangu Ibulahimu, nukulobha unyangatyaje kuweza laleno, na undangiha chiha bambo wangu Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Nyemiki pambane pambipi na chilibha chenjenu cha machi, na akakamwali bha bhandu bha muchi ghongoni bhahika kuteka machi. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Bhela na kubya ana, mwali jola jonampwaghilaje, ‘Chondi uheliya chihulu chaku mbata kunywa machi.’ Najombi anaapwaghiki, ‘Kunywaje, na kuikenga ngamia yangu bhelabhela,’ jonihoju nde abyaje mbomba jounhawile kwa ndandi jaka mtumika waku Isaka. Na kwa lijambu aleli anamanya kubha umboni chiha bambo wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Kukabhi mangani ja kujomola kulongela, lingalya, Lebeka akapitalile, mwali waka Besueli, mwana waka Milika, nhwanu waka Naholi, ndongu waka Ibulahimu, akahikiki koni atotwi chihuli palibhegha laki. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Mwali hoju akabhi mnyahi namaa kwa sula jaki, na akabhi bikila ambaju ngachealabhalili kughonela na mwanalomi kihyegha. Akahelili kuchilibha, akatwelakili machi chihulu chaki, na kukwela kabhete. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Panihapa mtumika jola akajombatiki kuhimangana naku na kumpwaghila, “Chondi umbekya machi machokopi kuhuma mu chihulu chaku ngunywaje.”<verse eid="GEN 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Mwali jola akapwaghike, “Kunywaje, nkolongwa wango.” Akahulwi manyata chihulu mumabhoku ghaki na kumpekeha akunywaje. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Paakajomwi kumpekeha mtumika jola machi, akumpwaghile, “Anandeka machi ghangi kwa ndandi ja ngamia yaku bhelabhela mbaka yokapi itupilaje.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Bhela, kamwali jola akatendiki manyata kupongola machi jajakabhili mu chihulu jala na kupongulela mu liteleku la kukengela hinyama, na kukembela kujenda kuchilibha kuteka machi ghangi na kuikenga ngamia yaki yokapi. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Mundu jola akabhi andingalakila namaa panga kulongela chindu chokapi, nahuli amanyaje ngati Bambo auwezishi mwanja waki, au ngabhela.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Chikahi ngamia payatupili kunywa machi, mundu jola akatoliki hibangili ya zahabu na kumpekeha mwali jola, kutopa kwa hibangili heji kukabhi ngati gilamu sita, na bangili ibheli ya zahabu ya gilamu komi kila jimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />Mtumika jola akalalukile, “Chondi umbwaghilaje, bho, wehapa wa mwali waka nane? Bho, kubhi le na pandu mu nyumba ja atati waku patuweza kutama kwa chikahi?”<verse eid="GEN 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Mwali jola akayangike, “Nepani nde mwali waka Besueli, mwana waka Milika joakumbelakile Naholi.” <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Akajendali kupwagha, “Kunyumba jitu kubhi na manyonyoli ghamaheli na pandu pa kulekeha hinyama, kabhete kubhi na pandu pa kutama bhaghene.”<verse eid="GEN 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Panihapa mtumika jola akachikimi na kunjojabhela Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />Akapwaghaje, “Alumbalikaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waka bambo wangu Ibulahimu, ambaju ngacheakabhohiki wamboni waki na ulongwana waki kwaka bambo wangu. Nepani nanatu, Bambo unongwihi mu mwanja wangu na kunhikisha kunyumba ja bhalongu bhaka bambo wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Bhela, mwali jola akakembili imbelu, na kubhapwaghila bhandu bha munyumba ja mabhu waki kubhokana na mambu ghanihagha ghokapi. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Lebeka akabhi na mbeli waki joakalowakiki Labani. Labani akabhokiki imbelu na kujenda kuhimangana na mtumika jola kuchilibha. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Labani akabhi ajiweni bangili ja muimbunu jela na bangili mumabhoku ghaka ndombu waki, na kujowana mambu ambaghu Lebeka akapwaghakiki na mundu jola. Labani akunhimani mundu jola ajemiki pambipi na ngamia yaki pambipi na chilibha. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Labani akumpwaghile, “Uhikaje kunyumba wenga weupengaliki na Bambo, bho, maghambu kiki ujema kunja hoko? Nepani nukuandali wichu nyumba na pandu pangi kwa ndandi ja ngamia yako.”<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Panihapa mtumika jola akapiti kunyumba kujitamakaje Labani. Na bhatumika bhaka Labani bhakabhohiki ibwahila panani ja ngamia na kuipekeha ngamia manyonyoli, na kubhapekeha jombi na bhandu bhaki machi gha kuchamba magholo. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Bhela, bhatumika bhaka Labani bhakundeti chilebhe, nambu jombi akapwaghike, “Nepani nganguli chilebhe mbaka nongila hoti malobhi ghango.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Labani akumpwaghile, “Haya upwaghaje.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Mtumika jola akapwaghike, “Nepani nde mtumika waka Ibulahimu.” <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />“Bambo Chapanga ampengalili namaa bambo wangu Ibulahimu, najombi abhi mundu mwana hindu yamaheli. Ampekihi mambelele na ng'ombi, madini gha feza na zahabu, bhatumika bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba, ngamia na maponda. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Sala nhwanu waka bambo wangu Ibulahimu ambelakili mwana wa chikambaku mu useja wake, najombi ampekihi kila chindu cheabhi nachu. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Bhela, bambo wangu atehi kunapisha na kupwagha, ‘Ngawantolela mwana wangu mbomba kubha nhwanu waki pachilanda ja akakamwali bha Bhakanaani ambabhu nepani ndama mu inchi jabhu. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Nambu ujendaje mbaka kunyumba ja atati wangu, na kwa bhalongu bhangu, ukuntolila mwana wangu nhwanu waki.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Panihapa nakumpwaghi bambo wangu, ‘Bho, ngati mbomba hoju anaakaniki kuhika papamu na nepani?’ <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />Nambu jombi akambwaghile, ‘Bambo Chapanga ambaju jonitii machubha jokapi, anaabhatuma bhatumika bhaki bha kunani kumahunde bhakubha papamu na wehapa nahuli kukulongoha na kukujangatila nahuli mwanja waku ubya unyahi, nahuli uwezaje kupata mbomba kwa ndandi jaka mwana wangu mu lukolu lwangu na kuhuma mu bhalongu bha atati wangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Ngati anauhikiti kwa bhandu bhangu na bhakalepalili kukupekeha kamwali hoju, ngaulekakewi mu kulapa kwagu.’<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />“Panahikiki kuchilibha lalenu, nakalobhike, ‘Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waka bambo wangu Ibulahimu, chondi unyangatyaje mu mwanja wangu ghonhikile. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Lingalyaje, nyemiki pambani pambipi na chilibha cha machi. Bhela, na kubya ana, mwali joanahikaje kuteka machi, nanatu ananumpwaghili umbekya machi machokopi gha kunywa kuhuma mu chihulu chaku.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />Najombi ngati anaambwaghi, ‘Kunywa machi, nanatu ananitekila machi ngamia yaku, jonihoju nde abya nhwanu wangu ambaju wehapa wa Bambo Chapanga, unihaulile mwana bhambo wangu.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />Panakabhi nakali ngakujomola kulobha muntima wangu, Lebeka akapitalili, koni atotwi chihuli mumabegha ghaki. Akahelili kuchilibha na kuteka machi, nanatu nakumpwaghile, ‘Chondi umbekya machi ngunywaje.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />Akajombatiki kuheleya chihulu chaki pahi, na kupwagha, ‘Kunywaje, na ngamia yaku ananikenga bhela bhela.’ Bhela nepani nakakunywiki na ngamia yangu nayombi akaipeki machi. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Nepani nakundalukile, ‘Bho, wehapa wa mwali waka nane?’ Najombi akayangike, ‘Nepani nde mwali waka Besueli, mwana waka Milika, nhwanu waka Naholi.’ Nanatu nakunhwatiki pete paimbulu jaki na bangili mumabhoku ghaki. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Nakachikimi na kunjojabhela Bambo Chapanga, nakundumbalili Bambo Chapanga waka bambo wangu Ibulahimu, joakanongwihe muindela, nahuli nuntolila mwana waka bambo wangu mbomba wa kutoghola kuhuma mu lukolu lwaki. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Henu mbwaghilaje ngati anamlangihi wamboni na ulongwana kwaka bambo wangu, nanga bhela, mbwaghilaje, nahuli ng'anambukyaje upambala wa kumalelelu au kumangeja.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Panihapa Labani na Besueli bhakayangiki, bhakapwaghaje, “Lijambu aleli lihumiki kwaka Bambo Chapanga, na tepani ngatuwezi kukupwaghila lijambu lokapi lela lihakau au lambone. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Lingalyaje, Lebeka abhi pambane, untolaje na ujenda naku, akabya nhwanu waka mwana waka bambo waku, ngati na Bambo moakulonguhile.” <verse eid="GEN 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Panihapa mtumika waka Ibulahimu paakajowini malobhi ghanihagha, akachikimi mbaka pahi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Panihapa mtumika hoju akabhohiki hindu yeyalenganakiki kwa madini gha zahabu na madini gha feza papamu na ingobhu, na kumpekeha Lebeka. Bhela bhela akabhapeki nhupu ya mbija yamaheli mbeli waki na mabhu waki.<verse eid="GEN 24:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Bhela, jombi papamu na bhala bhabhakabhi papamu naku bhakakuliki, bhakakunywiki na kughonela ikilu kola kola. Pabhakajumwiki lukela, mtumika jola akapwaghike, “Nyetakalyaje nyendaje kwaka bambo wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Nambu mbeli waka Lebeka na mabhu waki bhakayangike, “Undeka mwali atama kwitu machobha komi au nakanope, panihapa nde mwibhokaje.”<verse eid="GEN 24:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Mtumika jola akabhapwaghile, “Ngamwinjelewesha, kwa kubha Bambo anhwezishi mwanja wangu, nyetakalyaje ngelabhukaje kwaka bambo wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Bhombi bhakayangike, “Leka tundoha mwali hoju, tundalukya mwene moapwaghila.” <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Bhakundohiki Lebeka na kundalukila, “Bho, anaujenda na mundu ajojo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Lebeka akayangiki, “Ena, ananyendaje.”<verse eid="GEN 24:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Panihapa bhanjetakela Lebeka, papamu na mabhu joangohikaje Lebeka kutumbula paakabhili mwana, na mtumika waka Ibulahimu na bhandu bhaki. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Bhakumpengali Lebeka, bhakapwaghaje:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">“Ndongu witu, wehapa ubyaje mabhu wa bhandu bahamaheli bhangakubhalangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">na bhabhelakeka bhaku bhapwelilaje michi ja bhandu bhabhunhakalila.”<verse eid="GEN 24:60" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Panihapa Lebeka akabhokiki na bhatumika bhaki bha chimbomba, koni bhakabya bhakweliki ngamia na kunjengalela mtumika waka Ibulahimu jola, na bhokapi bhakabhokiti.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Bhela Isaka akabhi ahikiki kwa indela ja Beli Lahai Loi, maghambu akabhi atama ku inchi ja Negebu upambala wa kolijibhi lyoba. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Isaka akabhokiki kujenda kungonda nahuli kuholalela mu chikahi cha pakamihi, akajwinwi mihu ghaki, akaiweni ngamia ihika. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Lebeka akajinwi mihu ghaki, najombi paakumbweni Isaka, akahulwiki panani ja ngamia jaki. <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />Na kundalukila mtumika jola, “Bho, mundu jola joabhi kungonda kola nde nane joahika kutujopalela?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Mtumika jola akayangike, “Jonihoju nde bambo wangu.” Panihapa Lebeka akatoliki chitambala chaki na kuliyeka pamihu.<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Mtumika jola akumpwaghi Isaka mambu ghokapi ghaakahengike. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Bhela Isaka akumpeliki Lebeka mu lihema la mabhu waki Sala, na Isaka akuntoliki Lebeka na kubha nhwanu waki. Isaka akumpaliki Lebeka, na kupata chiheku kabheti ngati pahekalyaje mangani ja kupotela mawu waki.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s">Bhabhelakeka bhangi bhaka Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:32-33">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 1:32-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Ibulahimu akatowi mbomba jongi, lihina laki akalowakiki Ketula. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Ketula najombi akumbelakili Ibulahimu bhana, Zimulani, na Yokishani, na Medani, na Midiani, na Ishibaki na Shua. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yokishani akumbeliki Sheba na Dedani, na bhabheleka bhaka Dedani bhakabhi Bhaashulu, na Bhatelushi na Bhaleumi. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Bhana bhaka Midiani bhakabhi Efa, na Efeli, na Hanoki, na Abida na Elida. Bhokapi abhabha bhakabhi bhabhelakeka bhaka Ketula.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Ibulahimu akumpeki Isaka upwelelu wa kila chindu cheakabhi nachu. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Nambu Ibulahimu paakabhi akali mwome, akabhapeki bhana bha bhatumika bhaki bha chimbomba nhupu, na kubhabhoha bhajenda kutama upambala wa kolipita lyobha, kutali na mwana waki Isaka.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupotela kwaka Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Ibulahimu akatemi, hyaka mia moja na sabini na nhwanu. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Ibulahimu akapotile mu useja wambone, akabhi asejike akabya atupi machobha, najombi akabhonginwi papamu na bhaseja bhaki. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Bhana bhaki bhabheli, Isaka na Ishimaeli bhakuntaghiki mu limbaku la Makipela pambipi na Mamile, mu ngonda ghoukabhi waka Efiloni mwana waka Sohali Mhiti, <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Ngonda ambau Ibulahimu akauhemi kwa Bhahiti. Konihoku nde ambaku Ibulahimu akataghakiki na nhwanu waki Sala. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Na Ibulahimu paakapotile, Chapanga akumpengali Isaka mwana wake. Najombi Isaka akatami pambipi na Beli Lahai Loi. Ndandi jaki jola joabhona<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhabhelakeka bhaka Ishimaeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:28-31">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 1:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Hayeyi nde ibheleku yaka Ishimaeli mwana waka Ibulahimu, bhabhakabhelakiki kwaka Hajili mundu wa ku Misili ambaju akabhili mtumika wa chimbomba waka Sala. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Aghagha nde mahina gha bhana bhaka Ishimaeli, kwa mahina ghabhu, na kwa ibheleku yabhu: Mbelakeka wa kutumbula waka Ishimaeli akabhi Nebayoti, akajengalili Kedali, na Abideeli na Mibusamu, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />na Mishima, na Duma na Masa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />na Hadadi, na Tema, na Yetuli, na Nafishi na Kedema. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Bhanihabha bhakabhi nde bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Ishimaeli, na bhanihabha bhakabhi nde ihongozi bha makabila komi na ghabheli kulengana na matamu ghabhu na bhalongu bhabhu. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Ishimaeli, akabhili na hyaka mia moja na selasini na saba. Akapotile, najombi akabhonginwi papamu na bhandu bhaki. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Bhabhelakeka bhaka Ishimaeli bhakatami pachilanda ja Havila mbaka ku Shuli, pambipi na malindakanilu gha Misili, kwa indela jejijenda ku Ashulu. Bhakatami kwa kughabhanika na bhabhelakeka bhangi bhokapi.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhelakeka kwaka Esau na Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Hayeyi nde ibheleku yaka Isaka mwana waka Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Isaka akabhi na hyaka alobaini chikahi paakuntowi Lebeka, mwali waka Besueli, Mshami, wa ku Padani Alamu. Labeka akabhili ndombu waka Labani. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Isaka akundobhiki Bambo Chapanga kwa ndandi jaka nhwanu wake, maghambu akabhi ngulumba. Najombi Bambo Chapanga akayangiki malobhu ghaki, na Lebeka nhwanu waka Isaka akapatiki chitumbu. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Chitumbu hechi chakabhili mapaha. Bhana habha anabhapengini mulutumbu lwaku, “Ngati anakubhi anana, bho, maghambu kiki kutama?” Bhela akapiti kundaluki Bambo.<verse eid="GEN 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">“Bhana bhabheli bhabhabhili mulutumbu lwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Na makabila ghabheli gha bhandu anaghaghabhanikaje kutumbu mulutumbu lwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Chibheleku chaka nchoku anakibya na makili kupeta chibheleku chaka nkolongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">na chibheleku chaka nkolongwa anachihengilaje lihengu nchoku.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Chikahi chaki cha kulibhopola pachahikiki, Labheka akalibhopwili bhana mabhela bha chikambaku. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Wa kutumbula kubhelakeka akabhi nkeli, hyegha jaki jokapi jakabhi ngati ingobhu ja majunjo. Bhakundohiki lihina laki Esau. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Palongi, akabhelakiki wa kabheli, na chiwoku chaki chakunkamwi chinjekinjeki chaka Esau. Akundohiki lihina laki Yakobo. Isaka akabhi na hyaka sitini chikahi nhwanu waki Lebeka paakalibhopwile.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau ahemalela ubhelakeka waki wa kutumbula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Bhana bhakakolike, na Esau akabhi mundu joamanyi kubhenga hinyama, mundu wa muitengo, nambu Yakobo akabhi mundu wa chinunu, na wa kutama panyumba. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Bhela, Isaka akumpaliki Esau, maghambu akayobhali kula hinyama yeakabhi abhenga, nambu Lebeka akumpaliki Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Lichobha limu Yakobo akateliki chilebhi cha chimpunyuli cha ngondi, na Esau akabhi akelabhuka kuhuma kuchitengu akabya na injala namaa. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Akumpwaghi Yakobo, “Chondi, umbekya chilebhi chikeli hechi ngulaje, maghambu ndondiki namaa.” Nde ndandi bhakundohiki lihina laki Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Yakobo akayangike, “Unombasya hoti ubhelakeka waku wa kutumbula.”<verse eid="GEN 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Esau akapwaghike, “Lingalya, nepani mi pambipi kupotela, bho, anajinyangatya kike ubhelakeka waku wa kutumbula?”<verse eid="GEN 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Yakobo akumpwaghile, “Unapila hoti.” Najombi Esau akundapile, na kundombasela Yakobo ubhelakeka waku wa kutumbula. <verse eid="GEN 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Panihapa Yakobo akumpeki Esau libumunda na chimpunyuli cha ngondi, najombi akakuliki, akakunywiki, na akabhokiki na kujenda. Bhela, Esau akajijojwii haki jaki jaka mbelakeka wa kutumbula.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s">Isaka ajenda kutama ku muchi wa Gelali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Bhela injala ngolongwa jakapitalili mu inchi jeniheji, kujipeta injala jela jejalongoli kupitalila chikahi chaka Ibulahimu. Isaka akapiti ku muchi wa Gelali, kwaka Abimeleki nkolongwa wa Bhafilisti. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Bambo Chapanga akumpitali Isaka, na kumpwaghila, “Ngawihelela kujenda ku Misili, nambu utamaje mu inchi jenakupwaghilaje. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Utama kugheni mu inchi jeniheji, nanatu anangubha papamu na wehapa na kukupengalela. Maghambu ananukupekya wehapa na lubheleku lwaku lwokapi inchi yenjenu yokapi. Nanatu ananukutenda kulapa kwangu kutamakila konatendiki na Ibulahimu atati waku. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Ananyonjukya lubheleku lwaku ngati ndondwa ya kunani, nanatu ananabhapekya inchi yenjenu yokapi, na kubhokana na lubheleku lwaku mataifa ghokapi gha pundema anaghapengalikaje. <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />Maghambu Ibulahimu akajowanili sauti jangu, akaghakamwili malaghalakilu ghangu, na amuli yangu, na utemulu wangu na shelia yangu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Bhela Isaka akatami ku muchi wa Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Bhandu bha pandu panipala pabhakundalukili malobhi kubhokana na nhwanu wake, akapwaghike, “Hajoju nde ndombu wango,” maghambu akajowipi kupwagha, “Hajoju nde nhwanu wango.” Akaholalili, “Bhandu bha pandu panipala bhaweza kunkoma kwa ndandi jaka Lebeka, maghambu Lebeka akabhi myahi namaa wa sula.” <verse eid="GEN 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Isaka paakabhi atami konihoku kwa machobha ghamaheli, Abimeleki, nkolongwa wa Bhafilisti akalingalili palidilisha, na kumbona Isaka akina kina na nhwanu waki Lebeka. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Abimeleki akundohiki Isaka na kumpwaghila, “Chakaka hajoju nde nhwanu wako! Bho, mbona ukambwaghi, ‘Hajoju nde ndombu wango?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Isaka akamuyangike, “Maghambu nakaholali kubha nakabya ngomakike kwa ndandi jaki.”<verse eid="GEN 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Panihapa Abimeleki akamuyangike, “Henu utuhengi kike? Pangi jumu wa bhandu bhangu akabya aweziki kughonela na nhwanu waku kihyegha, nanau ukabya utuleti lihakau panani jitu.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Bhela, Abimeleki akabhalaghalaki bhandu bhokapi, akapwaghaje, “Jokapi joanaangusa mundu hajoju au nhwanu waki chakaka anaakomakikaje.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Isaka akapandiki imbeju mu inchi jenijela, mu chaka chela chela, na akahuniki mahunu mala mia, maghambu Bambo Chapanga akumpengalile. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Isaka akabhi mundu mwana hindu yamaheli, akajendali kupata hindu yamaheli mbaka akabhi mundu mwana hindu yamaheli namaa. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Akabhi na mapogha gha mambelele, na mapogha gha ng'ombi na bhatumika bhamaheli, hata Bhafilisti bhakumboni wihu. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Bhela hilibha yokapi ya machi yeyakembakiki na bhatumika bhaka Ibulahimu tati waki, Bhafilisti bhakaiyelalili na luhombi.<verse eid="GEN 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Abimeleki akumpwaghi Isaka, “Ubhoka kwitu, maghambu wehapa utupetiki makili namaa.” <verse eid="GEN 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Bhela, Isaka akabhokiki konihoku na kujenda kubheka likambi laki ku libondi la Gelali, na kutama konihoku. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Panihapa Isaka akaikembiki kabhete hilibha ya machi yela ambayu yakakembakiki mu machobha ghaka Ibulahimu tati waki paakabhi mwome, abhayu Bhafilisti bhakaiyelaili paakapotili Ibulahimu, na kuipekeha mahina ghala ghala abhaghu tati waki akabhi ayipekihe.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Bhela bhatumika bhaka Isaka bhakakembiki ku libondi lela na kupata chilibha cha machi manyahi gha chemuchemu. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Nambu bhadima bha ku Gelali bhakalochini na bhadima bhaka Isaka, bhakapwaghaje, “Machi ghangani nde ghito.” Bhela Isaka akachilohiki chilibha hechi Eseki, Eseki ndandi jaki, “Kulochana.”<verse eid="GEN 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Panihapa bhakakembiki chilibha chengi, nambu hata chenihechi nachombi bhakachilochanile, akachilohiki Sitina, Sitina ndandi jaki, “Kulochana.” <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Isaka akabhokiki konihoku na kujenda pandu pangi, na kukemba chilibha chengi. Nambu chenihechi ngachebhalochanile, bhela, Isaka akachilohiki Lebohoti, akapwaghaje, “Sajenu Bambo Chapanga atupekihi mbekenyu, natatu anatujonjukikaje mu inchi jenjeno.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Kuhuma konihoku, Isaka akakweliki kujenda ku muchi wa Beeli Sheba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Ikilu jela Bambo Chapanga akumpitalili, na kumpwaghila, “Nepani nde Chapanga waka tati waku Ibulahimu. Ngawijoghopa, kwa ndandi nepani mi papamu na wehapa, ananukupengalyaje na kubhajonjukela bhabhelakeka bhaku kwa ndandi jaka Ibulahimu, mtumika wango.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Isaka akachengiki chihanja cha nyambiku konihoku, na kulobha kwa lihina laka Bambo Chapanga. Akachengiki lihema laki konihoku, na bhatumika bhaki bhakakembiki chilibha.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isaka na Abimeleki bhajongana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Chikahi chenihechi Abimeleki akahikiki kuhuma ku muchi wa Gelali akabya papamu na Ahuzati nkochi waki, papamu na Fikoli nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli ghaki na kujenda kwaka Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Isaka akabhalalukile, “Bho, mbona nhwikiki kwangu nepani, koni mkanhakalili na kundopola kwino?”<verse eid="GEN 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Bhakayangike, “Chakaka tukaweni kubha Bambo Chapanga abhi papamu na wehapa. Bhela tukapwaghiki, ‘Itupalika kulapilana, tepani na wehapa, na kutenda lulaghilo, <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />kubha ngawatuhengeli mahakau, ngati tepani natatu ngachetukuhengile mahakau, nambu tukakuhengili ghamboni pela. Tukakulekiki ubhokaje kwa lukwale, nanau sajenu upengaliwi na Bambo Chapanga.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Panihapa Isaka akabhahengili uwangalalu, nabhombi bhakakuliki na kunywa. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Chilabhu jaki lukela pachibhombu, bhakalapiki bheni kwa bheni. Na panihapa Isaka akabhahindakili na kulaghana nabhu kwa lukwale.<verse eid="GEN 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Mu lichobha lela lela bhatumika bhaka Isaka bhakahikiki kumpekeha ubholu kubhokana na chilibha chebhakabhi bhachikembike, “Tupatiki machi.” <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Najombi akachilohiki lihina laki Shiba, Shiba ndandi jaki nde, “Kulapilana.” Bhela lihina la muchi ghonihoghu nde Beeli Sheba mbaka laleno.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akabhahanu bhaka Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Esau paakabhi na hyaka alobaini, akuntowi Yudisi, mwali waka Beeli, wa likabila la Wahiti na Besemati, mwali waka Eloni, wa likabila la Wahiti. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Akambomba bhanihabha bhakatendiki matamu ghaka Isaka na Lebeka kubha mabhabha.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s">Isaka ampengalela Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Isaka paakabhi asejike, na mihu ghaki paghakabhi ghakosiki makili gha kubhona kabhete, akundohiki Esau mwana waki nkolongwa, na kumpwaghila, “Mwanango!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:1">Najombi akayangike, “Naam atati.”<verse eid="GEN 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Isaka akapwaghike, “Lingalya, nepani sajenu nzejike, wala lichobha la kupotela kwangu ngechenilimanye. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Henu utolaje mshali waku, na ujenda kuchitengu ukabhenga chinyama kwa ndandi jango. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />Ukaandalya chilebhi chinohu kwa ntundu ghola ghonupala, ukanetila nahuli ngulaje, na panihapa ananukupengalyaje, mangane ngachembotile.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Bhela Lebeka akabhi ajowanela chikahi Isaka paakabhi alongela na Esau mwana waki. Panihapa Esau akapiti kuchitengu kubhenga chinyama nahuli aletaje, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Lebeka akumpwaghi Yakobo mwana waki, “Lingalya, nunjowini tati waku akalongilaje na mbeli waku Esau, akapwaghaje, <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />‘Ukanetila chinyama, na ukaandalya chilebhi chinohu nahuli ngulaje, nanatu ananukupengalya palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga mangane ja kupotela kwangu.’ <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Henu wa mwana wangu, unyowanyaje malobhi ghangu ghanukupwaghila. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Ujendaje sajenu kulipogha ukanetila makenda manyahi ghabheli gha imbuhi, nahuli nhandiya chilebhi chinohu kwa ndandi jaka tati waku, kwa ntundu ghola ghoaupala. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Bhela anaumpelakya tati waku, apata kula, nahuli akupengalyaje mangane ja kupotela kwaki.”<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Yakobo akumpwaghi Lebeka mabhu waki, “Ukombuka kubha mbeli wangu Esau atweli majunjo muhyegha jaki, nambu nepani njeta. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Pangi tati wangu anaambapihaje, nanatu anamya ngati ndehi kungolowa pamapihu jaki, nanatu ananililetila masolu panani jangu pandu pa mbengalelo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Mabhu waki akumpwaghile, “Mwanango, masolu ghaku na ghakubha panani jangu nepani, unyowanya sauti jangu pela, ujendaje ukanetila makenda ghabheli gha imbuhi.” <verse eid="GEN 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Bhela, Yakobo akapiti kughatola makenda ghabheli gha imbuhi na kundetela mabhu waki, najombi akaandii chilebhi chinohu, ngati moakapali tati waki. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Bhela Lebeka akatoliki ingobhu hinyahi yaka Esau mwana waki nkolongwa, yeakabhi nayu munyumba, na kunhwatika Yakobo mwana waki nchoku. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Bhelabhela akamuwatiki chingumba cha imbuhi mumabhoku ghaki, na muhingu jaki. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Panihapa akumpeki Yakobo chilebhi chinohu hechi, papamu na libumunda leakalenganakile.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Yakobo akapiti kwaka tati waki, akapwaghaje, “Tati wangu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Najombi akayangike, “Naam, mwanango, wehapa wa nane?”<verse eid="GEN 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Yakobo akumpwaghi tati waki, “Nepani nde Esau mbelakeka waku wa kutumbula. Ndendiki ngati mowambwaghile. Chondi atati, ujumukaje na utama wichu, na ukulaje chinyama changu chemengike, nahuli umbengalyaje.”<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Nambu Isaka akundaluki mwana waki, “Bho, upatiki bhole manyata ntundu aghogho?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">Yakobo akayangike, “Maghambu Bambo, Chapanga waku, atehi kunyangatila.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Isaka akumpwaghi Yakobo, “Mwanango, chondi uheghalya pambipi na nepani nahuli nukupapihaje, mbala kubhona ngati chakaka wehapa nde wa Esau mwana wangu, au ngabhela.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Bhela Yakobo akaheghalili pambipi jaka Isaka tati waki, najombu akumpapihe, na kupwagha, “Sauti jaka Yakobo, nambu mabhoku nde ghaka Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Isaka ngacheakummanye Yakobo, kwa ndandi mabhoku ghaki ghakabhi ngati ghaka Esau, mbeli waki, bhela akumpengalile. <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />Isaka akundaluki kabhete, “Bho, chakaka le wehapa wa mwana wangu wa Esau?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Yakobo akayangike, “Ena.”<verse eid="GEN 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Isaka akapwaghike, “Unetila pambipi inyama heji jeubhengiki wa mwanango, nahuli nukupengalyaje.” Yakobo akundetili najombi akakulike, na akundetili na divai, akakunywike. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Panihapa Isaka tati waki akumpwaghile, “Uhika pambani mwanango, unamukyaje kwa upalu.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Bhela, Yakobo akapiti na kundamukila tati waki kwa upalu. Najombi tati waki paakajowini kunungila kwa ingobhu yaki, akumpengalili akapwaghaje, “Lingalya, kunungila kwaka mwana wangu nde ngati kunungila kwa ngonda ghoaupengali Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Chapanga na akupekya lyangame la kunani kumahunde, na wamaheli wa pundema, na wamaheli wa mahunu na divai. <verse eid="GEN 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Bhandu bha mataifa ghokapi na bhakutumakya wehapa, na bhandu bha mataifa ghokapi bhakuchikamya wehapa. Ubyaje mtawala panani ja bhalongu bhako, na bhana bha chikambaku bhaka mabhu waku bhakujojabya wehapa. Kila joakupeke masolu na apata masolu, na kila joakupengalela na apengaliwaje.”<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau ajopa kupengalewa na Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Bhela Isaka paakajomwi kumpengalela Yakobo, najombi Yakobo paakabhi abhokiki pela palongi jaka Isaka tati waki, Esau najombi akahikiki kuhuma kubhenga. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Najombi akalenganaki chilebhi chinohu na kumpelakela tati waki, na kumpwaghila, “Tati wango, ujumukaje na ukulaje pandu pa chinyama chemengiki nepani mwana waku, nahuli upata kumbengalela.”<verse eid="GEN 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Isaka, tati waki, akundalukile, “Wehapa wa nane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">Najombi akayangike, “Nepani nde mwana waku Esau, mbelakeka waku wa kutumbula.”<verse eid="GEN 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Isaka akabhaghiji namaa, akapwaghaje, “Bho, akabhi nane jola joakatoliki chinyama cheabhengiki na kunetela? Nanatu nyomwi kula mangani ngacheuhikiki pambane, na nakumpengalile, najombi chakaka anaapengaliwaje!”<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Esau paakajowini malobhi ghanihagha ghaka tati waki, akaleliki chilelu chikolongwa, na cha mabhinilu, na kumpwaghila tati waki, “Chondi tati wango, umbengalya na nepane bhelabhela!”<verse eid="GEN 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Nambu Isaka akayangike, “Ndongu waku akahikiki kwa kukolowa, najombi atoliki mbengalelu jaku.”<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Esau akapwaghike, “Nde ndandi alowakeka Yakobo! Atoliki pandu pangu mala pabheli. Akatoliki haki jangu jaka mbelakeka wa kutumbula, na sajenu atoliki mbengalelu jangu.” Kabhete akundaluki tati waki, “Bho, ngachewameki mbengalelu jokapi jela?”<verse eid="GEN 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Isaka akayangike, “Nyomwili kuntenda Yakobo kubha mtawala waku, na bhalongu bhaki bhokapi numpekihi bhakubha bhatumika bhaki. Numpekihi mahunu na divai, henu nukuhengila kyani wehapa wa mwanango?”<verse eid="GEN 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Esau akumpwaghi tati waki, “Bho, wa tati wangu ubhi le na mbengalelu jimu pela? Umbengalya na nepani bhelabhela, chondi tati wango. Bhela Esau akajamalili, na kulela.”<verse eid="GEN 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Panihapa Isaka, tati waki akayangike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">“Matamu ghaku anaghakubha kutali na luhombi lolubholalanile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">na kutali na lyangami la kunani kumahunde.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Anautamaje kwa lipanga lako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">nanau anaukubha mtumika waka ndongu wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">Nambu pawibya ulikombwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">wibya ulihekiti lingolingoli laki pahingu jako.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Panihapa Esau akunhakali Yakobo kwa ndandi ja mbengalelu ambaju tati waki akabhi ampengalile. Esau akapwaghiki muntima waki, “Machobha gha kundelela tati wangu ghaheghalile, panihapa nde ananunkoma ndongu wangu Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Lebeka paakajowini malobhi ghaakalongi Esau mwana waki nkolongwa, akundohiki Yakobo mwana waki nchoku, na kumpwaghila, “Ulilingalyaje, ndongu waku Esau alijeghe mtima kwa liholalelu la kupala kukukoma. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Henu, wa mwana wangu, ujowanyaje malobhi ghango, ubhokaje, utililaje manyata kwaka Labani, mbeli wango joatama ku Halani. <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />Ukatama naku kwa machobha machokope mbaka inyela yaka ndongu waku paijomukaje. <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />Chikahi ndongu wako inyela yaki payikubha ijomwike na alibhalili ghauntendile, ananukutumila ubholu ukelabhukaje. Bho, maghambu kiki nunhoa mabhokapi mwabheli kwa lichobha limo?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isaka antuma Yakobo kwaka Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Bhela Lebeka akumpwaghi Isaka, “Muntima wangu ngachemi na chiheko kwa ndandi ja akambomba bhaka Esau Bhahiti. Anangati Yakobo anatowi jumu wa akambomba ngati abhabha Bhahiti, bho, matamu ghangu anaghakubha na ndandi bhole ja kujendalela kubha mwome?”<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Bhela Isaka akundohiki Yakobo, akumpengalili, na kundaghalakila, akapwaghaje, “Ngawitoghola mbomba wa ku Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Ubhokaje manyata, na ujenda ku Padani Alamu, kunyumba jaka hokolu waku Besueli, ukuntoghula jumu wa akakamwali waka nijaja waku Labani. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Chapanga Mweni Makili akupengalyaje, na kukujonjukela lubheleku lwaku nakanope, nahuli uwezaje kubha na lipogha likolongwa la bhandu bha mataifa! <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Chapanga akupengalyaje wehapa papamu na lubheleku lwaku ngati moakumpengalile Ibulahimu, nahuli uwezaje kutawala mu inchi jeutama sajenu ngati ungene, inchi ambaju Chapanga akumpeki Ibulahimu!” <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Bhela, Isaka akuntumiki Yakobo, najombi akapiti ku Padani Alamu kwaka Labani, mwana waka Besueli, wa likabila la Bhaalamu, mbeli waka Lebeka, mabhu waka Yakobo na Esau.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau atoghola mbomba jongi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Henu Esau akamanyi kubha Isaka ampengalili Yakobo na kuntuma kujenda ku Padani Alamu nahuli akatoghula mbomba konihoko, na kubha chikahi paakumpengalile akundaghalaki, akapwaghaje, “Ngawitoghola mbomba kuhuma kwa Bhakanaani,” <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />bhelabhela akamanyi kubha Yakobo akabhajowanili tati waki na mabhu waki, na kujenda ku Padani Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Bhela, Esau akamanyi kubha Isaka atati waki ngacheabhapaliki akambomba bha Bhakanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Bhela Esau akapiti kwaka Ishimaeli na kuntoghola Mahalasi, joakabhi mwali waka Ishimaeli mwana waka Ibulahimu, ndombu waka Nebayosi, kubha nhwanu waki jongi papamu na akabhahanu bhaki bhangi bhaakabhi nabhu.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulota kwaka Yakobo ku Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Yakobo akabhokiki ku Beeli Sheba, na kujenda ku Halani. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Paakahiki pandu pangi, akaghonili panihapa maghambu lyobha lakabhi lijibhile. Akatoliki liganga limu la pandu panipala, na kulibheka pahi ja mmutu waki, na kughonela lughonu pala pala. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Chikahi paakabhi aghonile akalotiki ndoto, na mu ndoto jeniheji, akaweni ngazi jejijemakiki panani ja inchi, na incha jaki jakahikiki mbaka kunani kumahunde. Kabhete, bhatumika bha kunani kwaka Chapanga bhakabhi bhakwela na kuhelela mu ngazi jeniheje. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Panani ja ngazi jeniheji akajemiki Bambo Chapanga, akapwaghaje, “Nepani nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waka Ibulahimu tati waku, na Chapanga waka Isaka. Inchi jenjenu jeughonili panani jaki, ananukupekya wehapa na lubheleku lwako. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Lubheleku lwaku analukubha ngati luhombi lwa ndema, nanau anaujaghanyaje ku upambala wa Kolijibhi lyobha, na Kolipita lyobha, na Kungonde na Kunkache. Na kupetela wehapa na ibheleku yaku, bhandu bha mataifa ghokapi gha pundema anabhapengalikaje. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Lingalyaje, nepani mi papamu na wehapa, ananukulendaje kila kowijendaje na ananukukelabhuhaje kabhete mu inchi jenjeno. Maghambu nganakuleki mbaka panibya nukuhengile ghanukupwaghi hagha.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Chikahi Yakobo paakajumwiki kuhuma mu lughono, akapwaghike, “Chakaka Bambo Chapanga abhi pandu pambane, wala nepani ngachenamanye.” <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Bhela Yakobo akajowipi na kupwagha, “Pandu pambani pajoghoha ngati kyani! Pangi pambani nde pajibhi Nyumba jaka Chapanga, na ndyangu ukolongwa wa kunani kumahunde.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Yakobo akajumwiki lukela pachibhombu, akatoliki liganga lela lelakabhi abhekiki pahi ja mmutu waki, na kulihimika ngati nguzo, na kujeghela mahuta panani jaki. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Akapalohiki pandu panihapa Beseli, Beseli ndandi jaki nde Nyumba jaka Chapanga, nambu lihina la muchi ghonihoghu pakutumbula hapa ukalowakiki Luzu. <verse eid="GEN 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Bhela Yakobo akalapiki, akapwaghaje, “Ngati Chapanga anaubhi papamu na nepani, na kunenda mu mwanja wangu, na kumbekeha chilebhi ngulaje, na ingobhu nhwataje, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />na anaungelawihi lukwali kunyumba jaka tati wangu, panihapa nde Bambo Chapanga anaukubha Chapanga wango. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Na liganga lendenu lenhimiki pambani ngati nguzo analikubha Nyumba jaka Chapanga, na mu ghokapi ghawimbekyaje, chakaka ananukubhokiha wehapa pandu pamu pa komi.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo ahika kunyumba jaka Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Bhela Yakobo akajendalili na mwanja waki, na kuhika ku inchi ya bhandu bha Kolipita lyobha. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Konihoku akaweni chilibha cha machi kuchitengo, papamu na mapogha ghatatu gha mambelele ghaghonili pambipi na chilibhi hechi, maghambu ghakabhi ghapekewa machi kuhuma mu chilibha hechi, na pakabhili na liganga likolongwa pundomu wa chilibha hechi. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Chikahi mambelele paghakubha ghalibhongini panihapa, bhadima bhalihingaliya liganga heli kuhuma pundomu wa chilibha na kughakenga mambelele. Anabhajomwi kughakenga bhalikelabhua liganga heli na kuchiyekalela chilibha hechi.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Yakobo akabhalalukile, “Bhalongu bhango, mabhanganya nhumiki kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Bhakayangiki, “Tuhumiki ku muchi wa Halani.”<verse eid="GEN 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Yakobo akabhalalukile, “Bho, mummanyi le Labani mwana waka Naholi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Bhakayangiki, “Ena, tummanye.”<verse eid="GEN 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Bhela Yakobo akabhalalukile, “Bho, alama lelo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">Bhakayangike, “Alama, na hata mwali waki Laheli, jo kola ahikiki na mambelele ghaki.”<verse eid="GEN 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Yakobo akapwaghike, “Lingalya, mona kwakali muhe, wala nga chikahi cha kubhongana hinyama. Nkenga mambelele machi, na njenda mkaghadimaje.”<verse eid="GEN 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Bhakayangike, “Ngachetuweza kuhenga bhenibhela mbaka mapogha ghokapi ghalibhonganaje papamu, na liganga libya likangakiki kuhuma pundomu wa chilibha, panihapa nde patwikenga mambelele.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Yakobo paakabhi alonge nabhu, Laheli akahikiki papamu na mambelele ghaka tati waki, maghambu akabhi mdima wa mambelele. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Yakobo paakumbweni Laheli mwali waka Labani, mbeli waka mabhu waki, papamu na mambelele ghaka Labani, akapiti kulihingaliya liganga kuhuma pundomu wa chilibha na kughakenga mambelele ghaka nijaja waki. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Bhela Yakobo akundamukili Laheli kwa upalu, na kulela kwa sauti ngolongwa, kwa ndandi ja chiheku. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Panihapa Yakobo akumpwaghi Laheli kubha jombi nde ndongu waka tati waki, na kubha nde mwana waka Lebeka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:12">Bhela Laheli akakembili kujenda kumpwaghila tati waki. <verse eid="GEN 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Palapala Labani paakajowini malobhi panani jaka Yakobo, nijaja waki, akakembili kujenda kunjopalela. Akunjobhatili na kundamukila kwa upalu, na kundeta kunyumba jaki. Panihapa Yakobo akumpwaghi Labani mambu ghanihagha ghokapi. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Labani akumpwaghile, “Chakaka wehapa nde undongu wangu wa mwahi ghumo.” Yakobo akatami naku kwa chikahi cha mwehi ghumu.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo abhatoghola akakamwali bhaka Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Labani akumpwaghile, “Hata ngati wehapa undongu wangu, ngacheipalika undumakya waka. Henu umbwaghilaje, bho, upala nukulepa kyane?” <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Henu, Labani akabhi na akakamwali bhabheli, mwali nkolongwa akalowakiki Lea, na mwali nchoku akalowakiki Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Lea akabhi na mihu ghanga kulinga wichu, nambu Laheli akabhi na umbu linyahi, na akabhi mnyahi namaa kwa sula.<verse eid="GEN 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Yakobo akumpaliki Laheli, bhela, akumpwaghi Labani, “Ananukutumakya kwa hyaka saba kwa ndandi ja kumpata Laheli, mwali waku nchoku.”<verse eid="GEN 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Labani akapwaghike, “Mbanga nukutoghuke wehapa kuliku kuntoghuke mundu jongi jokapi. Ujendalya kutama pambani na nepani.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Bhela, Yakobo akuntumakili Labani kwa hyaka saba nahuli kumpata Laheli, nambu kwaki chikahi chenihechi chakabhi ngati machobha machokopi pela, maghambu akumpaliki namaa Laheli.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Bhela Yakobo akumpwaghi Labani, “Umbekya nhwanu wango, ndandi machobha ghangu ghajomwike, nanatu mbala kuhimangana naku kihyegha.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Bhela, Labani akabhabhongini bhandu bhokapi bha pandu panipala, na kutenda uwangalalu. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Nambu pakwahiki pakamihi, Labani akuntoliki Lea, mwali waki nkolongwa, na kumpeleka kwaka Yakobo, najombi akaghoni naku kihyegha. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Labani akumbohiki Zilipa mtumika waki wa chimbomba kubha mtumika waka Lea. <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Chilabhu jaki lukela, Yakobo akakangichi kumbi Lea! Bhela Yakobo akumpwaghi Labani, “Bho, aleli nde lijambu bhole leundendile? Bho, si nakukutumakili kwa ndandi jaka Laheli? Bho, maghambu kiki utehi kungolowa?”<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Labani akayangike, “Nga ntetu witu kuntoghukela mwali nchoku mangani jaka mwali nkolongwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Ujomulya hoti machobha saba gha ukwati waka mwali ajoju, natatu anatukupekya na Laheli kwa kundumakila hyaka yengi saba.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Yakobo akahengiki bhenibhela. Akajomulili machobha saba na Lea, na panihapa Labani akumpeki Laheli mwali waki abya nhwanu waki. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Labani akumbohiki Biliha, mtumika waki wa chimbomba nahuli kubha mtumika waka Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Bhelabhela Yakobo akaghoni na Laheli kihyegha, najombi akumpaliki nakanopi Laheli kuliku Lea. Yakobo akuntumakili Labani kwa hyaka yengi saba.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Bambo Chapanga akaweni kubha Lea ngacheakapalakike, akunjangatili kupata bhana, nambu Laheli akabhi ngulumba. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Lea akapatiki chitumbu na kumbeleka mwana wa chikambaku, akundohiki lihina laki Leubeni, akapwaghaje, “Chakaka Bambo Chapanga aweni mang'ahiku ghangu, sajenu ndomi wangu anaambalaje.” <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Lea akapatiki kabhete chitumbu, akumbeliki mwana wa chikambaku, akapwaghaje, “Kwa kubha Bambo Chapanga ajowini kubha nepani ngachenapalakiki, bhelabhela ambeki kabhete mwana ajoju.” Bhela akundohiki lihina laki Simeoni. <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Lea akapatiki kabhete chitumbu, na kumbeleka mwana wa chikambaku, akapwaghaje, “Bhela chikahi chenjenu ndomi wangu anaakubha papamu na nepani, maghambu numbelakili bhana bhatatu.” Bhela akundohiki lihina laki Lawi. <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Lea akapatiki kabhete chitumbu, akumbeliki mwana wa chikambaku, akapwaghaje, “Chikahi chenjenu ananundumbalya Bambo Chapanga.” Bhela akundohiki lihina laki Yuda, na kukotoka kubheleka bhana.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Bhela Laheli paakaweni kubha ngacheambelake Yakobo bhana, akumboni wihu Lea, ndombu waki. Akumpwaghi Yakobo, “Umbekya bhana, nanga bhela, nepani anambotilaje.”<verse eid="GEN 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Yakobo akamuyomili Laheli, na kumpwaghila, “Bho, nepani le mi pandu paka Chapanga, joakuhibhalakili ngawibheleka bhana?”<verse eid="GEN 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Laheli akayangike, “Pambani abhi Biliha, mtumika wangu wa chimbomba. Ughonila naku kihyegha nahuli abhelaka bhana pandu pangu nepani, na kwa kupetela kwaki nepani nanatu nhweza kupata lubheleku.” <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Bhela Laheli akumpeki Yakobo Biliha akubha nhwanu wake. Na Yakobo akaghoni naku kihyegha. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Biliha akapatiki chitumbu, na kumbelakela Yakobo mwana wa chikambaku. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Panihapa Laheli akapwaghike, “Chapanga andendili lijambu lambone, ajowini sauti jangu, na kumbekeha mwana.” Bhela akundohiki mwana jonihoju lihina laki Dani. <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Biliha mtumika waka Laheli, akapatiki chitumbu kabhete, na kumbelakela Yakobo mwana wa kabhele wa chikambako. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Laheli akapwaghike, “Ngomini ngondo ngolongwa na ndombu wango, nanatu nhwezike.” Bhela akundohiki lihina laki Nafutali.<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Lea paakaweni kubha akotwiki kubheleka, akuntoliki Zilipa, mtumika waki wa chimbomba, na kumpekeha Yakobo akubha nhwanu wake. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Zilipa, mtumika waka Lea, akumbelakili Yakobo mwana wa chikambaku. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Lea akapwaghike, “Bahati jambone!” Bhela akundohiki lihina laki Gadi. <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Zilipa, mtumika waka Lea, akumbelakili Yakobo mwana wa kabhele wa chikambaku. <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Lea akapwaghike, “Kwa ntundu bhole momeli na chiheko! Kwa ndandi akambomba anabhanoha chiheko.” Bhela akundohiki lihina laki Asheli.<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Chikahi cha kuhuna ingano, Leubeni akapiti kungonda na konihoku akajiweni mitela jejatumiki ngati mandunguluse, na kundetela Lea mabhu waki. Laheli akumpwaghi Lea, “Chondi, umbekya mitela jakumu jejatumiki ngati mandunguluse ghaka mwana wako.”<verse eid="GEN 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Nambu Lea akumpwaghile, “Bho, lijambu lichoku lelo kunyaghula ndomi wango, na upala kabhete kujitola mitela jejitumika ngati mandunguluse ghaka mwana wango?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Laheli akayangike, “Ngati anaumbekihi mitela jejitumika ngati mandunguluse ghaka mwana waku, Yakobo anaaghonila kwaku ikilu jenu.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Chikahi Yakobo paakakelawiki kuhuma kungonda pakamihi jela, Lea akapiti kunjopalela, akapwaghaje, “Lalenu ikupalika kughonela na nepani kihyegha, maghambu nukuhemili kwa mitela jejitumika ngati mandunguluse ghaka mwana wango.” Bhela Yakobo akaghonili naku kihyegha ikilu jela.<verse eid="GEN 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Chapanga akunjowini Lea, najombi akapatiki chitumbu na kumbelakela Yakobo mwana wa kahanu wa chikambaku. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Lea akapwaghike, “Chapanga ambekihi nhupu wangu, maghambu numpekihi ndomi wangu mtumika wangu wa chimbomba.” Bhela Akundohiki lihina laki Isakali. <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Lea akapatiki kabhete chitumbu, na kumbelakela Yakobo mwana wa sita wa chikambaku. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Lea akapwaghike, “Chapanga ambekihi nhupu jamboni namaa. Chikahi chenjenu ndomi wangu anaandopilaje, maghambu numbelakili mwana wa sita wa chikambaku.” Bhela akundohiki lihina laki Zabuloni. <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Palongi akumbeliki mwali, na akundohiki lihina laki Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Panihapa Chapanga akunkombwiki Laheli, Chapanga akajowini malobhu ghaki na kumbopola lutumbu lwaki. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Laheli akapatiki chitumbu, na kumbeleka mwana wa chikambaku, na kupwagha, “Chapanga amokili iyoni jango.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Akundohiki mwana hoju lihina laki Yusufu, akapwaghaje, “Chapanga na anyonjukyaje mwana jonge.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujonjukeka kwa hinyama yaka Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Bhela Laheli paakumbeliki Yusufu, Yakobo akumpwaghi Labani, “Unyetakalyaje mujaje kunyumba jango. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Umbekya akabhahanu bhangu na bhana bhangu, bhandumakili kubhapata, moka nabho. Maghambu umanyi utumika wangu ghonukutumakile.”<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Nambu Labani akumpwaghile, “Chondi nukulobha umbekya mbekenyu ja kulongela lijambu limu, utama na nepani. Kwa ndandi manyi kwa indela ja mabhono kubha Bambo Chapanga ambengalili kwa ndandi jako. <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Uloghula malepu ghako, nanatu ananepaje.”<verse eid="GEN 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Yakobo akumpwaghile, “Wehapa wamwete umanyi ntundu monukutumakile, na ntundu monighohili hinyana yaku. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Kichokopi cheukabhi nachu mangane ja kuhika kwangu kijonjukiki namaa, najombi Bambo Chapanga akupengalili pokapi pambitaje. Nambu sajenu, bho, ananingalya lile mambu gha munyumba jangu namwete?”<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Labani akundalukile, “Nukupekya kike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Yakobo akayangike, “Ngawimbekeha chindu, nambu ngati anaunhengili lijambu limu haleli, ananyendalya kughadima na kughaghoha mapogha ghaku. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Unyetakalya mbetaje mu mabhongelu ghaku ghokapi lalenu, mohaje hinyama yeibhi na madoa madoa au mabaka mabaka, kila chinyama chipili pachilanda ja mambeleli hagha, na kila imbuhi jejibhi na madoa madoa au mabaka mabaka. Ghanihagha nde anaghakubha malepu ghango. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Bhela, machobha ghaghahika, ulongwana wangu anaubhonikanaje hotuhotu pawihikaje kulinga malepu ghango. Imbuhi jangu jokapi jangakubha na madoa madoa au mabaka mabaka, au limbelele langakubha lipili, yeniheyi anaibhalangika itehi kujibhakika.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Labani akapwaghike, “Nyetakela, na kubya ngati moupwaghile.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Nambu lichobha lela lela Labani akabhohiki imbuhi mapongu ghokapi ghaghabhi na misitali au madoa madoa, imbuhi yokapi imbomba yeikabhi na madoa madoa au mabaka mabaka, kila chinyama chechakabhi na lidoa lihuhu muhyegha jaki, na kila limbeleli lipili, akaghabhekiki pahi ja ulingalilu wa bhana bhaki. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Bhela Labani akalitengiki na Yakobo kwa lujendu lwa mwanja wa machobha ghatatu pachilanda jaki na Yakobo, najombi Yakobo akahighalili kulidima lipogha laka Labani lelakahighali lela.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Hata bhela, Yakobo akatoliki fitu ibhehi yeyahekitwi chikahi chela chela ya mikongu ja mlubina, mlozi na mwalamoni na kujibabua nahuli misitali mihuhu jibhonikanaje mu fitu yeniheyi. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Bhela akaibhekiki fitu yeakaibabwi heyi pandu pa kukengela hinyama machi, pandu ambapu hinyama ikabhi ihika kunywa machi. Hinyama payahikiki kunywa machi, koni yakabya ipala kupata imbeju, <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />hinyama heyi yakakwelakiki chikahi fitu heyi ikabya palongi jabhu, na hinyama yeyapatiki chitumbu palongi ja fitu yeniheyi, yakabheliki hinyama yeibhi na misitali, madoa madoa na mabaka mabaka.<verse eid="GEN 30:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Yakobo akabhatengiki bhanambelele, na kubhalangiha sula yabhu ku hinyama yeibhi na misitali, na kila chinyama chipili chaka Labani. Bhela, Yakobo akatengiki libhongelu laki mweni, pangakuhangaghana na hinyama yaka Labani.<verse eid="GEN 30:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Kila chikahi hinyama yeibhi na makili payapaliki kupata imbeju, Yakobo akaibhekiki fitu yela pandu pa kukengela hinyama machi, palongi ja hinyama heyi, nahuli ikwelakikaje pambipi na fitu yeniheyi. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Nambu payahikiki hinyama yangakubha na makili ngacheabhekiki fitu yeniheyi. Bhela, hinyama yangakubha na makili yakabhi yaka Labani, na hinyama yeibhi na makili yakabhi yaka Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Bhela, kwa indela ajeji Yakobo akajendalili kuneng'anela namaa, akabhi na hinyama yamaheli, bhatumika bha chimbomba na bha chikambaku, ngamia na maponda.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo antila Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Bhela, Yakobo akabhajowini bhana bhaka Labani bhakapwaghaje, “Yakobo atoliki kila chindu chechakabhili chaka tati witu, najombi apatiki kubha na hindu yamaheli kubhokana na hindu yaka tati witu.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Yakobo akapaweni pamihu jaka Labani, kubha ngacheakabhi andingalila ngati lichu na lakwichu. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Yakobo, “Ukelabhukaje ku inchi ja akatati bhaku na bhalongu bhako, nanatu anangubha papamu na wehapa.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Bhela, Yakobo akatumiki ubholu kwaka Laheli na Lea kubhaloha bhahikaje koakabhi adima mabhongelu gha hinyama yake. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Yakobo akabhapwaghile, “Mona pamihu jaka tati winu, kubha ngacheaningalila wichu ngati lichu na lakwichu. Nambu Chapanga waka tati wangu abhi papamu na nepani. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Nanamu mmanyi kubha nuntumakili tati winu kwa makili ghangu ghokapi. <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />Na tati winu atehi kungolowa na kung'anambula malepu ghangu mala komi. Nambu Chapanga ngacheakundekiki aniyonangaje. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Tati winu paakapwaghiki, ‘Hinyama yeibhi na mabaka mabaka anaikubha malepu ghaku,’ bhela mabhongelu ghokapi ghakabheliki hinyama yeibhi na madoa madoa. Na kila paakapwaghiki, ‘Hinyama yeibhi na misitali anaikubha malepu ghaku,’ bhela mabhongelu ghokapi ghakabheliki hinyama yeibhi na misitali. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Henu Chapanga atoliki mabhongelu gha hinyama yaka tati winu, na ambeki nepani.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />“Chikahi cha hinyama kubhelakana, nakajinwihi mihu ghangu na kubhona mu ndoto kubha mapongu ghaghakweliki hinyama yengi heyi ghakabhi na misitali, madoa madoa, na mabaka mabaka. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Mtumika wa kunani kwaka Chapanga akambwaghi mu ndoto, ‘Yakobo!’ Nanatu nakayangike, ‘Naam.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Najombi akapwaghike, ‘Ujinula mihu ghaku ubhonaje, mapongu ghokapi ghaghabhi na misitali, madoa madoa, na mabaka mabaka ghakweliki hinyama imbomba. Ndenda anana maghambu niweni ntundu Labani moakabhi akuhengela. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Nepani nde Chapanga nenakakupitalili ku Beseli, kola koukajitili mahuta pa nguzu ja liganga, na pandu pala paukanapile. Sajenu ubhokaje mu inchi jenjenu manyata na ubhujaje ku inchi jeukabhelakike.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Laheli na Lea bhakayangike, “Bho, tepani tuhighali le na pandu pokapi pa kupwelela kunyumba jaka tati wito? <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Bho, jombi ngacheatuweni tepani ngati bhaghene? Nga ngati atehi kutulombesa pela, nambu akuliki mbaka mbija hitu yokapi. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Chakaka hindu yokapi yeatoliki Chapanga kuhuma kwaka tati witu nde hindu hitu na bhana bhito. Bhela, uhenga lijambu lokapi lela leakupwaghi Chapanga.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Panihapa Yakobo akabhokiki, na kubhakweha bhana bhaki na akabhahanu bhaki panani ja ngamia. <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />Yakobo akaitoliki hinyama yaki yokapi, hindu yaki yokapi yeakabhi apatike, na hinyama yeakapatiki ku Padani Alamu kujenda nayu kwaka Isaka tati waki ku inchi ja Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Bhela, Labani paakapiti kughaheketa mangoma gha mambeleli ghaki, Laheli akapiti kujibha imong'umongu ya ichapanga yaka tati waki. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Yakobo akunkolwi Labani, wa likabila la Bhaalamu, kwa kulepalela kumpwaghila kubha atenda kuntila. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Bhela, Yakobo akatoliki hindu yaki yokapi yeakabhi nayu na kutila manyata. Paakaulombwiki Nkoka Eufulate akapiti ku inchi ja itombi ja ku Gileadi.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Labani anjengalela Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Lichobha la katatu, Labani bhakumpwaghi kubha Yakobo atehi kutila. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Bhela, Labani akabhatoliki bhalongu bhaki na kunjengalela Yakobo kwa machobha saba, na kunhimanila ku inchi ja itombi ja ku Gileadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Chapanga akunhiki Labani, wa likabila la Bhaalamu, mu ndoto ja ikilu na kumpwaghila, “Ulilingalyaje ngawilongela lilobhi lokapi lela kwaka Yakobo, likubhi lamboni au lihakau.” <verse eid="GEN 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Yakobo akabhi abhekiki lihema laki ku inchi ja itombi ja ku Gileadi chikahi Labani paakunhimanile, Labani na bhalongu bhaki nabhombi bhakabhekiki lihema labhu konihoku ku inchi ja itombi ja ku Gileadi.<verse eid="GEN 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Bhela, Labani akumpwaghi Yakobo, “Bho, uhengiki kyane? Mbona ungolwihi na kubhatola akakamwali bhangu ngati mateka kungondo? <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Maghambu kiki utiliki kwa kulihiya? Maghambu kiki utehi kungolowa? Maghambu kiki ngachewambwaghile nahuli nukulaghilaje na ujendaje kwa chiheko, na nyembu, na ing'oma na lilimba? <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Wala ngachewanekiki nabhajobhatya bhachokolu bhangu na kubhalaghila akakamwali bhango? Chakaka uhengiki chindu cha king'ang'a! <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Nepani mi na uwezu wa kukuyonanga, nambu Chapanga waka tati waku akambitalili ikilu ja kujumukila lalenu, na kumbwaghila, ‘Ulilingalyaje, ngawampwaghila lilobhi lokapi lela Yakobo, likubhi lamboni au lihakau.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Bhela, sajenu manyi kubha utiliki maghambu utokulili kubhuja kunyumba jaka tati waku. Nambu maghambu kike ujibhiki imong'umong'u ya ichapanga yango.”<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Yakobo akayangike, “Nakajowipi, maghambu nakaholali kubha ukabhya unyawile akakamwali bhaku kwa makile. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Nambu ngati anaunhimani mundu jokapi joabhi na imong'umong'u ya ichapanga yaku, ngayikubha mwome. Palongi ja bhalongu bhitu abhabha, ulingaje wamwete ubhonaje ngati anakubhili na chokapi chechibhi chako pambani cheminachu nepani, na ngati anachibhili, uchitolaje.” Bhela Yakobo ngacheakamanyi kubha Laheli akabhi ajibhiki imong'umong'u ya ichapanga heyi.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Bhela, Labani akajingili mu lihema laka Yakobo, na lihema laka Lea, na lihema la bhatumika bhaki bhabheli, wala ngacheaiwene. Akapitiki mu lihema laka Lea, na kujingila mu lihema laka Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Bhela Laheli akabhi aitoliki imong'umong'u ya ichapanga yela na kuibheka pahi ja matandiku gha ngamia na kughatamila. Labani akailondiki mu lihema lokapi, nambu ngacheaiwene. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Laheli akumpwaghi tati wake, “Chondi bambo, ngawihakalila, maghambu ngachenhweza kujema palongi jako, ndandi mili mu machobha ghango.” Bhela, Labani akailondiki imong'umong'u ya ichapanga yaki, nambu ngacheaiwene.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Yakobo akayomiki na kulochana na Labani, akapwaghaje, “Bho, lihakau langu nepani libhi kwako?” Yakobo akundaluki Labani kwa inyela, “Bho, lihoku bhole lenhengiki nepani hata unyobhalela anana? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Upapihi papihi hindu yangu yokapi, bho, chindu bhole cheuchiweni cha munyumba jako? Uchibheka apapa palongi ja bhalongu bhangu, na bhalongu bhako, nabhombi bhatemulaje pachilanda jito. <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Ndami na wehapa kwa chikahi cha hyaka ishiline. Mambeleli ghaku na imbuhi yaku, ngacheiyoningi itumbu, wala ngachenguliki mambeleli makambaku kuhuma mu mabhongelu ghako. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Ngachenukuletili chinyama chechalumakiki na chinyama cha muchitengo, nambu nakalepili hasala heji namwete. Kabhete ukanaiki malepu kwa chokapi chechajibhakiki muhi au ikilu. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Hajeji jakabhi hali jango, muhi lyobha lakanyochike, na imbepu ikilu, na lughonu lukamokiki mu mihu ghango. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Hyaka hayeyi ishilini ndami munyumba jaku, nakakutumakili kwa hyaka komi na ncheche kwa ndandi ja akakamwali bhaku bhabheli, na hyaka sita kwa ndandi ja hinyama yako. Nambu wehapa ukang'anambwili malepu ghangu mala komi. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Ngati Chapanga waka tati wangu, Chapanga waka Ibulahimu ambaju akuntendiki tati wangu Isaka kubhaghaja, ngaakabhili upambala wangu, chakaka ukabhya unekike moka mabhoku matopo. Nambu Chapanga akaghaweni mang'ahiku ghangu na mahengu ghanahengiki kwa mabhoku ghango, jombi akakulakalili ikilu ja kujumukila laleno.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lulaghilu pachilanda jaka Yakobo na Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Labani akamuyangiki Yakobo, “Akambomba abhabha nde akakamwali bhango, bhana abhabha nde bhana bhango na mabhongelu aghagha nde mabhongelu ghango. Nambu bho, lalenu nhweza kuhenga lijambu bhole kubhatenda bhahighalyaje akakamwali bhangu abhabha na bhana bhabhu abhabha? <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Bhela, sajenu uhikaje tuhengaje lulaghilu, wehapa na nepani, na libya ngati ulandilu pachilanda jitu.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Yakobo akatoliki liganga na kulijemeka ngati nguzo. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Yakobo akabhapwaghi bhalongu bhake, “Mbonganaje maganga.” Bhela bhakatoliki maganga na kughabhongana na kubha lituhi, na bhakakuliki chilebhi pambipi na lituhi la maganga heli. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Labani akalohiki lituhi la maganga heli Yegali Sahaduta, nambu Yakobo akapalohiki Galeedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Labani akapwaghike, “Lituhi aleli la maganga nde ulandilu pachilanda jaku na nepani laleno.” Nde ndandi lakalohakiki lihina laki Galeedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Bhelabhela pakalowakiki Misipa, maghambu akapwaghiki, “Bambo Chapanga atulingalyaje pachilanda jaku wehapa na nepani, chikahi kila jumu witu paakubha kutali na njake.” <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Ngati anaubhang'ahiki akakamwali bhangu, au anautowili akakamwali bhangi nakanopi ja akakamwali bhangu, hata ngati njeta mundu joabhi papamu na tepani, ukombuka kubha Chapanga nde mlandilu pachilanda jangu nepani na wehapa. <verse eid="GEN 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Labani akumpwaghi Yakobo, “Ulingaje lituhi aleli la maganga na nguzu jenyemiki pachilanda jangu na wehapa. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Lituhi aleli nde ulandilu na nguzu ajeji nde ulandilu, kubha nepani nganipeti lituhi aleli kuhika kwaku wehapa kukuyonanga, nanau ngawipeti lituhi aleli na nguzu ajeji kuhika kwangu nepani kuniyonanga. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Chapanga waka Ibulahimu, na Chapanga waka Naholi, na Chapanga waka tati wabhu, na atemulaje pachilanda jito.” Bhela, Yakobo akalapiki kwaka Chapanga joakuntendiki Isaka tati waki, kubhaghaja. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Panihapa Yakobo akachinjiki nyambiku pachitombi, akabhalohiki bhalongu bhaki bhahikaje kula chilebhe, nabhombi bhakakuliki, na kutama ikilu jokapi kuchitombi hoku. <verse eid="GEN 31:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Chilabhu jaki Labani akabhokiki lukela pachibhombu, akabhajobhatili bhachokolu bhaki na akakamwali bhaki na kubhapengalela. Na panihapa Labani akabhokiki, na kukelabhuka kunyumba jaki.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo aliandaa kuhimangana na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Yakobo akajendalili na mwanja waki, na bhatumika bha kunani bhaka Chapanga bhakahimangini naku. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Yakobo paakabhaweni, akapwaghike, “Haleli nde likambi laka Chapanga!” Bhela akapalohiki pandu panihapa Mahanaimu.<verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Bhela, Yakobo akabhatumiki bhabholu palongi jaki kujenda kwaka Esau mbeli waki ku Seili, ku inchi ja Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Yakobo akabhatumiki bhatumika bhundongulyaje, akapwaghaje, “Mukumpwaghila anana bambo wangu, Esau, ‘Mtumika waku Yakobo apwagha, nakabhili ndama papamu na Labani, na nakabhili konihoku mbaka sajenu. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Mili na ng'ombi na maponda, mambeleli na imbuhe, bhatumika bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba. Henu nduma ubholu ghongoni kwaka bambo wangu nahuli mbata chihomu palongi jako.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Bhabholu pabhakelawiki kwaka Yakobo, bhakumpwaghile, “Tukapiti kuhimangana na ndongu waku Esau, najombi ahika kukujopalela, akabhya na akanalomi mia ncheche.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Bhela, kwa lujoghopu na choghoi chikolongwa, Yakobo akabhagabhinyi bhandu bhabhakabhi papamu naku mabhongelu ghabheli, bhelabhela akagabhinyi mabhongelu gha mambeleli na imbuhe, na bhelabhela ng'ombi na ngamia. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Yakobo akapwaghike, “Ngati Esau anahikiki na kuliyonanga libhongelu limu, libhongelu lengi liweza kutila.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Yakobo akalobhike, “Wenga wa Chapanga waka tati wangu Ibulahimu, Chapanga waka tati wangu Isaka, wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, weukambwaghili, ‘Ukelabhukaje ku inchi jaku na bhalongu bhaku, nanatu ananukutenda uneng'anyaje, <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />nepani ngacheimbalika chihomu chaku na ulongwana waku wokapi ghounhengile nuntumika wako. Maghambu nakabhi na ndonga pela mumabhoku ghangu chikahi panalombwiki nkoka aghoghu wa Yoludani, nambu sajenu mili na mabhongelu aghagha ghabheli. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Nukulobha ungengalyaje sajenu kuhuma mu makili ghaka ndongu wangu Esau, kwa ndandi nyoghopa kubha anahikaje kungoma, na bhelabhela kubhakoma akamabhu na bhana bhabhu. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Nambu wehapa ukambwaghili anaunhengila mambu ghambone, na bhabhelakeka bhangu bhakubha bhamaheli ngati luhanga lwa mumaheku ja bahali ambalu ngachelubhalangika kwa ntundu molujolukile.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Bhela, Yakobo akaghonili panipala ikilu jela. Na pachilanda ja hinyama yeakabhi nayu, akahawili nhupu kwa ndandi jaka Esau, ndongu wake. <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />Akahawili imbuhi imbomba mia ibheli, na imbuhi mapongu ishiline, mambeleli mambomba mia ibheli, na mambeleli makambaku ishiline, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />ngamia yeijongeha selasini papamu na bhana bhabhu, ng'ombi imbomba alobaini, na ng'ombi mapongu komi, na maponda mambomba ishiline, na maponda makambaku komi. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Akaibhekiki pahi ja ulingalilu wa bhatumika bhaki, kila libhongelu pakanjika jaki, na kubhapwaghila, “Ndongulyaje palongi jangu, na mkajileka mbekenyu pachilanda ja libhongelu na libhongelu.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Akundaghalaki mtumika wa kutumbula, akapwaghaje, “Chikahi ndongu wangu Esau paanahimangana na wehapa, aweza kukulalukila, ‘Bho, wehapa untumika waka nane? Ujenda kwako? Na hinyama heyeyi palongi jaku nde yaka nane?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />Ikupalika umpwaghilaje, ‘Hayeyi nde mali ghaka ntumika waku Yakobo, nayombi nde nhupu kwaka bambo wangu Esau. Na Yakobo mweni ahika kunyuma jito.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Akundaghalaki kabhete wa kabhele, na wa katatu, na bhokapi bhabhakajengalile na mabhongelu ghabhu akapwaghaje, “Anana nde momwampwaghilaje Esau, chikahi anamuhimangini naku. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Impalika kupwagha, ‘Mtumika waku Yakobo ahika kunyuma jito.’ ” Maghambu akaholalili, “Ananhweza kunheleya inyela yaki kwa nhupu hayeyi yenongukela, na pakujomukela ananhweza kumbona pamihu jaki, na pangi anaanyopalyaje.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Bhela, nhupu yaka Yakobo yakalongulili palongi jaki, nambu mweni akaghonili palikambi ikilu jela.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo akomana malimba na Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Ikilu jela Yakobo akajumwiki na kubhatola akabhahanu bhaki bhabheli, bhatumika bhaki bhabheli bha chimbomba na bhana bhaki komi na jumu, na kulomboka nkoka Yaboki. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Akabhatoliki, na kubhalombosha punkoka, na akalombwishi mali ghokapi ghaakabhi naghu. <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Bhela, Yakobo akahighalili kanjika jaki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:24">Na mundu jumu akakomini naku malimba mbaka lyobha palakabhi lipita. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Mundu jola paakaweni kubha ngacheaweza kumuweza, akapagusiki pa lilombelu la lipaja na nyonga jaka Yakobo, najombi akatengwiki paakabhi akomana naku malimba. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Panihapa mundu jola akapwaghike, “Unekaje nyendaje, maghambu kutenda kucha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Nambu Yakobo akayangike, “Nganakuleki ujendaje, panga kumbengalela.”<verse eid="GEN 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Mundu jola akundalukile, “Bho, lihina laku wa nane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">Akayangiki, “Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Bhela, mundu jola akapwaghike, “Lihina laku ngawikubhi kabhete Yakobo, nambu Izilaeli, maghambu ukomini malimba na Chapanga, na bhandu bhelabhela, nanau uwezike.”<verse eid="GEN 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Yakobo akundalukili, akapwaghaje, “Chondi umbwaghilaje lihina lako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Jombi akumpwaghile, “Bho, maghambu kiki unalukila lihina lango?” Panihapa akumpengali Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Yakobo akapalohiki pandu panipala Panieli, akapwaghaje, “Numbweni Chapanga pamihu kwa pamihu, na nakali matamu ghangu ghakengalike.” <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Lyobha lakabhi lipita chikahi Yakobo paakabhokiki ku Penueli, najombi akabhi achepalela kwa ndandi ja lipaja la chigholu chaki. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Nde nandi mbaka lalenu Bhaizilaeli ngachebhakula nhwipa ghoubhi pahi ja lipaja mbaka lalenu, maghambu Chapanga akungusiki Yakobo pahi ja lipaja laki punhwipa wa chibhunu chaki.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo ahimangana na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Yakobo akalingalili, na kumbona Esau akahikaje papamu na bhandu mia ncheche. Panihapa akabhagabhinyi bhana bhaki pachilanda jaka Lea, Laheli na bhatumika bhaki bhabheli bha chimbomba bhala. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Akabhabhekiki bhatumika bha chimbomba bhala na bhana bhabhu palongi, na Lea na bhana bhaki kunyuma jabhu, na Laheli na Yusufu kunyuma nakanope. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Yakobo mweni akapetiki palongi jabhu, na kujenda kuchikama mbaka pahi kwa utopelu mala saba, mbaka paakahikiki pambipi na mbeli waki Esau. <verse eid="GEN 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Nambu Esau akakembili imbelu kujenda kunjopalela Yakobo, na kunkumbatila, na kundamukila kwa upalu muhingu, na bhokapi bhabheli bhakalelike. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Esau paakalingalili na kubhabhona akambomba bhala na bhana, akalalukile, “Bhanganya abhabha bhaubhi nabhu akanane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Yakobo akayangike, “Abhabha nde bhana ambabhu Chapanga ampekihi mtumika waku kwa chihomu chaki.” <verse eid="GEN 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Bhela bhatumika bha chimbomba bhala na bhana bhabhu bhakaheghalili na kuchikama mbaka pahi kwa utopelu. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Bhelabhela Lea na bhana bhaki nabhombi bhakahikiki kuchikama mbaka pahi kwa utopelu. Na pakujomukela bhakahikiki Yusufu na Laheli, nabhombi bhakachikimi mbaka pahi kwa utopelu. <verse eid="GEN 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Esau akalalukile, “Ubhi na ndandi bhole kwa mabhongelu ghokapi ghala ghanhimangini nako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Yakobo akayangike, “Nahuli mbata chihomu palongi jaku wehapa, wa bambo wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Nambu Esau akapwaghike, “Ndongu wango, nepani tayali mili na mali ghamaheli. Ghaubhi naghu wehapa ghabya ghaku wamwete.”<verse eid="GEN 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Yakobo akapwaghike, “Ngabhela! Anangati chakaka ujetakili kunyopalela, bhela, nukulobha ujopalyaje nhupu wango. Kwa ndandi kukubhona pamihu jaku, nde ngati kupabhona pamihu jaka Chapanga, maghambu unyopalili kwa wamboni ukolongwa. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Chondi ujetakyaje nhupu ghonetiki kwako, maghambu Chapanga ambekihi chihomu chamaheli, nanatu mili na mali ghamaheli.” Kwa kubha Yakobo akatehi kupembalakela kwa ntundu ghonihoghu, Esau akajopalile. <verse eid="GEN 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Bhela Esau akapwaghike, “Kambokaje tujendalya na mwanja, nanatu ananukulongulyaje.”<verse eid="GEN 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Nambu Yakobo akayangike, “Umanyi kubha bhana abhabha nde bhang'eng'a, bambo wango, na mambelele na ng'ombi yemi nayu itenda kujongeha. Ngati anaipelikwi kwa manyata hata ngati kwa lichobha limu pela, hinyama yokapi anaipotilaje. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Chondi bambo wango, nukulobha ulongulyaje palongi jaka mtumika waku, nanatu ananyengalyaje mbolimboli kwa lujendu lwa mabhongelu ghaghabhi palongi jangu, na lujendu lwa bhana, mbaka panihikaje kwaka bambo wangu ku Seili hoku.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Esau akapwaghike, “Bhela nukulekila bhandu bhangu bhakumu papamu na wehapa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:15">Yakobo akalalukile, “Kubhi na ndandi bhole ja kuhenga bhenibhela? Uneka pela mbata chihomu pamihu jaka bambo wango.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Bhela, Esau akakelawiki lichobha lela lela kujenda mbaka ku Seili. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Nambu papamu na ghanihagha, Yakobo akapiti ku Sukosi, pandu paakalichengili matamu kwa ndandi jaki na indamba kwa ndandi ja hinyama yaki. Nde ndandi pandu panihapa pakalowakiki muchi wa Sukosi.<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Yakobo akahikiki kwa lukwale mbaka ku muchi wa Shekemu, ghoubhi mu inchi ja Kanaani, paakahikiki kuhuma ku Padani Alamu, na kubheka likambi palongi ja muchi ghonihoghu. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Akahemili chibhanja kuhuma kwa bhana bhaka Hamoli, tati waka Shekemu, kwa bei ja ipandi mia jimu ja madini gha feza. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Akachengiki konihoku pandu pa kubhokela nyambiku kwa maganga, na kupaloha Eli Elohe Izilaeli, yani, Chapanga nde Chapanga wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s">Dina ajingalika kihyegha kwa makile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Bhela, Dina mwali waka Yakobo joakumbelakili Lea, akapitiki kunja na kujenda kubhabhona akakamwali bha inchi jenijela. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Panihapa Shekemu, mwana waka Hamoli, wa likabila la Bhahivi, joakabhi mtawala wa inchi jenijela, paakumbweni Dina, akuntoliki, na kughonela naku kihyegha kwa makile. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Nambu Shekemu akahutakiki namaa na Dina mwali waka Yakobo, akumpaliki mwali ajoju, na hata akatumbwili kulongela naku kwa malobhi manyahi. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Panihapa Shekemu akumpwaghili Hamoli tati waki, akapwaghaje, “Chondi, unobhilaje mwali ajoju abya nhwanu wango.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Bhela Yakobo akajowini kubha Dina mwali waki, akabhi abhohakiki bikila na Shekemu. Chikahi chenihechi bhana bhaki bhakabhi papamu na hinyama yaki kumighonda. Yakobo akatumbili, mbaka pabhakelawiki panyumba. <verse eid="GEN 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Panihapa Hamoli, tati waka Shekemu, akapiti kulongela na Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Na chikahi bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Yakobo pabhajowini pela mambu ghanihagha, bhakakelawiki kuhuma kumighonda kuleha hinyama yabhu. Jakabhabhiniki namaa mitima jabhu na bhakatweliwi na inyela namaa, maghambu Shekemu akabhi ahengiki lijambu la iyoni kwa Izilaeli kwa kughonela kihyegha na mwali waka Yakobo, chindu ambachu ngachechapaliki kubha bhenibhela. <verse eid="GEN 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Nambu Hamoli akabhapwaghile, “Mwana wangu Shekemu ampala namaa mwali wino, chondi mumpekya antoghulaje. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Mtoghulana na tepane, mwehapa mtutoghukya akakamwali bhinu, na tepani tuntoghukya akakamwali bhito. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Muweza kutama pachilanda jito, na anamkubha bhakulijeka mu inchi jenjeno. Anamtamaje mu inchi jenjeno, na kuhemela na kulombesa momboni na kulipatila mali.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Bhelabhela Shekemu akumpwaghili tati waka Dina na bhalongu bhaki, “Chondi nundobha nyetakalyaje pamihu jino, nanatu ananumpekya chokapi chemwipwaghaje. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Mbwaghilaje mali na nhupu yembalika kuleta, hata ngati anaibhi ngolongwa namaa, nepani ananundepa chokapi chemwipwaghaje, nambu mbekyaje pela mwali hajoju, abyaje nhwanu wango.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Bhana bhaka Yakobo bhakabhayangiki Shekemu na Hamoli tati waki kwa kukolowa, maghambu Shekemu akabhi antendi uhakau ndombu wabhu Dina. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Bhakabhapwaghile, “Ngachetuweza kuhenga lijambu haleli, ngachetuweza kuntoghukela ndombu witu kwaka mundu jwangakuheketa jando. Anaikubha iyoni kwito. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Nambu kwa lishaliti limu aleli pela tuweza kujongana na mwehapa, anambi ngati tepani kwa kuheketwa jando kila mwanalomi pachilanda jino. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Panihapa anatumpekya akakamwali bhitu, natatu anatubhatoghula akakamwali bhino. Anatutama kwinu na anatukubha bhandu bhamu papamu na mwehapa. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Nambu anankaniki kuheketwa jando, bhela, tepani anatuntola ndombu witu na kubhoka naku.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Malobhi ghabhu ghakabhi ghamboni palongi jaka Hamoli na Shekemu mwana wake. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Nkombu jola ngacheakabhakile kuhenga lijambu leniheli, maghambu akanyambakiki namaa na mwali waka Yakobo. Bhelabhela Shekemu akabhi nde nkombu joakatopaliki namaa kupeta bhandu bhokapi bha munyumba jabhu.<verse eid="GEN 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Bhela, Hamoli na Shekemu mwana waki, bhakapiti kundyangu wa kujingalila wa muchi, pandu pa kuhimanganila, na kulongela na bhandu bha muchi wabhu, bhakapwaghaje, <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />“Bhandu abhabha bhabhi na lukwali na tepani, tubhajetakalyaje bhatamaje mu inchi jitu na kuhemela na kulombesa pambane, kwa ndandi inchi jenu nde ngolongwa ja kutujaghanila tepani na bhombe. Tuweza kubhatoghola akakamwali bhabhu, na kubhatoghukela akakamwali bhitu. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Nambu bhandu bhanihabha anabhajetakya kutama na tepani ngati bhandu bhamu nabhu kwa lishaliti la kubha akanalomi bhitu bhahekatwa jando, ngati bhombe. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Bho, ngachembona kubha mali ghabhu na hinyama yabhu yokapi anaikubha hito? Bhela, tujetanganya nabho, nabhombi anabhatama pachilanda jito.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Akanalomi bhokapi bhabhapitiki kunja ja ndyangu wa muchi bhakajetanganili na Hamoli na Shekemu mwana waki, bhela, kila mwanalomi mu muchi ghonighola akahekitwi jando.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Paghapetiki machobha ghatatu, chikahi bhokapi bhakabya mu mabhinilu, bhana bhabheli bhaka Yakobo, yani Simeoni na Lawi, bhalongu bhaka Dina, bhakatoliki mapanga ghabhu, na kuulapula muchi kwa manyata, na kubhakoma akanalomi bhokapi. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Bhakabhakomiki Hamoli na Shekemu mwana waki, kwa mapanga ghaghatema, na kumboha Dina munyumba jaka Shekemu, na kubhoka naku. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Pabhakabhakomiki bhanihabha, bhana bhangi bha chikambaku bhaka Yakobo bhakajingili mu muchi ghonighola, na kujibhona mituhi, na kuutola mateka muchi hoghu, maghambu ndombu wabhu akabhi ahengakiwi uhakau. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Bhakatoliki mambeleli ghabhu na imbuhi, ng'ombi na maponda, na kila chindu chechakabhi chabhu mu muchi ghonighola na kumighonda. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Bhelabhela bhakatoliki mali ghabhu ghokapi papamu na akambomba na bhana bhabhu, na bhakatoliki mateka kila chindu chechakabhili mkati ja nyumba yabhu.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Bhela, Yakobo akabhapwaghili Simeoni na Lawi, “Ndetiki mang'ahiku kwangu nepani kwa kundenda nungaje pachilanda ja bhandu bha inchi jenjenu ja Bhakanaani na Bhapelizi. Nepani ngachemi na bhandu bhamaheli, ngati anabhalombanishi makili ghabhu na kuhika kunapula, anabhangomaje nepani papamu na bhalongu bhango.”<verse eid="GEN 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Nabhombi bhakayangike, “Bho, wichu lelo antendila ndombu witu ngati nkemi?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga ampengalela Yakobo ku Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Bhela, Chapanga akumpwaghi Yakobo, “Ukwelaje ujenda ku muchi wa Beseli, ukatama konihoku na ukanjengilaje pandu pa kumokeha nyambiku nepani Chapanga waku nenukupitalile chikahi paukabhi untila Esau, ndongu wako.”<verse eid="GEN 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Yakobo akabhapwaghili bhandu bha munyumba jake, na bhokapi bhabhakabhi papamu nako, “Mbohaje ichapanga ya kighene yeibhi pachilanda jino, mligholulaje na mng'anambulaje ingobhu hino. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Bhela tubhokaje, tukwela ku Beseli, pandu panukunchengilaje Chapanga pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, jombi joakanyangatili mu lichobha la mang'ahiku ghango, joakabhi papamu na nepani pandu pokapi panakapite.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Panihapa, bhakumpeki Yakobo ichapanga ya kighene yokapi yebhakabhi nayu, na pete yeyakabhi mumakutu ghabho, na Yakobo akaitaghiki pahi ja nkongu wa mwaloni wa ku Shekemu hoku.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Yakobo na bhana bhaki pabhakabhi bhabhoka, Chapanga akabhajeghi choghohi bhenei bha michi jokapi ja pambipe hata ngachebhalengiki kubhajengalela. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Bhela, Yakobo na bhandu bhokapi bhabhakabhi papamu naku bhakahikiki ku muchi wa Luzu, yani Beseli, ghoubhi ku inchi ja Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Konihoku akachengiki pandu pa kubhokela nyambiku, na akapalohiki pandu pala Eli Beseli, maghambu konihoku Chapanga akumpitalile, chikahi paakabhi antila ndongu waki Esau. <verse eid="GEN 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Chikahi chenjenu Debola, joakabhi angoha Lebeka paakabhi akali nchoku, akapotili na kutaghakika pahi ja nkongu wa mwaloni ghoubhi ku Beseli. Bhela, lihina la pandu panihapa pakalowakiki Aloni Bakusi, ndandi jaki, “Nkongu wa Chilelu.” <verse eid="GEN 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Chikahi Yakobo paakabhi akelabhuka kuhuma ku Padani Alamu, Chapanga akumpitalili Yakobo kabhete na kumpengalela. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Lihina laku nde Yakobo, ngawilowakeki kabhete Yakobo, nambu lihina laku anaulowakika Izilaeli.” Bhela, Chapanga akundohiki Yakobo lihina Izilaeli. <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Nepani nde Chapanga Nemili na Makile, ukabhelakaje na kujonjukeka. Litaifa na libhongelu likolongwa la bhandu bha mataifa analihuma kwaku wehapa, na bhakolongwa anabhahuma mu chibhunu chaku wehapa. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Inchi jenakabhapeki Ibulahimu na Isaka ananukupekya wehapa, na lubheleku lwaku baada jaku wehapa ananabhapekya inchi jeniheje.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Paakajomwi kulongela na Yakobo, Chapanga akakweliki kunani. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Yakobo akajemiki nguzu ja liganga pandu pala paakalongili na Chapanga, akajitili nyambiku ja chindu cha kunywa panani jaki, na bhelabhela akajitili na mahuta panani jaki. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Yakobo akapalohiki pandu pala, Chapanga paakalongili naku, Beseli.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupotela kwaka Laheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Yakobo na bhalongu bhaki bhokapi bhakajendalili na mwanja kuhuma ku Beseli. Na pabhakabhi pambipi kuhika ku muchi wa Efulati, Laheli akakamuliki na mabhinilu, na mang'ahiku makolongwa gha kubheleka. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Paakabhili mu mang'ahiku aghagha gha kulibhopola, mundu wa kubheleha akumpwaghile, “Ngawijoghopa, maghambu upatiki mwana jongi wa chikambaku.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Laheli paakabhi aheketa mbomu jaki ja kujomukela, kwa kubha akabhi atenda kupotela, akundohiki mwana hoju lihina laki Benoni, nambu tati waki akundohiki Benyamini.<verse eid="GEN 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Bhela, Laheli akapotili, na kutaghakika pambipi na indela ja kujenda ku Efulati, yani Beselehemu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Yakobo akajemiki nguzu panani ja litengeli laka Laheli, lelimanyikana mbaka lalenu litengeli laka Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Panihapa Izilaeli akajendalili na mwanja waki na kuchenga lihema laki palongi ja mnala wa Edeli.<verse eid="GEN 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Yakobo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 2:1-2">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 2:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Chikahi Izilaeli paakabhi atama mu inchi jeniheji, Leubeni mwana waki, akaghonili kihyegha na lidaba laka tati waki joalowakeka Biliha, najombi Izilaeli akajowini lijambu lenihele.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Izilaeli akabhili na bhana bha chikambaku komi na bhabheli. <verse eid="GEN 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Bhana bhaka Lea bhakabhi, Leubeni, mbelakeka wa kutumbula waka Yakobo, Simeoni, Lawi, Yuda, Isakali na Zabuloni. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Bhana bhaka Laheli bhakabhi Yusufu na Benyamini. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Bhana bhaka Biliha, mtumika waka Laheli, bhakabhi Dani na Nafutali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Bhana bhaka Zilipa, mtumika waka Lea, bhakabhi Gadi na Asheli. Bhanihabha nde bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Yakobo, bhaakabhabheliki chikahi paakabhi atama ku Padani Alamu.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupotela kwaka Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Yakobo akabhokiki na kujenda kunyumba jaka tati waki Isaka ku Mamile hoku, pambipi na muchi wa Kiliasi Aliba, yani Hebuloni, pandu ambapu Ibulahimu na Isaka bhakatami ngati bhaghene. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Henu Isaka akatami hyaka mia jimu na semanini. <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />Bhela, Isaka akapomwili mbomu jaki ja kujomukela na kupotela, akabhonginwi papamu na bhandu bhaki akabya nseja wa hyaka yamaheli. Nabhombi Esau na Yakobo, bhana bhaki, bhakuntaghike.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s">Bhabhelakeka bhaka Esau</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:34-37">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 1:34-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Abhabha nde bhabhelakeka bhaka Esau. Lihina lengi laka Esau nde Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Esau akatowili akambomba pachilanda ja akambomba bha Kanaani: Ada, mwali waka Eloni, wa likabila la Bhahiti, na Oholibama, mwali waka Ana, na nchokolu wa chimbomba waka Sibeoni, wa likabila la Bhahivi, <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />bhelabhela akuntowili Basemasi, mwali waka Ishimaeli, ndombu waka Nebayosi. <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Ada akumbelakili Esau Elifazi, najombi Basemasi akumbelakili Leueli. <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />Oholibama akumbelakili Yeushi, Yalamu na Kola. Bhanihabha nde bhana bhaka Esau bhabhabhelakiki chikahi paakabhi atama ku inchi ja Kanaani.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Esau akabhatoliki akabhahanu bhaki, bhana bhaki bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba, bhandu bhokapi bha munyumba jaki, ng'ombi yaki, hinyama yaki yengi yokapi na hindu yokapi yeakaipatiki mu inchi ja Kanaani, na kuhamila pandu pange, kutali na ndongu waki Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Bhakahengiki bhenibhela maghambu bhakabhi na mali ghamaheli namaa hata ngachebhaweziki kutama papamu. Inchi jebhatami ngati bhagheni ngachejawezi kubhajaghanila kwa ndandi bhakabhi na hinyama yamaheli namaa. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Bhela, Esau akapiti kutama ku inchi ja itombi ja Seili. Lihina lengi laka Esau nde Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Abhabha nde bhabhelakeka bhaka Esau, atati wa Bhaedomu, mu inchi ja itombi ja Seili. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Aghagha nde mahina gha bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Esau, Elifazi joakumbelakili Ada, nhwanu waki, na Leueli, mwana waka Esau joakumbelakili Basemasi, nhwanu waki. <verse eid="GEN 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Elifazi bhakabhi Temani, Omali, Sefo, Gatamu na Kenazi. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Elifazi mwana waka Esau akabhi na lidaba lihina laki akalowakiki Timuna. Ajoju akumbelakili mwana, lihina laki Lameki. Bhanihabha nde bhabhakabhili bhachokolu bhaka Ada, nhwanu waka Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Bhana bhaka Leueli bhakabhi Nahasi, Zela, Shama na Miza. Bhanihabha nde bhabhakabhili bhachokolu bhaka Basemasi, nhwanu waka Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Bhana bhaka Oholibama, mwali waka Ana, nhwanu waka Esau, joakabhili nchokolu waka Sibeoni bhakabhi Yeushi, Yalamu na Kola.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Abhabha nde bhakolongwa bha makabila pachilanda ja bhabhelakeka bhaka Esau. Elifazi joakabhili mwana wa kutumbula waka Esau, akabhabheliki jumbi Temani, jumbi Omali, jumbi Sefo na jumbi Kenazi, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />jumbi Kola, jumbi Gatamu, na jumbi Amaleki. Bhanihabha bhokapi nde bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Elifazi ku inchi ja Edomu, bhabhakabhili bhachokolu bha chikambaku bhaka Ada.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Bhakolongwa bha bhana bhaka Leueli, mwana waka Esau bhakabhi jumbi Nabasi, jumbi Zela, jumbi Shama, na jumbi Miza. Abhabha nde bhakolongwa bhabhahumiki kwaka Leueli ku Edomu hoku, bhabhakabhili bhachokolu bha chikambaku bhaka Basemasi, nhwanu waka Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Oholibama, nhwanu waka Esau bhakabhi jumbi Yeushi, jumbi Yalamu na jumbi Kola. Abhabha nde bhakolongwa bhabhahumiki kwaka nhwanu waka Esau, Oholibama mwali waka Ana. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Bhela, bhanihabha nde bhabhelakeka bhaka Esau, yani Edomu, na bhanihabha nde bhabhakabhili bhakolongwa bhabhu.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhabhelakeka bhaka Seili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:38-42">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 1:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Abhabha nde bhana bhaka Seili, wa likabila la Bhaholi, mwenei wa inchi jenijela: Lotani, Shobali, Sibeoni na Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />na Dishoni, Eseli na Dishani. Bhanihabha nde bhana bhaka Seili bhabhakabhi bhajumbi kuhuma kwa Bhaholi, mu inchi ja Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Bhana bhaka Lotani bhakabhi Holi na Hemamu. Na ndombu waka Lotani akalowakiki Timuna.<verse eid="GEN 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Shobali bhakabhi Alivani, Manahati, Ebali, Shefo na Onamu.<verse eid="GEN 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Bhana bhaka Sibeoni bhakabhi Aiya na Ana. Ana ajoju nde jola joakahumbwile chemuchemu ja machi gha moto kulipololu, paakabhi adima maponda ghaka Sibeoni, tati waki. <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Bhana bhaka Ana bhakabhi Dishoni na Oholibama, mwali waka Ana. <verse eid="GEN 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Bhana bhaka Dishoni bhakabhi Hemdani, Eshibani, Isilani na Kelani.<verse eid="GEN 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Bhana bhaka Ezeli bhakabhi Bilihani, Zaavani na Akani.<verse eid="GEN 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Bhana bhaka Dishani bhakabhi Usi na Alani.<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Abhabha nde bhabhakabhili bhakolongwa bha Bhaholi: jumbi Lotani, jumbi Shobali, jumbi Sibeoni na jumbi Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />jumbi Dishoni, jumbi Eseli na jumbi Dishani. Bhanihabha nde bhabhakabhili bhakolongwa bha Bhaholi, kujengalanela na mabhongelu ghabhu, mu inchi ja Seili.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhakolongwa bha inchi ja Edomu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="1CH 1:43-45">1 Mambu gha Chikahi 1:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Abhabha nde bhakolongwa bhabhatawili mu inchi ja Edomu mangane jaka nkolongwa jokapi jola wa Izilaeli kutawala: <verse eid="GEN 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Bela mwana waka Beili akabhi nkolongwa wa Edomu, na lihina la muchi waki ukalowakiki Dinihaba. <verse eid="GEN 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Bela paakapotili, pandu paki pa ukolongwa akatoliki Yobabu mwana waka Zela, kuhuma ku Bosila. <verse eid="GEN 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Yobabu paakapotili, pandu paki pa ukolongwa akatoliki Hushamu, kuhuma ku inchi ja Bhatemani. <verse eid="GEN 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Hushamu paakapotili, pandu paki pa ukolongwa akatoliki Hadadi mwana waka Bedadi, najombi nde joakabhalapwi Bhamidiadi ku inchi ja Moabu. Lihina la muchi waki ukalowakiki Avisi. <verse eid="GEN 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Hadadi paakapotili, pandu paki pa ukolongwa akatoliki Samula mwenei wa ku muchi wa Masileka. <verse eid="GEN 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Samula paakapotili, pandu paki pa ukolongwa akatoliki Shauli kuhuma ku muchi wa Lehobosi, ghoubhi pambipi na Nkoka Eufulati. <verse eid="GEN 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Shauli paakapotili, pandu paki pa ukolongwa akatoliki Baali Hanani, mwana waka Akiboli. <verse eid="GEN 36:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Baali Hanani, mwana waka Akiboli paakapotili, pandu paki pa ukolongwa akatoliki Hadadi, na lihina la muchi waki ukalowakiki Pau. Nhwanu waka Akiboli akabhi Mehetabeli, mwali waka Matiledi, na nchokolu waka Mezahabu. <verse eid="GEN 36:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Abhabha nde bhakolongwa bhabhabhokini na Esau, kwa mahina ghabhu, lukolu yabhu na inchi yabhu: jumbi Timuna, jumbi Aliva, jumbi Yesesi, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />jumbi Oholibama, jumbi Ela na jumbi Pinoni, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />jumbi Kenazi, jumbi Temani na jumbi Mibisali, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />jumbi Magidieli na jumbi Ilamu. Bhanihabha nde bhakabhili bhakolongwa bha makabila bhabhabhokini na Edomu, kubhokana na matamu ghabhu, mu inchi jebhakajitawile. Jonihoju nde joakabhili Esau, atati wa Bhaedomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu na bhabheli bhaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Yakobo akajendalili kutama mu inchi ja Kanaani, moakatami tati waki ngati ngene. <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Aghagha nde malobhi gha lukolu lwaka Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Chikahi Yusufu paakabhi na hyaka komi na saba, akabhi adima mambeleli na imbuhi papamu na bhabheli bhaki bha akamabhu bhangi, yani bhana bhaka Biliha na bhana bhaka Zilipa, akabhahanu bhaka tati waki. Yusufu akabhi andetela tati waki malobhi gha uhakau ghobhuhenga bhabheli bhaki.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Bhela, Izilaeli akumpaliki Yusufu kupeta bhana bhaki bhokapi, maghambu nde mwana wa museja wake, panihapa akundokili likanzu linyahi lelibhi na mabhoku malachu. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Bhabheli bhaki pabhaweni kubha tati wabhu ampala Yusufu kupeta bhabheli bhaki bhokapi, bhakunhakalili na ngachebhalongili naku lilobhi lokapi lela lambone.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Ikilu jimu Yusufu akalotiki ndoto, na kubhapwaghila bhabheli bhaki, nabhombi bhakunhakalili nakanope. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Akabhapwaghile, “Chondi, njowanyaje ndoto jenotike. <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Lingalyaje, nakalotiki kubha tabhokapi tukabhi kungonda tukakonga makenda gha ingano, palapala likenda langu la ingano lakatei kujema, na makenda ghinu gha ingano ghakatei kuuyongolota na kuujinamila.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Bhabheli bhaki bhakumpwaghile, “Bho, wehapa le uholalela kututawala? Au chakaka lelu kubha wehapa anaututawala tepane?” Bhela, bhakajonjukili kunhakalila kwa ndandi ja ndoto jaki jela, na kwa malobhi ghaki ghala.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Bhela, Yusufu akalotiki kabhete ndoto jenge, akabhalandili bhabheli bhaki akapwaghaje, “Njowanyaje, notiki kabhete ndoto jenge, na ndingalyaje, lyobha, mwehi na ndondwa komi na jimu yakatei kunyinamila.”<verse eid="GEN 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Chikahi paakumpwaghi tati waki na bhabheli bhaki ndoto jeniheji, tati waki akundakalili akapwaghaje, “Ndoto bholi ajeji jeulotike? Chakaka lelu kubha nepani na mabhu waku, na bhabheli bhaku bhokapi anatuhika kukujinamila wehapa mbaka pahi kwa utopelo?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Bhabheli bhaki bhakumboni wihu, nambu tati waki akalibhekiki lijambu leniheli muntima waki.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu ahemalewa ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Bhela, bhabheli bhaka Yusufu bhakapiti kudima mabhongelu gha mambelele ghaka tati wabhu pambipi na muchi wa Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Izilaeli akumpwaghi Yusufu, “Bho, bhabheli bhaku ngachebhadima mambelele pambipi na muchi wa Shekemu?” Uhikaje, nukutuma kwabho.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Yusufu akayangike, “Haya undumaje.”<verse eid="GEN 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Tati waki akumpwaghile, “Ujendaje ukabhalolaje bhabheli bhaku na hinyama ngati anaibhi lukwale, bhela wihika kunetela malobhi.” Bhela, Yakobo akuntumiki Yusufu kuhuma ku Libondi la Hebuloni. <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />Mundu jumu akunhimanili Yusufu ayongolota yongolota kuchingwenje, mundu jola akunhimanili, na kupwagha, “Bho, ulonda kyane?”<verse eid="GEN 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Yusufu akayangike, “Nabhalonda bhabheli bhango. Chondi umbwaghilaje bhadima kwaku mabhongelu ghabhu?”<verse eid="GEN 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Mundu jola akayangike, “Pambani bhabhokike. Nabhajowini bhakapwaghaje, ‘Tumbokanya ku muchi wa Dosani.’ ” Bhela, Yusufu akabhajengalili bhabheli bhaki na kubhahimanila ku muchi wa Dosani.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Bhabheli bhaki pabhakumbweni cha kutali, mangane ja kuhika pabhabhile, bhakajetanganili kubha bhunkomaje. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Bhakapwaghanili bheni kwa bheni, “Ndingalyaje! Jola bambo wa kulota ndoto atenda kuhika. <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Henu, muhikaje tunkomaje na tundekalaje mu libhomba limu pachilanda ja aghagha, na twipwagha kubha ameminwi na chinyama chikali. Na panihapa anatubhonaje mapitalilu gha ndoto yake.”<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Leubeni paakajowini lijambu leniheli, akalengiki kunkengalela kuhuma mu mabhoku ghabhu, akapwaghaje, “Ngatunkoma.” <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Leubeni akabhapwaghile, “Ngamwijitila mwahi, mundekalaje mu libhomba aleli lelibhi koni kuchingwenje, nambu ngamungusa.” Leubeni akapwaghiki bhenibhela nahuli kunkengalela kuhuma mu mabhoku ghabhu, na palongi ankelabhuhaje kwaka tati waki. <verse eid="GEN 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Bhela, Yusufu paakahikiki kwa bhabheli bhaki, bhakunhuliki Yusufu likanzu laki linyahi lelakabhili na mabhoku malachu leakabhi awatike. <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />Panihapa bhakuntoliki na kundekela mulibhomba. Chikahi chenihechi libhomba heli lakabhi litopu, ngachelabhili na machi.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Bhakatami pahi kula chilebhi chabhu, bhakajinwihi mihu ghabhu, na kuubhona mwanja wa Bhaishimaeli bhakahikaje kuhuma ku Gileadi. Ngamia yabhu yakabhi bhaitwekiki ibwahila ya ubani, na mitela jejilowakeka zeli na manemane, nabhombi bhakabhi bhaipeleka ku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Yuda akabhapwaghi bhalongu bhake, “Bho, anatupataje nyonjeka bhole ngati anatunkomiki ndongu witu, na kuuhiya mwahi wake? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Mbanga tundombisaje kwa Bhaishimaeli abhabha, nambu mabhoku ghitu ngaghamuyonanga, maghambu jombi nde ndongu witu, na mwahi witu.” Bhalongu bhaki bhakajetakile. <verse eid="GEN 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Bhela, bhabhahemela na kulombesa bha ku Midiani, pabhahikiki panipala, bhabheli bhaka Yusufu bhakumbohiki Yusufu mu libhomba lela, na kundombesa kwa Bhaishimaeli kwa ipandi ishilini ya madini gha feza, nabhombi bhakumpeliki Yusufu mbaka ku Misili.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Bhela, Leubeni paakakelawiki kujenda kulinga mu libhomba lela, na kubhona kubha Yusufu ngacheabhile, akaikachwili ingobhu yake kwa kubhina mtima. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Akakelawiki kwa bhalongu bhaki, na kupwagha, “Nkombu ngacheabhi mu libhomba mola! Bho, nanatu nyenda kwako?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Bhakalitoliki likanzu laka Yusufu, bhakachinjiki likenda la imbuhi, na kulijwiha likanzu lela mu mwahi ghola. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Bhakalitoliki likanzu lilachu lela, na kundetela tati wabhu, bhakapwaghaje, “Tuliweni likanzu aleli. Ulilingalakyaje na ubhonaje ngati laka mwana wako.”<verse eid="GEN 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Atati wabhu akalimanyi, na akapwaghike, “Haleli nde likanzu laka mwana wango! Chinyama chikali chitehi kumuyonanga. Chakaka Yusufu ayonangiki ipandi ipandi!” <verse eid="GEN 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Panihapa Yakobo akakachwili ingobhu yaki, na kuliwatika ingobhu ya magunila muchibhunu chaki, na kundelela mwana wake kwa machobha ghamahele. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Bhana bhaki bhokapi bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba bhakahikiki nahuli kunjeghe mtima, nambu ngacheakajetakili kujeghaleka mtima. Akapwaghike, “Ngabhela, ananundelilaje mwana wangu mbaka panihelalaje kuwawa.” Bhela tati waki akajendalili kundelela Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 37:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Chikahi chenihechi, Bhamidiani bhakundombisi Yusufu ku Misili kola kwaka mundu jumu joalowakeka Potifa, jumu wa bhatumika bhaka Falao, jonihoju akabhi nkolongwa wa bhalonda bhaka Falao.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s">Yuda na Tamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Chikahi chenihechi, Yuda akahelili kuhuma kwa bhalongu bhaki, na kujenda kutama ku muchi wa Mwadulami, kwaka mundu jumu lihina laki Hila. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Konihoku Yuda akumbweni mwali wa Kikanaani, lihina laki Shua. Akuntowili, na kughonela naku kihyegha. <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />Shua akapatiki chitumbu, na kumbeleka mwana wa chikambaku, joakalowakiki lihina laki Eri. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Shua akapatiki chitumbu kabhete, akumbeliki kabhete mwana wa chikambaku, akundohiki lihina laki Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Akajendalili, na kumbeleka kabhete mwana jongi wa chikambaku, akundohiki lihina laki Shela. Chikahi paakabhelakiki Shela, Yuda akabhi ku muchi wa Kezibu.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Yuda akuntoghukili Eri, mbelakeka waki wa kutumbula mbomba, lihina laka mbomba hoju akalowakiki Tamali. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Nambu Eri, mbelakeka wa kutumbula waka Yuda akabhi muhakau palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, bhela Bambo Chapanga akunkomike. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Bhela, Yuda akumpwaghi Onani, “Untolaje nhwanu waka ndongu waku joapotile abya nhwanu waku, ndandi nde moikupalaki kuhenga, nahuli umbelakya ndongu waku bhana.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Onani akamanyi kubha lubheleku holu ngalwikubhi lwaki, bhela kila paakahimangini kihyegha na nhwanu waka ndongu wake, akajitalili pahi imbeju ya chikambaku nahuli ngaambelakela ndongu waki bhana. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Lijambu leakabhi alihenga lakabhi lihakau palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, bhelabhela Bambo Chapanga akunkomiki Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Panihapa Yuda akumpwaghi Tamali, nhwanu waka mwana wake, “Ukelabhukaje kunyumba jaka tati waku, na kutama ngati mbomba joaweliwi na ndomi waki, mbaka mwana wangu Shela payikolaje.” Yuda akapwaghiki bhenibhela maghambu akabhi na choghoi kubha pangi najombi Shela akabya apotile ngati bhalongu bhake. Bhela, Tamali akakelawiki na kujenda kutama munyumba jaka tati waki.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Paghapetiki machobha ghamaheli, mwali waka Shua, nhwanu waka Yuda akapotile. Yuda paakajomwili kulela malelu, akapiti ku Timna, kwa bhandu bhabhakabhi bhaheketa mangoma gha mambeleli ghaki, akapiti papamu na nkochi waki Hila, wa likabila la Mwadulami. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Tamali akajowini kubha, “Nkowanu waku ajenda ku Timna, kuheketa mangoma gha mambeleli ghaki.” <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />Akahuliki ingobhu yaki ya kuwelewa na ndomi, na kuliyeka kwa shela nahuli ngaimanyikana, na kujenda kutama pundyangu wa Enaimu, ghoubhi pindela kujenda ku Timna. Akahengiki bhenibhela maghambu akaweni kubha Shela akabhi akolike, nambu jombi ngacheatoghukiki kubha nhwanu wake.<verse eid="GEN 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Bhela, Yuda paakumbweni akaholaki kubha nde mbomba nkemi, maghambu akabhi aliyekiki pamihu jake. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Panihapa akabya ngakumanya kubha akabhi nkowanu waki, akunjendili punkeghi ja indela, na kumpwaghila, “Chondi, unyetakalyaje ng'onila na wehapa kihyegha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Tamali akundalukile, “Bho, anaumbekya kyane anang'onili na wehapa kihyegha?”<verse eid="GEN 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Yuda akayangike, “Ananukuletila mwana mbuhe kuhuma mu libhongelu lango.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Tamali akundalukile, “Bho, anaumbekya chindu chokapi chela ngati zamana mbaka pawiletaje mwana mbuhe?”<verse eid="GEN 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Yuda akundalukile, “Nukupekya zamana bhole?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Tamali akayangike, “Umbekya peti jaku ja muhuli, ngoji waki papamu na ndonga jejibhi mumabhoku ghaku.” Bhela, Yuda akumpeki Tamali hindu yokapi, na kughonela naku kihyegha, na Tamali akapatiki chitumbo. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Bhela, Tamali akakelawiki kunyumba, na kuhula shela jeakaliyekiki jela, na kuwata kabhete ingobhu yaki ya kuwelewa na ndomi.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Chikahi chela chela Yuda akuntumiki nkochi waki Mwadulami apelakaje mwana mbuhi jola, nahuli akelabhuhaje zamana yaki kuhuma kwaka mbomba jola, na nkochi waki jola ngacheakunhimani mbomba jola. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Akabhalalukili bhandu bhabhatama pandu panipala, akapwaghaje, “Abhi kwaku mbomba nkemi joakabhi punkeghi ja indela ja ku Enaimu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Bhakamuyangike, “Pambani ngachepalabhali kubha na mbomba nkemi.”<verse eid="GEN 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Bhela, akakelawiki kwaka Yuda na kumpwaghila, “Ngachenumbwene. Nakanopi ja ghanihagha, bhandu bhabhatama pandu panipala bhakapwaghiki, ‘Ngachepalabhali kubha na mbomba nkemi pandu pambane.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Yuda akapwaghike, “Undekaje atolaje hindu yeniheye, nangabhela anatuhika kujeghaleka iyone. Lingalyaje, hata bhela nukumpelakili mwana mbuhe, nambu ngacheunhimanile.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Pajapetiki myehi jitatu, Yuda bhakumpwaghile, “Tamali nkowanu waku abhi mbomba nkeme, na mapitalilu ghaki abhi na chitumbo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Panihapa Yuda akalaghalakile, “Mumpiha kunja munjocha kwa moto mbaka apotilaje.”<verse eid="GEN 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Pabhakabhi bhumpiha kunja, akatumiki ubholu kwaka nkowanu waki kupwagha, “Nepani mbekiwi chitumbu na mundu joabhi na hindu yenjeno. Bhela nukujopa umanyaje peti ajeji na ngoji waki, papamu na ndonga ajeji nde yaka nane.”<verse eid="GEN 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Yuda akaimanyi hindu yeniheyi na kupwagha, “Tamali abhi na haki kupeta nepane, maghambu ngachenuntoghukili kwaka mwana wangu Shela nahuli akubha nhwanu wake.” Kutumbula lichobha leniheli Yuda ngacheaghonili kihyegha kabhete na Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Chikahi chaka Tamali cha kulibhopola pachahikiki, kukabhi na bhana mabhela mulutumbu jake. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Bhela, paakabhi alibhopola, mwana jumu akapihiki chiwoku chaki kunja, na mundu wa kubheleha akatoliki uzi ukeli na kuukonga mu chiwoku cha mwana jola, akapwaghaje, “Jonjoni nde joatumbwi kubhelakeka.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Nambu mwana hoju paakakelawihi chiwoku chaki mkati, ndongu waki akabhelakiki wa kutumbula. Panihapa akapwaghike, “Mbona upetiki kwa makili wehapa?” Bhela, lihina laki akalowakiki Pelesi. <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Palongi najombi ndongu waki akabhelakike, akabya abhi na uzi ukeli mu chiwoku chaki, jonihoju akalowakiki Zela.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu na nhwanu waka Potifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Bhela, Yusufu akatolakiki mbaka ku Misili, najombi Potifa, mtumika waka Falao, na nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli ghaki, mundu wa ku Misili, akunhemili kuhuma mu mabhoku gha Bhaishimaeli bhabhakundetiki ku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />Bambo Chapanga akabhili papamu na Yusufu, najombi akaneng'anili namaa, Yusufu akabhi atumika munyumba jaka bambo waki Mmisili. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Potifa akaweni kubha Bambo Chapanga akabhili papamu na Yusufu, na kubha Bambo Chapanga anjangatila kila chindu cheahenga Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Bhela, Yusufu akapalakiki namaa palongi jaka Potifa, panihapa akuntendiki kubha mtumika waki. Akumbekiki kubha njemalela wa nyumba jake, na hindu yokapi yeakabhi nayu akaibhekiki mu mabhoku ghaka Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Kutumbula chikahi chenihechi Potifa paakumbekiki Yusufu kubha njemalela wa nyumba jaki na hindu yokapi, Bambo Chapanga akajipengalili nyumba jaka Potifa kwa ndandi jaka Yusufu. Bambo Chapanga akachipengalili kila chindu cheakabhi nachu Potifa, munyumba na kungonda. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Potifa akundekili Yusufu kujemalela kila chindu cheakabhi nachu, Yusufu paakabhi ajendalela kujemalela, Potifa ngacheakabhili na ndandi ja kumanya chindu chokapi chela, nambu chilebhi chaki mweni pela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yusufu akabhi nkombu mnyahi, akabhi na makili na sula jinyahi. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Bhela, pachapetiki chikahi, nhwanu waka Potifa akuntokuli Yusufu, na kumpwaghila, “Uhikaje, ughonila na nepani kihyegha.” <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Nambu Yusufu akakanike. Akumpwaghi mbomba jola, “Lingalyaje, nepani nakabya ngati chiongozi, bambo wangu ngacheahusika na chindu chokapi chela munyumba jenjeno, kila chindu cheabhi nachu ambeki nepani. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Pani panyumba njeta joabhi na lujiniku lukolongwa kupeta nepani, wala bambo wangu ngacheanhibhalili chindu chokapi chela nambu wehapa pela, maghambu wehapa nde nhwanu wake. Bho, ananhweza bhole kuhenga lihoku likolongwa ngati aleli na kunhokela Chapanga?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Hata ngati mbomba hoju akajendalili kumpembalela Yusufu lichobha kwa lichobha, nambu Yusufu akakaniki kughonela naku kihyegha, wala kubha naku pambipe.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Lichobha limu Yusufu akajingili mkati ja nyumba kuhenga mahengu ghake, wala ngachepabhili na mtumika jongi jokapi jola mkati ja nyumba jela. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Bhela, nhwanu waka Potifa akakamwili ingobhu jeakawati Yusufu, na kumpwaghila, “Uhikaje tughonila na nepani kihyegha!” Nambu Yusufu akundekili ingobhu jaki mumabhoku ghaka mbomba jola, na kupita kunja ja nyumba jela koni akakembalaje. <verse eid="GEN 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Mbomba jola paakaweni kubha Yusufu akundekili ingobhu jaki mumabhoku ghaki, na kutilila kunja, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />akabhalohiki bhatumika bha munyumba jaki, na kubhapwaghila, “Ndingalyaje! Atuletili mundu Muebulania nahuli atulongamaje. Akajingili munyumba moni, nahuli aghonila na nepani kihyegha, nambu nepani nakatehi kujamalila. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Paakajowini njobhela ya kujopa ujangatilu, akajilekiki ingobhu jaki kwangu, na kutilila kunja.”<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Bhela, mbomba jola akajibhekiki ingobhu jela mbaka Potifa, bambo waka Yusufu paakakelawiki panyumba. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Akundandili ndomi waki lijambu leniheli, akapwaghaje, “Mtumwa Muebulania joundetiki kwitu jola, akajingili kwangu nahuli anongamaje. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Nambu chikahi pela panajamalile, akajilekiki ingobhu jaki kwangu, na kutilila kunja.”<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Bhela, bambo waka Yusufu paakajowini malobhi ghanihagha, akapwaghike, “Bhenibhela nde mtumwa waku moandendile,” na inyela yaka Potifa yakajonjukike. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Potifa akuntoliki Yusufu, na kumbeka muchifungo, pandu pabhakongakiki bhakongeka bhaka nkolongwa, najombi akabhi monihomo. <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Bambo Chapanga akabhili papamu na Yusufu, akumpengalili na akuntendiki kupalakika palongi jaka nkolongwa wa chifungo. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Bhela, nkolongwa wa chifungo akumbekiki Yusufu akubha nkolongwa wa bhakongeka bhokapi papamu na kujemalela mambu ghokapi ghaghahengakiki muchifungu mola. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Nkolongwa wa chifungu hoju ngacheakajemalili kabhete chindu chokapi chela chechakabhili pahi ja ujemalelu waka Yusufu, ndandi Bambo Chapanga akabhi papamu na Yusufu, maghambu Bambo Chapanga akabhi papamu na Yusufu kwa kila chindu cheakahengike.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu ahyekula ndoto ya bhakongeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Bhela, paghapetiki mambu ghanihagha, mundu joakabhi aghoha hindu yokapi ya kunywa yaka nkolongwa, na mundu joakabhi ajocha mabumunda, bhakunhokili bambo wabhu, nkolongwa wa Misili. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Falao akabhayomili bhatumika bhaki bhakolongwa bhabheli, joakabhi alenda hindu yokapi ya kunywa, na mundu joakabhi ajocha mabumunda. <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />Akabhajighalili mkati ja nyumba jaka nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli, muchifungu chela chela cheakunkongiki Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli akumpeki Yusufu bhandu bhanihabha, najombi akabhatumakile, na bhakabhili muchifungu kwa chikahi chilachu.<verse eid="GEN 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Bhela, ikilu jimu bhokapi bhabheli bhakalotiki ndoto, kila jumu ndoto jaki kwa ikilu jimu, na kila ndoto jakabhi na ndandi jake, nkolongwa wa hindu ya kunywa na nkolongwa wa kujocha mabumunda ghaka nkolongwa wa Misili bhabhakongiki muchifungu bhala. <verse eid="GEN 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Yusufu paakapiti lukela kubhabhona, akabhahimanili bhokapi bhabheli bhabhi na lujoghopo. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Bhela, Yusufu akabhalalukili bhatumika bhaka Falao habha, bhabhakabhi papamu naku munyumba jaka bambo waki, akapwaghaje, “Bho, mbona pamihu jinu pabhili na ngwinyanila?”<verse eid="GEN 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Bhakamuyangike, “Tepani tabhokapi tukalotiki ndoto, nambu pachifungu pani ngachepabhili na mundu jokapi wa kuhyekula ndandi ya ndoto heyi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Yusufu akabhapwaghile, “Bho, kuhyekula ndoto nga lihengu laka Chapanga? Mbwaghilaje ndoto heyi.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Bhela, nkolongwa wa kughoha hindu ya kunywa akundandili Yusufu ndoto jaki. Akumpwaghile, “Mu ndoto jangu nakalotiki kubha, kukabhi na mzabibu palongi jango. <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />Na mu mzabibu hoghu kukabhili na mambandi ghatatu, na ukabhi ngati utenda kumela, na kupiha malobha, na malobha ghaki ghakabhi ghapiha zabibu yeipile. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Chikombi chaka Falao chakabhili mu mabhoku ghangu, nakaitoliki zabibu, na kuiminyila mu chikombi chaka Falao, na kumpekeha Falao chikombi mu mabhoku ghaki.”<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Yusufu akumpwaghile, “Ndandi ja ndoto jaku nde ajeje: Mambandi ghatatu nde machobha ghatatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Mu machobha ghatatu aghagha, Falao anaakubhohaje muchifungu na kukubheka kabhete mu pandu pako, nanau anaubhekaje chikombi chaka Falao mu mabhoku ghaki, ngati mowabhelili ntetu waku, paukabhi mundu waki wa kunkenga. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Nambu chikahi mambu paghakujendila wichu, ukandendila chihomu na kunoghola palongi jaka Falao, nahuli amohaje muchifungu mone. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Maghambu nakatolaliki kwa makili kuhuma ku inchi ja Bhaebulania, na hata pani pamile ngachenahengiki lijambu lokapi lela lelimbalika kubhekakeka muchifungo.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Mundu joakabhi ajocha mabumunda jola paakaweni kubha Yusufu ahyekwili ndoto jela koni jakabya na ndandi jinyahi, akumpwaghi Yusufu, “Nepani nanatu nakalotiki ndoto: Lingalyaje, pamutu jangu pakabhili na itonga itatu yeibhi na mabumunda manyahi. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Mu chitonga cha panane, kukabhili na kila ntundu wa ilebhe yeyajochakiki kwa ndandi jaka Falao, nambu hijuni yakabhi ikula kuhuma mu chitonga panani ja mmutu wango.”<verse eid="GEN 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Yusufu akumpwaghile, “Ndandi ja ndoto jaku nde ajeje: Itonga itatu nde machobha ghatatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Mu machobha ghatatu aghagha, Falao anaahekata mmutu waku, na kukubheka panani ja nguzu ja nkongo, na hijuni anaikula inyama jako.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Mu lichobha la tatu, kukabhili nde lichobha la kukomboka kubhelakeka kwaka Falao, najombi akabhaandalili bhatumika bhaki bhokapi uwangalalu. Akabhapihiki muchifungo mundu jola joakabhi nkolongwa wa kughoha hindu ya kunywa yaka Falao na nkolongwa wa kujocha mabumunda, na kubhabheka palongi ja bhatumika bhaki. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Panihapa akunkelawihi nkolongwa wa kunkenga pa lihengu laki, najombi akumpekihi Falao chikombi mu mabhoku ghake. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Nambu nkolongwa wa kujocha mabumunda jola, akunhwambiki pa nguzu ja nkongu ngati Yusufu moakapwaghile. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Papamu na ghanihagha, mundu jola joakabhi nkolongwa wa kughoha hindu ya kunywa, ngacheankombwiki Yusufu, nambu akatei kunjewa.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu ahyekula ndoto yaka nkolongwa Falao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Payapetiki hyaka ibheli, Falao akalotiki ndoto, na kulibhona kubha ajemiki punkeghi ja nkoka Naili. <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />Lingalyaje, akaweni ng'ombi saba, inyahi na yeinonike, yakakweliki kuhuma kunkoka, na kula manyonyole. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Payapetiki yeniheyi, yakapitalili kabhete ng'ombi yengi saba, ihakau na yeikombile, yakakweliki kuhuma mu nkoka Naili, na kuhika kujema pambipi na ng'ombi inyahi na yeinoniki yela, punkeghi ja nkoka. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Ng'ombi ihakau na yeikombili yela, yakaimemini ng'ombi inyahi na yeinoniki yela. Bhela Falao akajumwike. <verse eid="GEN 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Paakaghoni kabhete, akalotiki kabhete ndoto ja kabhele. Lingalya, akaweni mapukutu saba makolongwa na manyahi, ghakameliki mu lipei limu. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Palongi akaweni mapukutu saba mapepandau, na ghaghajomishwi na mpongu ghoupyopa kuhuma kolipita lyobha. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Mapukutu mapepandau ghala ghakaghamiliki mapukutu saba makolongwa na manyahi ghala. Na panihapa Falao akajumwiki kuhuma mulughono, na kumanya kumbi jakabhi ndoto pela. <verse eid="GEN 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Pakwahiki lukela, Falao akabhi na mang'ahiku namaa muntima waki, akabhalohiki bhaganga bhokapi bha Misili, na bhabhabhi na mbulau, na kubhapwaghila ndoto yaki, nambu njeta hata jumu wabhu joakaweziki kuhyekula ndandi ya ndoto heyi.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Bhela nkolongwa wa kughoha hindu ya kunywa yaka Falao akumpwaghile, “Lalenu naghakombwiki mahakau ghango. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Chikahi chenihechi Falao akabhayomili bhatumika bhaki, akangongiki nepani papamu na nkolongwa wa kujocha mabumunda munyumba jaka nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Ikilu jimu tukalotiki ndoto, kila jumu akalotiki ndoto jake, na kila ndoto jakabhi na ndandi jake. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Bhela, nkombo wa Kiebulania joakabhi papamu na tepani konihoku, akabhili mtumika waka nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli. Tukumpwaghili ndoto yitu, najombi akatulandili ndandi ja ndoto yitu, kila jumu witu kulengana na ndoto jake. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Mambu ghakabhi bhelabhela ngati moakatulandile: Nepani nakakelawiki mu lihengu langu, nambu nkolongwa wa kujocha mabumunda jola akakomakiki na kunjenjela pa nguzu ja nkongo.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Bhela, Falao akalaghalakili Yusufu alowakikaje, najombi akabhohakiki muchifungu manyata. Akamoghiki na kung'anambula ingobhu yake, na kujenda palongi jaka Falao. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Falao akumpwaghi Yusufu, “Notiki ndoto, wala njeta mundu hata jumu joaweza kujihyekula. Nanatu nyowini malobhi panani jako, kubha anaujowini ndoto, uweza kujihyekula.”<verse eid="GEN 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Yusufu akamuyangiki Falao, akapwaghaje, “Ngachenhweza kuhyekula, nambu Chapanga anaampekya Falao liyangu la lukwale.”<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Falao akumpwaghi Yusufu, “Mu ndoto jangu nakalotiki kubha nakajemiki munkeghi ja nkoka Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />nakaiweni ng'ombi saba, hinyahi na yeinenipe, yakapitiki kuhuma munkoka na kula manyonyole. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Payapetiki yeniheyi nakaiweni ng'ombi yengi saba, ihakau na yeikombile. Nepani ngachenabhali kuibhona ng'ombi ihakau ya ntundu ghonihoghu mu inchi jokapi ja Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Ng'ombi yela yeikombile, na ihakau, yakaimiliki ng'ombi saba yela yeinenipe yeyapitali pakutumbula yela. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Nambu hata payajomwi kuimila yeinoniki yela, njeta mundu joakaweza kupwagha kubha itehi kula, maghambu yakabhonakini yakali ihakau ngati pakutumbula. Bhela nakajumwike kuhuma mulughono. <verse eid="GEN 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />Kabhete nakalotiki ndoto jenge, nakaweni mapukutu saba ghaghatwelili na manyahi, ghakapitaje mu lipei limu. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Paghapetiki ghanihagha ghakapitiki kabhete mapukutu ghangi saba, ghaghanyalike, mapepandau na ghaghajomishwi na mpongo ghoupyopa kuhuma kolipita lyobha. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Mapukutu saba mapepandau ghala ghakaghamiliki mapukutu saba ghaghatweli ghala. Bhela, nepani nakabhapwaghi bhaganga ndoto yeniheyi, nambu njeta hata jumu wabhu joakaweziki kuhyekula ndandi jaki kwangu nepani.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Panihapa Yusufu akumpwaghi Falao, “Ndoto yaka Falao heyi ibhi na ndandi jimu. Chapanga amuyekulili Falao lijambu leanahengaje henu kateki. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Ng'ombi saba hinyahi nde hyaka saba, na mapukutu saba manyahi ghala nde hyaka saba. Ndoto heyi ibhi na ndandi jimu. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Na ng'ombi saba yeikombili yela, na ihakau yeyabhonakini palongi yela nde hyaka saba, bhelabhela mapukutu saba matopu ghaghajomishwi na mpongu ghoupyopa kuhuma kolipita lyobha, ndandi jaki nde hyaka saba ya injala ngolongwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Nde ngati monumpwaghi Falao, kubha Chapanga andangihi Falao mambu ghaanahengaje henu kateki. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Anakukubha na hyaka saba ya kubha na mahunu ghamaheli mu inchi jokapi ja Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Nambu palongi jaki anaijengalya hyaka saba ya injala ngolongwa, na kutupila kwokapi anakujewakikaje mu inchi jokapi ja Misili, na injala heji anaijiyonanga inchi jenu. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Wala kutupila kwokapi ngakwimanyikani mu inchi jenu, maghambu injala ngolongwa jeanajihikaje anajikubha ngolongwa namaa. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Na kihengu cha ndoto jaka Falao kuhika mala pabheli, nde maghambu lijambu leniheli Chapanga ajomwi kuamula, na Chapanga anaalitenda lipitalyaje henu kateki.<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />“Bhela, sajenu Falao na alondaje mundu joabhi na malangu na mbulau nahuli ambekaje kubha njemalela wa inchi jokapi ja Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Kabhete, Falao impalika abhahaghulaje bhajemalela bha inchi jenu, abhalaghalakya bhabhonganaje pandu pamu pa nhwanu ja mahunu ghokapi gha Misili, mu hyaka saba ayeyi ya kutupila. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Bhabhonganaje chilebhi chokapi mu hyaka saba ayeyi ya kutupila yeihika na kuchighoha pahi ja lujiniku lwaka Falao, chikubha akiba ja chilebhi mu michi jokapi. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Chilebhi chenihechi anachikubha akiba ja inchi jenu kwa ndandi ja hyaka saba yeihika ya injala ngolongwa heyi, jeanajihikaje mu inchi jenu ja Misili, nahuli inchi ngajiyonangeka kwa injala ngolongwa.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu apekewa lujiniku ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Lilobhi leniheli lakabhi lambone palongi jaka Falao, na palongi ja bhatumika bhaki bhokapi. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Bhela Falao akabhalaluki bhatumika bhaki, “Bho, tuweza le kumpata mundu jongi ngati ajoju, joabhi na Roho waka Chapanga mkati jake?” <verse eid="GEN 41:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Panihapa Falao akumpwaghi Yusufu, “Kwa kubha Chapanga akuyekulili mambu aghagha ghokapi, njeta mundu jongi joabhi na malangu na mbulau ngati wehapa. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Bhela, wehapa anaukubha njemalela wa nyumba jangu, na bhandu bhangu bhokapi anabhakubha pahi ja amuli yaku wehapa. Nepani pela nde nunkolongwa kupeta wehapa maghambu ndamila chitehu cha kikolongwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Falao akumpwaghi Yusufu, ‘Lingalyaje, sajenu nukubheka kubha njemalela panani ja inchi jokapi ja Misili.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Panihapa Falao akahuliki peti ja muhuli kuhuma mulukonji lwaki na kunhwatika mulukonji lwaka Yusufu. Akunhwatiki na ingobhu hinyahi, na kunhwatika mkufu wa zahabu muhingu jake. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Falao akunkwehiki Yusufu pa ligali laki la kabheli la kuhutwa na falasi ngati njangatila waki. Na bhandu bhakalongulili palongi jaka Yusufu koni bhakajamalyaje, na kubhagha, “Nchikamaje pahi!” Bhenibhela nde Falao moakumbekili Yusufu kubha na lujiniku lukolongwa panani ja inchi jokapi ja Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Bhela Falao akumpwaghi Yusufu, “Nepani nde Falao, nambu panga lilobhi laku, mundu ngayijinula chiwoku au chigholu chaki mu inchi jokapi ja Misili.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Falao akundohiki Yusufu lihina la Kimisili, Sefenati Panea. Akuntoghukili Asenati mwali waka Potifela, mpenganyambiku wa muchi wa Oni, kubha nhwanu wake. Bhela, Yusufu akatumbwili kujenda mu inchi jokapi ja Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Yusufu akabhili na ukolongwa wa hyaka selasini, chikahi paakajemiki palongi jaka Falao nkolongwa wa Misili. Najombi Yusufu akabhokiki palongi jaka Falao, na kujenda mu inchi jokapi ja Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Mu hyaka saba ya kutupila yela, inchi jakapihiki mahunu ghamahdeli namaa. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Yusufu akabhongini chilebhi chokapi hyaka saba yela mu inchi ja Misili. Mu kila muchi kukabhekakiki chilebhi chechapatakini mu mighonda jokapi jejiyongolota muchi ghonihoghu. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Yusufu akabhongini ilebhe ngati luhanga lwa mumaheku, yamaheli namaa, hata bhakalepalili kubhalanga, maghambu chakabhi ngakuweza kubhalangika.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Mangani ja kutumbula kwa hyaka ya injala ngolongwa yela, Asenati mwali waka Potifela, mpenganyambiku wa muchi wa Oni, akabhi ambelakile Yusufu bhana bhabheli bha chikambako. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Yusufu akundohiki mwana waki wa kutumbula Manase, akapwaghaje, “Chapanga andendiki nyewaje mang'ahiku ghangu ghokapi na bhandu bhokapi bha munyumba jaka tati wango.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Mwana wa kabheli akundohiki Efulahimu, akapwaghaje, “Chapanga ambekihi lubheleku mu inchi ja mang'ahiku ghango.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Hyaka saba ya kutupila ku Misili yela yakajomwike. <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />Na kutumbula hyaka saba ya injala ngolongwa, ngati bhela Yusufu moakapwaghile. Kukabhili na injala ngolongwa ku inchi yokapi, nambu mu inchi jokapi ja Misili kukabhili na chilebhe. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Chikahi inchi jokapi ja Misili pajakamuliki na injala ngolongwa, bhandu bhakundelili Falao abhapekya chilebhe. Falao akabhapwaghi Bhamisili bhokapi, “Njendanyaje kwaka Yusufu, na lijambu lokapi leampwaghilaje, mlihengaje.” <verse eid="GEN 41:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Injala pajajaghanili ku inchi jokapi ja Misili, Yusufu akahowili gholu ya ilebhe na kubhalombasela Bhamisili chilebhe, maghambu injala jakabhi ngolongwa namaa mu inchi jokapi ja Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Bhelabhela inchi yengi yokapi yakahikiki ku Misili kuhemela chilebhe kuhuma kwaka Yusufu, maghambu injala jakabhi ngolongwa namaa kundema wokapi.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s">Bhabheli bhaka Yusufu bhajenda ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Chikahi Yakobo paakajowini kubha ku Misili kubhi na mahunu, akabhapwaghi bhana bhake, “Maghambu kiki ndingalanila?” <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Akajendali kupwagha, “Ndingalyaje, nyowini kubha ku Misili kubhi na mahunu. Nhwelala konihoko mkatuhemalya chilebhe, nahuli tuweza kubha tabhome wala ngatwipotela.” <verse eid="GEN 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Bhela bhabheli komi bhaka Yusufu bhakahelili ku Misili nahuli kuhemela chilebhe.<verse eid="GEN 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Nambu Yakobo ngacheakuntumiki Benyamini, ndongu waka Yusufu, papamu na bhange, maghambu akajowipi ngaghihika kumpata mahakau.<verse eid="GEN 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Bhela, bhana bha Izilaeli bhakabhi pachilanda ja bhala bhabhapiti ku Misili kuhemela chilebhe, maghambu injala ngolongwa jakabhi mbaka ku inchi ja Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Chikahi chenihechi Yusufu akabhi liwali wa inchi ja Misili, na akabhi nde joabhalombasela bhandu bhokapi chilebhe. Nabhombi bhabheli bhaka Yusufu pabhakahikiki, bhakunchikamili na kujinama ukutama mbaka pahi palongi jaki. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Chikahi Yusufu paakabhaweni bhabheli bhaki, akabhamanye, nambu akalitendiki ngati ngeni kwabho. Akalongili nabhu kwa malobhi makali, na kubhapwaghila, “Mwehapa nhumiki kwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:7">Bhakayangike, “Tuhumiki ku inchi ja Kanaani, na tuhikiki kuhemela chilebhe.”<verse eid="GEN 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Hata ngati Yusufu akabhamanyi bhabheli bhaki, nambu bhombi ngachebhummanye. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Panihapa Yusufu akakombwiki ndoto yeakabhaloti bhabheli bhaki yela. Akabhapwaghile, “Mabhanganya bhapelelezi. Nhwikiki nahuli mbonaje pandu ambapu inchi jitu ngachepabhi na makile.”<verse eid="GEN 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Bhombi bhakayangike, “Ngabhela bambo wito. Bhatumika bhaku tuhikiki kuhemela chilebhe. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Tepani tabhokapi nde tabhana bhaka tati jumo. Tepani nde bhandu bhalongwana, wala nga bhapelelezi.”<verse eid="GEN 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Yusufu akabhapwaghile, “Ngabhela! Nhwikiki pambani nahuli mbona pandu ambapu inchi jitu ngachepabhi na makile.”<verse eid="GEN 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Bhombi bhakayangike, “Tepani bhatumika bhaku tukabhi komi na bhabheli, bhana bhaka tati jumu joatama ku Kanaani. Sajenu nnung'una witu ahighalili na tati kunyumba, na ndongu witu jongi ngacheabhile.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Yusufu akabhapwaghile, “Nde chakaka ngati monakumpwaghile,” nakapwaghaje, “Mwehapa nde bhapelelezi. <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Anana nde ntundu moanandengakakyaje: Chakaka ngati Falao moatamila, ngamboki pandu pambani mbaka ndongu winu nchoku ahika pambane. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Muntumaje jumu winu ajendaje akundeta ndongu winu nchoku pambane, na mabhangi anambekakika muchifungo, nahuli malobhi ghinu ghalengakikaje na kubhona kubha ndongela chakaka. Nangabhela, chekaka ngati Falao moatamila mwehapa nde bhapelelezi.” <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Akabhabhekiki bhokapi muchifungo kwa machobha ghatatu.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Lichobha la katatu Yusufu akabhapwaghile, “Ntenda anana nanamu anankubha mabhome, maghambu nepani nunjoghopa Chapanga. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Anangati mwehapa nde mabhandu bhalongwana, jumu wa bhalongu bhinu na ahighalya muchifungo, na mabhangi mpelaka chilebhe kwa bhalongu bhino bhabhang'ahakika na injala. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Nambu impalika kunetela ndongu winu nchoku pambane, nahuli malobhi ghinu ghabhonikana kubha nde chakaka, wala ngamwipotele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:20">Bhela, bhakahengiki bhenibhela. <verse eid="GEN 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Bhakapwaghanili bheni kwa bheni, “Chakaka tepani tukuntendili mahakau ndongu wito, maghambu tukumbweni akang'ahikaje, nambu ngachetunjowanile. Nde ndandi mang'ahiku ghangani ghatupata.”<verse eid="GEN 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Leubeni akayangike, “Bho, ngachenumpwaghili kubha ngamwihenga lihakau panani jaka nkombu jola? Wala ngachemwajowine, bhela sajenu tulapulika kwa ndandi ja mwahi wake.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Wala ngachebhamanyi kubha Yusufu abhajowana, maghambu akabhi mkalimani pachilanda jabho. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Yusufu akalitengiki nabhu na kutumbula kulela. Paakatumbili, akakelawiki, na kulonge nabhu kabhete. Panihapa akunkamwi Simeoni na kunkonga palongi ja mihu ghabho.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhabheli bhaka Yusufu bhakelabhuka ku Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Yusufu akalaghalaki bhatwelakya magunila ghabhu ilebhe, na kukelabhuha mbija jaka kila jumu wabhu mkati ja ligunila lake, na kubhapekeha chilebhi cha mwindela. Bhenibhela nde moakabhahengile. <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Bhakabhekiki ilebhi yabhu panani ja maponda ghabhu, na kubhoka konihoku. <verse eid="GEN 42:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Bhela pabhakahikiki pandu pa kughonela bhaghene ku indela hoku, jumu wabhu akabhopwili ligunila lake nahuli alipekya chilebhe liponda lake, akakangichi kubhona mbija jaki mundomu wa ligunila lake. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Akabhapwaghi bhalongu bhake, “Mbija jangu jikelawike. Jepambani mundomu wa ligunila lango!” Pabhajowini ghanihagha, mitima jabhu jakang'ahakiki kwa choghoi, na kila jumu wabhu akung'anambuki njake, koni bhakabhaghajaje, na kupwagha, “Bho, aleli nde lijambu bhole leatuhengi Chapanga?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Pabhakahikiki kwaka Yakobo tati wabhu ku inchi ja Kanaani, bhakumpwaghili mambu ghokapi ghaghabhapatike. Bhakapwaghaje: <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />“Chiongozi wa inchi jenijela akalongi na tepani kwa ukale, na kututenda tepani ngati bhapelelezi bha inchi jabho. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Nambu tukumpwaghile, ‘Tepani nde bhandu bhalongwana, wala nga bhapelelezi. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Tukabhelakiki bhalongu komi na bhabheli, bhalongu bhaka tati jumu. Jumu ngacheabhile, na nnung'una witu abhi papamu na tati witu ku inchi ja Kanaani.’ <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />Panihapa chiongozi wa inchi jeniheji akatupwaghile, ‘Anana nde ntundu moanamanyilaje kubha mwehapa nde mabhandu bhalongwana: Mundeka jumu wa bhalongu bhinu papamu na nepani pambane, na mabhangi njendanya mkapelaka chilebhe kwa bhalongu bhino bhabhang'ahakika kwa injala. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Nambu mukundeta ndongu winu nchoku Benyamini pambane, na panihapa nde anamanya kubha mwehapa nga bhapelelezi, nambu nde mabhandu bhalongwana. Panihapa ananunkelabhua ndongu winu Simioni, nanamu anamuweza kuhemela na kulombesa mu inchi jenjeno.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Pabhakabhi bhapiha ilebhi kuhuma mu magulina ghabhu, bhakakangichi kubhona kila jumu wabhu akelabhukiwi mfuku wa mbija jake mkati ja ligunila lake. Pabhakaweni ghanihagha, bhokapi papamu na tati wabhu, bhakajowipi namaa. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Yakobo tati wabhu akabhapwaghile, “Mwehapa mmokeha bhana bhango, Yusufu ngacheabhile, wala Simeoni ngacheabhile, najombi Benyamini mumpala kuntola. Mambu ghanihagha ghokapi ghambatiki nepani!”<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Panihapa Leubeni akumpwaghi tati waki, “Uweza kubhakoma bhana bhangu bhokapi bhabheli, ngati nganunkelabhui Benyamini kwako. Undeka Benyamini mumabhoku ghango, nanatu ananunkelabhua kwako.”<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Nambu Yakobo akapwaghike, “Mwana wangu ngaajendi konihoku papamu na mwehapa, maghambu Yusufu mbeli waki apotile, najombi ahighali kanjika jake. Ngati anaghumpatiki mahaku mu mwanja ghonjenda, anamuhelihaje mmutu wangu ghoubhi na hulia kulitengele kwa kubhina mtima.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s">Bhabheli bhaka Yusufu bhakelabhuka kujenda kabhete ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Injala jakajendali kubha ngolongwa mu inchi ja Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Bhela, pabhakajomwili kula chilebhi chokapi chebhahumiki nachu ku Misili, tati wabhu akabhapwaghile, “Nkelabhukaje ku Misili mkahemala chilechi chengi nakanope.”<verse eid="GEN 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Nambu Yuda akumpwaghi tati wake, “Mundu jola akatulaghalaki namaa, akapwaghaje, ‘Ngamwimoni sula sangu kabhete, mbaka nhwika na nnung'una winu Benyamini pambane.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Ngati anaujetakili nnung'una witu Benyamini ajendaje papamu na tepani, anatujendaje kukuhemalela chilebhe. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Nambu ngati anaukaniki ngayijenda, na tepani ngatujende, maghambu mundu jola akatupwaghili, ‘Ngamwimoni sula sangu kabhete, mbaka nhwika na nnung'una winu pambane.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Izilaeli akalalukile, “Bho, maghambu kiki mnetili mang'ahiku aghagha kwa kumpwaghila mundu jola kubha mbi na nnung'una winu jonge?”<verse eid="GEN 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Bhakayangike, “Mundu jola akatulalukili mambu gha mkati namaa panani jitu na panani ja bhalongu bhitu. Akatulalukile, ‘Bho, tati winu le akali mwome? Bho, mbi le na nnung'una winu jonge?’ Tepani tukumuyangiki malalukilu ghaki pela. Bho, tukaweza bhole kumanya kubha akabya apwaghiki, ‘Mundeta nnung'una winu pambane?’ ”<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Panihapa Yuda akumpwaghi Izilaeli, tati wake, “Untuma nkombu papamu na nepani, natatu anatubhokaje, nahuli tepani na wehapa papamu na bhana bhitu tuwezaje kubha tabhome, wala ngatwipotela. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Nepani namwete ananolakyaje lukwali lwake, wehapa winaya nepani. Ngati nganundeti kabheti kwaku, na kumbeka palongi jaku, anangubha nemi na hatia mu matamu ghangu ghokapi. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Kwa ndandi tukabhi ngachetukabhakile kubhoka, chakaka tukabya tupiti na kukelabhuka mala pabhele.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Bhela, Izilaeli tati wabhu akabhapwaghile, “Ngati anaipalika kubha bhenibhela, ntenda anana, ntolaje mahunu manyahi ghakumu gha inchi jitu mu mifuku jino, na mukumpelakyaje mundu jola ngati nhupu: Muntolila mahuta gha nkwachu machokopi, busi njokopi, ubane, manemane, jozi na lozi. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Ntolaje madini gha feza mala pabheli mumabhoku ghino, na madini gha feza ghala ghaghakelawike mundomu ja magunila ghinu nkelabhuhaje, pangi akakelawihi kwa kujewa. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Muntola na nnung'una wino, na mbokaje mkelabhuka kwaka mundu hoju mala punkamu. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Chapanga Joabhi na Makili na anjangatyaje kupata chiha palongi jaka mundu hoju, andekakyaje ndongu winu jongi jola na Benyamini nkelabhuka papamu. Kwangu nepani ngati anabhapotili bhana bhangu, leka bhapotilaje.”<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Bhela, bhandu habha bhakaitoliki nhupu yela, bhakatoliki na madini gha feza ghala mala pabheli mumabhoku ghabhu, na Benyamini, na kubhoka. Pabhakahikiki ku Misili, bhakapiti na kujema palongi jaka Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Chikahi Yusufu paakumbweni Benyamini papamu nabhu, akumpwaghi mlonda wa nyumba jake, “Ubhapelaka bhandu abhabha kunyumba jango. Ukachinjaje chinyama na kuandaa chilebhe, maghambu bhandu abhabha anabhakula chilebhe cha muhi papamu na nepani.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Mlonda jola akahengiki ngati Yusufu moakumpwaghile, akabhatoliki bhandu bhala na kubhapeleka kunyumba jaka Yusufu.<verse eid="GEN 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Bhela bhandu habha bhakajowipi namaa pabhakapelikwi kwaka Yusufu. Bhakapwaghanile, “Tuletakiki pambani kwa ndandi ja madini gha feza ghala ghaghakelawiki mu magunila ghitu mala ja kutumbula. Apala kutulapula na kutuweza, na kututola tepani kubha bhatumwa, na kughatola maponda ghito.” <verse eid="GEN 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Bhakunheghalili mlonda wa nyumba jaka Yusufu jola, na kulongela naku pundyangu wa nyumba. <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />Bhakapwaghaje, “Pepakoku bambo, tepani tukahikiki pambani mala ja kutumbula kuhemela chilebhe. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Nambu patwahikiki panyumba ja bhaghene, tukabhopwili magunila ghitu, na kila jumu witu akajiweni mbija jaki mundomu wa ligunila lake, chipemu chela chela chetaletike. Bhela tepani tutehi kuikelabhuha. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Bhelabhela tuletiki na mbija yenge nahuli tuhemala chilebhe. Ngachetumanyi kubha nde nane joakabhekiki mbija heyi mu magunila ghito.”<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Akabhapwaghile, “Lukwale lukubha kwino. Chapanga winu, najombi nde Chapanga waka tati winu, jonihoju nde joankelabhukile mbija heyi mu magunila ghino, nepani nde nenajopalile mbija hino.” Panihapa akabhaletili Simeoni.<verse eid="GEN 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Mundu jola akabhaletiki bhandu bhala kunyumba jaka Yusufu, na kubhapekeha machi gha kuchamba magholu ghabhu, na kughapekeha maponda ghabhu chilebhe. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Bhakaandii nhupu yabhu wichu nahuli bhumpekya Yusufu chikahi paanahikaje muhe, maghambu bhakajowini kubha anabhakula chilebhi konihoko. <verse eid="GEN 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Chikahi Yusufu paakahikiki kunyumba, bhakundetili nhupu yela yeyakabhili mumabhoku ghabhu munyumba jake, na kunchikamila mbaka pahi. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Yusufu akabhalalukili hali yabhu, na kupwagha, “Tati winu, hokomundu jombwaghila jola, alama lelo? Bho, akali mwome?”<verse eid="GEN 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Bhakapwaghike, “Mtumika waku, tati witu, alama na akali mwome.” Bhela bhakachikimi mbaka pahi kwa kuntopela.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Yusufu paakalingalili na kumbona Benyamini, nnung'una waki, mwana waka mabhu waki, akalalukile, “Bho, ajoju le nde nnung'una winu wa kujomukela, jomkambwaghi malobhi ghake?” Panihapa akapwaghike, “Chapanga akujangatyaje, mwanango.” <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Yusufu akabhokiki pandu pala manyata, maghambu mtima waki ukumboni chilolu namaa nnung'una wake, akalondiki pandu pa kulelela. Akajingili muchumba chaki, na kulela monihomo. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Paakachambiki pamihu jaki, akapitiki kunja koni alihibhalila, akapwaghaje, “Ndeta chilebhe.” <verse eid="GEN 43:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Bhakumbekili Yusufu chilebhi chaki kanjika jake, na bhalongu bhaki kanjika jabhu, na Bhamisili bhabhakuliki papamu nabhu kanjika jabhu, maghambu Bhamisili ngabhakaweziki kula papamu na Bhaebulania, maghambu lakabhi nde lihakalilu kwa Bhamisili. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Bhalongu bhaka Yusufu bhakabhi bhatami pahi kwa kujengalela hyaka yabhu, kutumbula mbelakeka wa kutumbula mbaka wa kujomukela, bhakalingalanili bheni kwa bheni kwa kukangacha. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Bhakapekiwi pandu pa chilebhe kuhuma pameza jaka Yusufu, nambu akajonjukili pandu paka Benyamini mala pahanu nakanope kupeta ya bhange. Bhela, bhakakunywiki, na kuhekalela papamu naku.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s">Chikombi chibhonikana kwaka Benyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Bhela Yusufu akundaghalaki mlonda wa nyumba jaki akapwaghaje, “Utwelakyaje chilebhe mu magunila gha bhandu abhabha kwa chipemu chebhiweza kutotola, ubhekaje na kila mbija jaka mundu mkati ja ligunila lake. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Kabhete ubhekaje chikombi changu cha madini gha feza chela mu ndomu wa ligunila laka nchoku wa bhokapi jola, papamu na mbija ya kuhemela chilebhe.” Najombi akahengiki ngati Yusufu moakumpwaghile. <verse eid="GEN 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Pakwahiki lukela, bhalongu habha bhakajetakaliwi bhabhokaje, papamu na maponda ghabho. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Pabhakabhi bhakali nga kuhika kutali kuhuma kumbwane, Yusufu akumpwaghi mtumika wake, “Ubhajengalyaje bhalongu bhala manyata, anaubhahimanile, ubhapwaghilaje, ‘Bho, maghambu kiki ndepiki wambone kwa uhakau? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Bho, chikombi achechi le nga cheanywelela bambo wango, na kutumila kulotela mambu ghaghihikaje? Haleli nde lijambu lihakau namaa lemulihengike!’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Akabhajengalili, na kubhahimanila, na kubhapwaghi malobhi ghanihagha. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Nambu bhombi bhakumpwaghile, “Bambo, ubhi na ndandi bhole kulongela malobhi ngati ghanihagha? Lijambu leniheli likubha kutali na bhatumika bhako ngabhihika kuhenga lijambu ngati lenihele. <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Lingalya, hata bhela tukakelawihi madini gha feza ghala kuhuma ku inchi ja Kanaani ghatughahimani mu milomu ja magunila ghitu yela. Henu tuweza bhole kujibha madini gha feza au zahabu kuhuma munyumba jaka bambo wako? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Bhela, anangati mundu jokapi jola pachilanda ja bhatumika bhaku anaakamuliki nachu, unkomaje, na tepani tabhangi anatubha bhatumwa bhaku.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Akayangike, “Bhela na kubya ngati mompwaghile, mundu joanabhonikana kubha abhi nachu, anaakubha mtumwa wango, nambu mabhangi mwenga ngamwikubhi na lawama.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Kila jumu wabhu akahengiki manyata kuheleya ligunila laki, na kulibhopola. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Mundu jola akatumbwi kulonda, akatumbwili kwaka nkolongwa na kujomulela kwaka nchoko. Bhela, chikombi chakabhonakini mu ligunila laka Benyamini. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Kwa lijambu haleli, bhakakachwili ingobhu yabho. Bhakabhekiki kila mundu chibwahila chaki panani ja liponda lake, na kukelabhuka kumbwane koakabhi atama Yusufu.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Yusufu akabhi akali munyumba jake chikahi Yuda na bhalongu bhaki pabhakabhi bhajingila, bhokapi bhakunchikamili ukutama mbaka pahi palongi jake. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Yusufu akabhapwaghile, “Bho, lijambu bholi haleli lemulihengike? Ngechemmanyi kubha mundu ngati nepani nhweza kughamanya mambu kwa indela ja kulotela?”<verse eid="GEN 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Yuda akayangike, “Bho, tukupwaghila kyani bambo? Tupwagha kyane kubha ngachetubhi na lihakau? Chapanga aghayekwili mahakau gha bhatumika bhako. Sajenu tepani tabhokapi nde bhatumwa bhako, tepani tabhokapi papamu na jola joakapatakini na chikombi chako.”<verse eid="GEN 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Nambu Yusufu akapwaghike, “Ngabhela! Nepani ngachenhweza kuhenga bhenibhela! Mundu jola pela joabhonakini na chikombi mumabhoku ghaki, jonihoju nde joanakubha mtumwa wango. Mwehapa mabhangi, nkelabhuka kunyumba jaka tati winu kwa lukwale.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda ankengalela Benyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Panihapa Yuda akunheghalili, na kumpwaghila, “Chondi, bambo wango, nukujopa unyetakyaje kukupwaghila lilobhi wa bambo wango. Nukulobha ngawiyoma, kwa ndandi jaka mtumika wako, maghambu wehapa nde ngati Falao. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Wehapa, wa bambo witu, ukatulalukili, ukapwaghaje, ‘Bho, mbi le na atati au ndongo?’ <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Natatu tukakuyangike, ‘Tubhili na tati witu, sajenu asejike, na kubha tubhili na nnung'una witu joabhelakiki mu useja waka tati wito. Ndongu waki apotile, na nchoku hoju nde kanjika jaki joahighalile na mabhu waki, na tati witu ampala namaa.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Bambo, ukutupwaghili bhatumika bhaku, ‘Mundeta kwangu nahuli nhweza kumbona kwa mihu ghangu namwete.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Natatu tukakupwaghile, wa bambo witu, ‘Nkombu ngacheaweza kundeka tati wake, anaandekiki, tati waki anaapotilaje.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Nambu ukatupwaghili bhatumika bhako, ‘Nangakuhelela na nnung'una winu papamu na mwehapa, ngamwimoni sula jangu kabhete.’<verse eid="GEN 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />“Patwakelawiki kunyumba jaka mtumika waku, tati wangu, tukundandili malobhi ghaku ghawapwaghike, wa bambo wangu. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Panihapa tati witu akapwaghike, ‘Nkelabhukaje ku Misili, mkahemala chilebhi chengi kichokope.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Nambu tukumpwaghile, ‘Ngatuwezi kujenda ku Misili, mbaka ndongu witu nchoku abya papamu na tepani, maghambu ngatuwezi kumbona mundu jonihoju, ngati ndongu witu nchoku ngaajendi papamu na tepani.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />Mtunika waku, tati wangu, akatupwaghile, ‘Mmanyi kubha nhwanu wangu akamelakili bhana bhabheli bha chikambaku.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />Jumu wabhu akahobhiki, na nakapwaghike, ‘Chakaka ayonangiki ipandi ipandi na chinyama cha muchitengo, maghambu ngachenumbweni kutumbu chikahi cheniheche. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Na ngati anamuntoliki kabhete hajoju, na mahakau anaghumpatiki, anamuheliya mmutu wangu ghoubhi na huliya mulitengeli kwa kubhina mtima.’<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />“Bhela, ngati anambiti kwaka mtumika waku, tati wangu, pangakubha na nkombu hajoju papamu na tepani, ambaju matamu ghaki ghakamulini na matamu ghaka nkombu hajoju, <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />ngati anaaweni nkombu ngacheabhile, anaapotilaje. Na tepani bhatumika bhaku anatuntenda mtumika waku, tati witu, kupotela kwa kubhina mtima. <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Maghambu nepani nakalibhohiki kubha mzamini waka nkombu hajoju kwaka tati wango, nakapwaghaje, ‘Nangakubhuja naku kwaku, anangubha na hatia kwaka tati wangu machobha ghokapi gha matamu ghango.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Bhela, bambo, pepakoku uneka nepani mtumika waku nhighalya ngati mtumwa na wehapa pandu paka nkombu hajoju, na nkombu hajoju undeka ajendaje papamu na bhalongu bhake. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Bho, ananhweza bhole kubhuja kwaka tati wangu, na nkombu ngacheabhi papamu na nepane? Ngawineka kujenda kughabhona mang'ahiku ghaanaghumpata tati wango.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s">Yusufu alanda kubha jombi nde nane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Panihapa Yusufu akalepalili kulihibhalila palongi ja bhokapi bhabhakabhi bhajemiki pambipi nako. Akajamalili na kupwagha, “Mumboha kila mundu palongi jango!” Bhela ngachepabhili na mundu jokapi jola papamu na Yusufu paakabhi alilandila kubha jombi nde nane palongi ja bhalongu bhake. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Akaleliki kwa sauti ngolongwa, hata Bhamisili bhakajowine. Bhandu bha munyumba jaka Falao nabhombi bhakajowine. <verse eid="GEN 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Yusufu akabhapwaghi bhalongu bhake, “Nepani nde Yusufu. Bho, tati wangu le akali mwome?” Nambu bhalongu bhaki ngachebhaweziki kumuyanga, maghambu bhakajingiwi na choghoi chikolongwa palongi jake. <verse eid="GEN 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Yusufu akabhapwaghi bhalongu bhake, “Nhweghalyaje pambipi na nepane.” Pabhakaheghalile, akapwaghike, “Nepani nde ndongu winu Yusufu, jola jomwakundombisi ku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Nambu sajenu, ngamwiyoma, wala ngamwalihakalila mabhete, kwa kunombesa kongone. Maghambu Chapanga nde joakanetiki kongoni nundongulyaje, nahuli kukengalela matamu gha bhandu. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Chenjenu nde chaka cha kabhele kubha na injala ngolongwa pa inchi, kabhete kubhili na hyaka nhwanu ambayu bhandu ngabhiwezi kulema wala kuhuna mahunu. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Nambu Chapanga akanongukili palongi jinu nahuli kughalenda mahighalilu ghinu pundema, na kunkengalela mwehapa kwa ukengaleku ukolongwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Bhela nga mwehapa mwemnetiki kongone, nambu Chapanga. Jombi nde joandendiki kubha ngati atati kwaka Falao, na bambo mu nyumba jaki jokapi, na mtawala mu inchi jokapi ja Misili.<verse eid="GEN 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />“Henu ntenda manyata, nkelabhukaje kwaka tati wangu, na mukumpwaghilaje, lendenu nde leapwagha mwana waku Yusufu: ‘Chapanga andendiki nepani kubha bambo wa inchi jokapi ja Misili, bhela uhelalaje uhika kwango, wala ngawikabhakila. <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Nanawu anautamaje mu inchi ja Gosheni, anaukubha pambipi na nepani, wehapa na bhana bhaku, na bhachokolu bhaku, na mabhongelu ghaku gha mambeleli, imbuhi na ng'ombi, papamu na hindu yokapi yeubhi nayo. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Ananungoha konihoko, maghambu ihighali hyaka yengi nhwanu yeihika ya injala ngolongwa. Nangabhela, wehapa na nyumba jaku, na bhokapi bhaubhi nabhu anabhapotila kwa injala ngolongwa.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />Yusufu akajendali kupwagha, “Mwehapa mabhete mbweni kwa mihu ghinu, na hata nnung'una wangu Benyamini aweni kwa mihu ghaki, kubha nde nepani Yusufu nenongela na mwehapa. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Mukumpwaghila tati wangu panani ja utopelu wokapi ghombatiki koni ku Misili, na panani ja yokapi yemuiwene. Bhela mkatenda manyata kundeta tati wangu kongone.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Panihapa Yusufu akunjobhati Benyamini nnung'una waki na kulela, Benyamini najombi akunjobhatili, na kulela. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Kabhete akabhajobhatili bhalongu bhaki bhokapi, na kulela nabhu. Na paghapetiki ghanihagha, bhalongu bhaki bhakatehi kulonge naku.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Malobhi ghanihagha paghahikiki munyumba jaka Falao, kubha bhalongu bhaka Yusufu bhatehi kuhika, Falao na ihongozi bha pahi jake bhokapi bhakahekali namaa. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Falao akumpwaghi Yusufu, “Ubhapwaghila bhalongu bhako, ‘Mtenda anana: Nkweha hibwahila panani ja maponda ghinu, na nkelabhukaje ku inchi ja Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />Bhela mukuntolaje tati winu, na bhandu bha munyumba hinu bhokapi na kuhika nabhu kongone. Nepani ananumpekya pandu panyahi papabholalanile nakanope mu inchi jenjenu ja Misili, nanamu anamuhekalyaje unyahi wa inchi jeno.’ <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Bhelabhela andaghalakila, ‘Mtenda anana: Mtolaje kuhuma pambani pa Misili magali gha kuhutakika gha kubhaleta bhana bhinu bhachoku na akabhahanu bhinu, na mukuntola tati winu na kuhika naku pambane. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Wala ngamwing'ahika panani ja hindu hino, maghambu ghamboni ghokapi gha inchi jenu ja Misili nde ghino.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Bhela, bhana bhaka Izilaeli bhakahengiki bhenibhela. Yusufu akabhapeki magali gha kuhutakika ngati moakalaghalaki Falao, bhelabhela akabhapeki chilebhi kwa ndandi ja mwanja wabhu. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Akabhapeki kila mundu ingobhu jahenu, nambu Benyamini, akumpeki ipandi mia tatu ya madini gha feza, na ingobhu nhwanu ya kung'anambula. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Kabhete akumpelakili tati waki hindu hayeyi kwa ndandi ja mwanja wake: maponda komi ghaghatoliki hindu hinyahi ya ku Misili, maponda mambomba komi ghaghatotwi ilebhi, na mabumunda, na chilebhi chaka tati waki paikubha mu mwanja. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Panihapa Yusufu akalaghini na bhalongu bhaki pabhakabhi bhabhoka, na kubhapwaghila, “Ngamwikomana mwindela.”<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Bhela, bhakabhokiki ku Misili, na kuhika ku inchi ja Kanaani kwaka Yakobo, tati wabhu. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Bhakumpwaghi tati wabhu, “Yusufu akali mwome! Chakaka nde kubha jombi nde mtawala wa inchi jokapi ja Misili!” Panihapa mtima waka Yakobo ukazimie, na ngacheabhahobhalile.<verse eid="GEN 45:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Nambu pabhakundandi mambu ghokapi ghaakapwaghiki Yusufu, na paakaghaweni magali gha kuhutakika Yusufu ghaakabhi ampelakile nahuli kuntola kujenda ku Misili, roho jaka Yakobo jakahyokike. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Panihapa Izilaeli akapwaghike, “Nhobhalela! Mwanangu Yusufu akali mwome! Ananyenda kumbona mangane ngachembotile.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo ajenda ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Bhela, Izilaeli akabhokiki papamu na hindu yokapi yeakabhi nayu, na paakahikiki ku Beeli Sheba, akumbokili nyambiku Chapanga waka Isaka tati waki. <verse eid="GEN 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Chapanga akalongili na Izilaeli mu mabhono ikilu na kupwagha, “Yakobo! Yakobo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">Akayangike, “Naam, nepani pambane.”<verse eid="GEN 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Nepani nde Chapanga, Chapanga waka tati waku, ngawijoghopa kuhelela ku Misili, maghambu ananukutenda kubha litaifa likolongwa konihoko. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Nepani ananhelala ku Misili papamu na wehapa, nanatu ananukukwehaje kabhete ku Kanaani, na pawipotilaje mabhoku ghaka Yusufu nde ghaghiyekaje mihu ghako.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Bhela, Yakobo akabhokiki ku Beeli Sheba, na bhana bhaka Izilaeli bhakuntoliki tati wabhu Yakobo, na bhana bhabhu, na akabhahanu bhabhu, mu magali gha kuhutakika ghaakaghapeliki Falao nahuli kuntola. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Bhelabhela bhakatoliki hinyama yabhu, na hindu yokapi yebhakabhi bhapatiki mu inchi ja Kanaani, na kujenda ku Misili, Yakobo papamu na bhabhelakeka bhaki bhokapi. <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />Akabhatoliki bhana bhaki bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba, bhachokolu bhaki bha chikambaku na bha chimbomba, yani lubheleku lwaki lwokapi mbaka ku Misili.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Aghagha nde mahina gha bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Izilaeli bhabhakapiti ku Misili, Yakobo na bhana bhaki, Leubeni mbelakeka wa kutumbula waka Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Leubeni bhakabhi Hanoki, Palu, Hesiloni na Kalimi. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Simeoni bhakabhi Yemueli, Yamini, Ohadi, Yakini, Sohali, na Shauli, mwana waka mbomba Mkanaani. <verse eid="GEN 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Lawi bhakabhi Gelishomu, Kohati na Melali. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Yuda bhakabhi Eri, Onani, Shela, Pelesi, Zela, nambu Eri na Onani bhakapotili mu inchi ja Kanaani. Na bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Pelesi bhakabhi nde Hesiloni na Hamuli. <verse eid="GEN 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Isakali bhakabhi Tola, Puva, Yashubu na Shimiloni. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Zabuloni bhakabhi Seledi, Eloni na Yaleeli. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Abhabha nde bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Lea bhaakumbelaki Yakobo ku Padani Alamu papamu na Dina, mwali waki. Ubhalangiku wa bhana bhaki bha chikambaku na akakamwali bhaki bhakabhi selasini na bhatatu.<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Gadi bhakabhi Sefoni, Hagi, Shuni, Esiboni, Eri, Alodi na Aleli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Asheli bhakabhi Imina, Ishiva na Belia, na Sela, ndombu wabhu. Na bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Belia bhakabhi nde Hebeli na Malikieli. <verse eid="GEN 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Abhabha nde bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Zilipa, mtumika ambaju Labani akumpeki Lea, mwali waki, na kumbelakela Yakobo bhana komi na sita.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Laheli nhwanu waka Yakobo bhakabhi Yusufu na Benyamini. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Ku Misili hoku, Asenati mwali waka Potifela, joakabhi mpenganyambiku wa muchi wa Oni, akumbelaki Yusufu bhana bhabheli bha chikambaku, Manase na Efulaimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Benyamini bhakabhi Bela, Bekeli, Ashibeli, Gela, Naamani, Ehi, Loshi, Mupimu, Hupimu na Alidi. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Bhanihabha nde bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Laheli, bhaakumbelaki Yakobo, bhana komi na ncheche.<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Mwana wa chikambaku waka Dani akabhi Hushimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Nafutali bhakabhi Yaseeli, Guni, Yaseli na Shilemu. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Bhanihabha nde bhakabhi bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Biliha, bhaakumbelaki Yakobo, mtumika ambaju Labani akabhi ampeki Laheli mwali waki, bhakabhi bhana saba.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Bhandu bhokapi habha bhakapiti ku Misili papamu na Yakobo, bhabhakabhi lubheleku lwaki, panga kubhabhalanga akabhakohanu bhaki, bhakabhi bhandu sitini na sita. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Ku Misili hoku Yusufu akabhi na bhana bhabheli bha chikambaku. Bhela bhandu bhokapi bha munyumba jaka Yakobo, bhabhapiti ku Misili, bhakabhi sabini.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo na bhana bhaki bhahika ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Bhela, Yakobo akundongukili Yuda kujenda kwaka Yusufu, nahuli andonguhaje indela kujenda ku Gosheni. Na pabhahikiki ku Gosheni, <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Yusufu akatandiki ligali laki la falasi, na kutama panani kujenda kunjopalela Izilaeli, tati waki, ku Gosheni hoku. Chikahi Yusufu paakahikiki palongi jaka tati waki, akunjobhatili tati waki, na kulela kwa chikahi chilachu. <verse eid="GEN 46:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Izilaeli akumpwaghi Yusufu, “Sajenu mi tayali kupotela, maghambu napaweni pamihu jako, kubha wakali wa mwome.”<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Panihapa Yusufu akabhapwaghi bhalongu bhaki na bhandu bha munyumba jaka tati waki, “Anangwela kujenda kwaka Falao, na kumpwaghi kubha bhalongu bhangu na bhandu bha munyumba jaka tati wangu, bhabhakabhi bhatama ku inchi ja Kanaani, bhahikiki kwango. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Bhandu bhanihabha nde bhadima bha hinyama, bhahikiki na mabhongelu gha mambeleli ghabhu, imbuhi yabhu na ng'ombi yabhu, na hindu yokapi yebhabhi nayu. <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Falao anaandohiki na kundalukila, ‘Bho, lihengu linu kike?’ <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />Mwiyangaje, ‘Bhatumika bhaku lihengu litu nde kudima hinyama kutumbu ukombu witu mbaka sajeno, ngati akatati bhitu mobhahengile.’ Panihapa anaanjetakya kutama ku Gosheni.” Maghambu kila mdima wa hinyama nde lihakalilu kwa Bhamisili.<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Bhela, Yusufu akapiti kwaka Falao, na kumpwaghila, “Tati wangu na bhalongu bhangu bhahikiki kuhuma ku inchi ja Kanaani papamu na mabhongelu gha mambelele, imbuhi, ng'ombi na kila chindu chebhakabhi nachu, na sajenu bhabhi ku Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Akabhahawili bhalongu bhaki nhwanu, na kubhalangiha kwaka Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Falao akabhalaluki bhalongu habha, “Bho, lihengu linu kike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Bhakayangiki, “Bhatumika bhaku nde bhadima bha hinyama, ngati akatati bhitu mobhakabhelile.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Kabhete bhakumpwaghi Falao, “Tuhikiki kutama kongoni kwa chikahi chijipe, maghambu injala nde ngolongwa ku inchi ja Kanaani, na hinyama ya bhatumika bhaku ngacheibhili na chilebhe cha kuleha hinyama hitu. Bhela, bambo, tukulobha, tepani bhatumika bhaku, utujetakyaje tukatama ku Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Falao akumpwaghi Yusufu, akapwaghaje, “Tati waku na bhalongu bhaku bhahikiki kwako, <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />na inchi jokapi ja Misili jibhi palongi jako, ubhapekya tati waku na bhalongu bhaku pandu panyahi nakanope pa inchi jenu. Walekaje bhatama ku inchi ja Gosheni. Na ngati anaubhamanyi bhandu bhabhabhi na uwezu ukolongwa pachilanda jabhu, ubhabheka bhakubha bhandu bha kujemalela hinyama yango.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Panihapa Yusufu akundetiki Yakobo tati waki na kumbeka palongi jaka Falao, na Yakobo akumpengali Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Falao akundaluki Yakobo, “Bho, ubhi na hyaka ilenga?”<verse eid="GEN 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Yakobo akamuyangiki Falao, “Hyaka yemi nayu mu mwanja wangu nde hyaka mia jimu na selasini. Hyaka yangu ibhi ichoku na ya mang'ahiko, wala ngachemili na hyaka yamaheli ngati akatati bhangu mobhakatamile.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Yakobo akumpengali Falao, na kubhoka palongi jaka Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Bhela, Yusufu akabhatamiki tati waki na bhalongu bhaki pambipi na Lamisesi, papabhi panyahi nakanope mu inchi ja Misili, pakubha mali ghabhu, nabhombi bhakatami konihoku ngati moakapwaghi Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Yusufu akabhi abhajangatila chilebhi tati waki, bhalongu bhaki na bhandu bhokapi bha munyumba jaka tati waki kulengana na ubhalangiku wa bhana bhabho.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cheakahengiki Yusufu mu chikahi cha injala ngolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Hata bhela, ngachepabhili na chilebhi mu inchi jokapi, kwa kubha injala jakabhi ngolongwa namaa, bhandu bha ku Misili na bha ku Kanaani bhakakombili kwa ndandi ja injala ngolongwa. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Yusufu akabhongini mbija yokapi yeyapatakini mu inchi ja Misili na Kanaani, kubhokana na ilebhi yebhalombise, na kuipeleka mbija heyi munyumba jaka nkolongwa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Chikahi bhandu bhokapi bha Misili na Kanaani pabhakajomwi kutumila mbija yabhu yokapi, Bhamisili bhokapi bhakunhiki Yusufu na kumpwaghila, “Utupekya chilebhe! Bho, maghambu ja kiki tepani tupotila palongi ja mihu ghako? Mbija hitu ijomwike.”<verse eid="GEN 47:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Yusufu akapwaghike, “Ndetaje hinyama hino, nanatu ananumpekya chilebhe kwa kung'anambulana na hinyama hino, ngati ana mbija hinu ijomwike.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Bhela bhakaletiki hinyama yabhu kwaka Yusufu, najombi Yusufu akabhapeki chilebhe kwa kung'anambulana na falasi yabhu, mambeleli ghabhu, imbuhi yabhu, ng'ombi yabhu, na maponda ghabhu. Na mu chaka chenihechi chokapi Yusufu akabhapeki chilebhe kwa kung'anambulana na hinyama yabhu yokapi.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Chaka chenichela pachajomwiki, bhakunhikili chaka chechijengalyaje na kumpwaghila, “Ngachetuweza kunhiya uchakaka bambo witu, kubha mbija hitu ijomwike, na mabhongelu gha hinyama yokapi nde yaku wehapa, sajenu ngachetubhi na chindu chokapi chela kwa ndandi jaka bambo witu, nambu pela hyegha hitu na mighonda jito. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Bho, maghambu kiki tepani tupotilaje palongi ja mihu ghako, tepani papamu na mighonda jito kuyonangeka? Utuhemala tepani papamu na mighonda jito kwa kung'anambulana na chilebhe, na tepani na mighonda jito anatukubha bhatumwa bhaka Falao. Utupekya tepani imbeju nahuli tuweza kubha tabhomi wala ngatwipotela, na inchi jitu ngajihighali ukebha.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Bhela Yusufu akunhemali Falao inchi jokapi ja Misili. Maghambu Bhamisili bhakalombisi mighonda jabhu jokapi, ndandi injala jakabhi ngolongwa namaa kwabho, na inchi jokapi jakabhi mali ghaka Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Yusufu akabhatendiki bhandu bhokapi kubha bhatumwa, kutumbula upambala ghumu wa inchi ja Misili mbaka upambala ghonge. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Hata bhela, ngacheakahemili inchi ja bhapenganyambiku, maghambu bhapenganyambiku bhapatiki ghokapi ghabhaghapala kuhuma kwaka Falao, bhombi bhakabhi na chilebhi chamaheli chebhakapekiwi na Falao. Nde ndandi ngachebhalombisi inchi jabho. <verse eid="GEN 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Yusufu akabhapwaghi bhandu, “Ndingalyaje, kwa kubha lalenu nunhemi mwehapa na mighonda jinu kubha mali ghaka Falao, bhela imbeju hinu yepambane, mpandaje mu mighonda jino. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Nambu mahunu paghikubha ghakomike, mwampekya Falao pandu pamu pa kahanu, na pandu pa kachechi anapakubha mali ghinu mabhete, kubha imbeju ya mighonda jinu, na chilebhi chinu, na chilebhi cha bhandu bha munyumba hinu, na chilebhi cha bhana bhino.”<verse eid="GEN 47:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Bhombi bhakumpwaghile, “Ukengalili matamu ghito. Bhela kwa kubha utulangihi wamboni wako, tepani anatukubha bhatumwa bhaka Falao.” <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Panihapa Yusufu akabhekiki shelia jimu jejibhi mbaka lalenu mu inchi ja Misili, kubha pandu pamu pa kahanu pa mahunu nde mali ghaka Falao. Nambu inchi ja bhapenganyambiku pela nde nga mali ghaka Falao.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilobhu la kujomulela laka Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Bhela, Bhaizilaeli bhakatami ku Misili mu inchi ja Gosheni. Bhakapatiki mali ghamaheli konihoko, bhakaneng'anili na kujonjukeka kubha bhamaheli namaa. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Yakobo akatami mu inchi ja Misili hyaka komi na saba, bhela hyaka ya matamu ghaka Yakobo yakabhi hyaka mia jimu na alobaini na saba. <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Chikahi cha kupotela kwaki Izilaeli pachaheghalile, akundohiki Yusufu mwana waki, na kumpwaghila, “Ngati anambatiki chihomu pamihu jaku, ubhekaje chibhoku chaku pahi ja lipaja lango na unapilaje, kubha anaundendila ulongwana na kunhengela ghambone. Nukulobha, chondi ngawindagha mu inchi ja Misili. <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />Nambu panikubha mbotile papamu na akatati bhangu, undolaje kuhuma mu Misili, ukandaghaje ku litengeli labho.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Yusufu akayangike, “Ananhengaje ngati moupwaghila.”<verse eid="GEN 47:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Yakobo akumpwaghile, “Unapilaje.” Yusufu akundapile. Panihapa Izilaeli akajojabhile, na kujinamisha mmutu waki upambala wa kumutu ja chitanda chake kwa utopelu.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo abhapengalela Efulaimu na Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Paghapetiki ghanihagha, Yusufu akapwaghakiki kubha tati waki atenda kulwala. Bhela, akabhatoliki bhana bhaki bhabheli, Manase na Efulaimu, na kujenda nabhu kwaka tati waki. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Yakobo paakapwaghakiki kubha Yusufu mwana waki ahikiki kukubhona, akakangamili kujumuka, na kutama panani ja chitanda. <verse eid="GEN 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Yakobo akumpwaghi Yusufu, “Chapanga Mweni Makili akambitalili ku Luzu, ku inchi ja Kanaani, na kumbengalela. <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />Akambwaghile, ‘Nepani ananukutenda kubha na lubheleku lukolongwa na kukujonjukela nakanope, nanatu ananukutenda kubha libhongelu la mataifa, na ananukupekya wehapa inchi jenjenu papamu na bhabhelakeka bhaku bhajitawalaje mileli.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />Yakobo akajendali kupwagha, “Henu bhana bhaku bhabheli bhaubhapatiki pambani pa Misili mangane ja kuhika nepani, nde bhana bhango, yani, Efulaimu na Manase, anabhakubha bhangu, ngati Leubeni na Simeoni. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Nambu bhana bhawibhelakaje palongi jabhu anabhakubha bhako, na kwa lihina la bhalongu bhabhu anabhalohakikaje mu upwelelu wabhu. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Ndenda anana maghambu panakabhi ngelabhuka kuhuma ku Padani, mu mabhinilu ghangu Laheli akapotili mu inchi ja Kanaani patukabhi tukali tujendale na mwanja, patukabhi pambipi kuhika ku Efulati. Bhela, nakuntaghiki konihoko, punkeghi ja indela jejijenda ku Efulati,” yani Beselehemu.<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Izilaeli akabhaweni bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Yusufu, na kupwagha, “Bho, abhabha aka nane?”<verse eid="GEN 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Yusufu akamuyangiki tati wake, “Abhabha nde bhana bha chikambaku ambabhu Chapanga ambekihi nakabya pambane.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Panihapa Izilaeli akapwaghike, “Ubhaleta kwangu nahuli nabhapengalyaje.” <verse eid="GEN 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Bhela mihu ghaka Izilaeli ghakabhi ngacheghabhona wichu kwa ndandi ja kusejeka, na akaweni kwa mang'ahiko. Panihapa Yusufu akabhaletiki bhana bhaki pambipi na tati wake, na Izilaeli akabhajobhatile. <verse eid="GEN 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Izilaeli akumpwaghi Yusufu, “Chakaka ngachenaholalili kukubhona pamihu jaku kabheti ng'o, nambu, lingalyaje Chapanga anyangatili kubhabhona na bhana bhaku bhelabhela.” <verse eid="GEN 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Yusufu akabhabhohiki bhana bhaki pa majuwa ghaka Izilaeli, na kujinama kwa utopelu mbaka pahi.<verse eid="GEN 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Yusufu akabhatoliki bhana bhaki bhabheli, Efulaimu ku chiwoku chaki cha kumalelelu, akalingalyaje ku chiwoku cha kumangeja jaka Izilaeli tati waki, na Manase ku chiwoku chaki cha kumangeja, akalingalyaje ku chiwoku cha kumalelelu jaka Izilaeli tati waki, na kubhaheghakela pambipi na hokolu wabhu. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Nambu Izilaeli akang'anambwili mabhoku ghaki, na kubheka chiwoku chaki cha kumalelelu panani ja mmutu waka Efulaimu, hata ngati akabhi nchoku, na chiwoku chaki cha kumangeja akabhekiki panani ja mmutu waka Manase, joakabhi mbelakeka wa kutumbula. <verse eid="GEN 48:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Bhela Izilaeli akumpengali Yusufu, akapwaghaje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">“Chapanga ambaju akatati bhangu, Ibulahimu na Isaka bhakatehi kumtii mu matamu ghabhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Chapanga joakanongwihi mu matamu ghangu ghokapi, mbaka lichobha la lalenu,<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />na mtumika wa kunani waka Chapanga joakangengalile kuhuma mu mahakau ghokapi, na abhapengalya akakombu abhabha!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Lihina langu na mahina gha akatati bhangu, Ibulahimu na Isaka, ghatamakyaje kwa akakombu abhabha!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Nabhombi bhajonjukikaje na kubha bhamaheli pundema!”<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Yusufu paakaweni kubha tati waki abheka chiwoku cha kumalelelu panani ja mmutu waka Efulaimu, ngacheakapalike, bhela akachitoliki chiwoku chaka tati waki kuhuma pamutu ja mmutu waka Efulaimu na kuchibheka panani ja mmutu waka Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Yusufu akumpwaghi tati wake, “Ngabhela atati, hajoju nde mbelakeka wangu wa kutumbula, ubhekaje chiwoku chaku cha kumalelelu panani ja mmutu wake.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Nambu tati waki akakaniki, akapwaghaje, “Manyi, mwanango, manyi. Jombi bhelabhela anaakubha litaifa, najombi anaakubha nkolongwa. Hata bhela, ndongu waki nchoku anaakubha nkolongwa kupeta jombi, na bhabhelakeka bhaki anabhakubha mataifa ghamaheli.”<verse eid="GEN 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Bhela, akabhapengalili mu lichobha lela, akapwaghaje, “Bhaizilaeli anabhatumilaje mahina ghinu kupengalela. Bhakapwaghaje, ‘Chapanga na akutendilaje ngati Efulaimu na Manase’ ” Bhela Izilaeli akundongukili Efulaimu palongi jaka Manase.<verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Panihapa Izilaeli akumpwaghi Yusufu, “Nepani nheghale kupotela, nambu Chapanga anaakubha papamu na mwehapa, na anaankelabhuha ku inchi ja akatati bhino. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Nakanopi ja ghanihagha, nepani nukupekihi wehapa pandu papabholalanile pa Shekemu nakanope ja bhalongu bhako, panakatoliki kuhuma kwa Bhaamoli kwa lipanga langu na mshali wango.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo abhapengalela bhana bhake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Bhela Yakobo akabhalohiki bhana bhaki na kubhapwaghila, “Mlibhonganaje papamu nahuli nhweza kumpwaghila lijambu lela leanalumpata mu machobha ghaghahika:<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />Mlibhonganaje unjowanyaje, mwenga mabhana bhaka Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:2">Munjowanyaje Izilaeli tati wino.”<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />“Leubeni, wehapa nde mbelakeka wangu wa kutumbula, na makili ghango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">Lipambiku la kutumbula la makili ghango,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">Wehapa ubhapeta bhalongu bhako kwa ukolongwa na makile.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Wehapa nde ngati machi gha mafuliku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Nambu ngawikubhi unkolongwa kabhete,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Maghambu ukaghonili kihyegha na lidaba laka tati wako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Ena ukachijeghi uhakau chitanda chango.”<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />“Simeoni na Lawi nde bhalongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:5">Mapanga ghabhu bhatumila kuhengela uhakau.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Nepani nganyingili mu mipangu jabhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">Wala nganyingili pa libhonganu labhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">Maghambu mu inyela yabhu bhakunkomiki mundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">Na kwa ing'omu yabhu bhakahekiti mihipa ja magholu gha mapongu gha ng'ombi.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Inyela yabhu na ipata masolu, maghambu yakabhi ngolongwa namaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Na inyela yabhu, kwa kubha yakabhi panga chiha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Ananabhapechangana mu makabila ghaka Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Na kubhagabhanya mu inchi ja Izilaeli.”<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />“Yuda, bhalongu bhaku anabhakulumbalyaje.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Chiwoku chaku anachikubha pahingu ja maadui bhaku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Na bhana bhaka tati waku anabhajinama palongi jako.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Yuda nde ngati mwana wa lihimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Akahuma kubhenga na kughonela ngati lihimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Na ngati lihimba limbomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Bho, nde nane joaweza kulijumuha.<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Ndonga ja kikolongwa ngajibhoki kwaka Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">Wala ndonga jaka mtawala pachilanda ja magholu ghake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">Mbaka paanahika mbelakeka ambaju nde jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">Ambaju mataifa anaghatenda kuntii.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Anaakongaje liponda laki pa mzabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">Na mwana liponda waki pa mzabibu unyahi nakanope.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">Achapiki ingobhu yaki mu divai, na majoho ghaki mu mwahi wa zabibu.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Mihu ghaki anaghakubha makeli kwa kunywa divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:12">Na minu ghaki anaghakubha mahuhu kwa kunywa mahibha.”<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />“Zabuloni anaatama mumaheku ja bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Najombi anaakubha ngati bandali ja kujemakela sitima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Na inchi jaki anajipakana na Sidoni.”<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />“Isakali nde ngati liponda lelibhi na makile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:14">Joaghonela pachilanda ja hibwahila yake.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Nambu akaweni kubha pandu paki pa kupomulela nde panyahi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">Na ntundu inchi jaki mojinyambile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">Akajinamishi ngongu waki kutotola chibwahila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">Na kulibhoha kwa ndandi ja lihengu ligumo.”<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />“Dani anaatemula bhandu bhaki ngati moipalakila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:16">Ngati jumu wa makabila gha Izilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Dani anaakubha ngati lijoka muindela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">Lijoka lelibhi na sumu munkeghi ja indela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">Joaluma magholu gha falasi muindela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">Nahuli jola joatama panani ja falasi ahabhukaje ungalaghaja.”<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />“Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, nepani nuulonda ukengaleku wako.”<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />“Gadi anaalapulikaje na libhongelu la bhanyaghula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:19">Nambu jombi anaabhajengalya cha kunyuma na kubhaweza.”<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />“Luhombi lwaka Asheli analupiha mahunu manyahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:20">Najombi anaabhoha chilebhi chinohu chaka nkolongwa.”<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />“Nafutali nde ngati chinyama chechilowakeka holoko jimbomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:21">Jejibheleka bhana bhanyahi.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />Yusufu nde ngati nkongu wa mzabibu ghoupambika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">Mzabibu ghoupambika punkeghi ja chemuchemu, na mambandi ghaki kujaghanila mulumatu.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Kwa mabhinilu bhahoma mshali bhakundapwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:23">Bhakunhomili mshali na kung'aha namaa.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Nambu mshali wake ukali ubhi wichu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">Mabhoku ghaki ghakapatiki makile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">kwa uwezu waka Chapanga Joabhi na Makile waka Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">Kwa lihina laka Mdima, Lindalaghu la Izilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Ena, kwaka Chapanga waka tati waku joanaakujangatyaje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Kwaka Chapanga Joabhi na Makile joakupengalela wehapa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Kwa mbengalelu ya iyula jejihuma kunani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Mbengalelu ya machi yeibhi pahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Na mbengalelu ya mabheli na ya chitumbo.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Mbengalelu yaka tati waku nde ngolongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Kupeta mbengalelu ya itombi ya mwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Kupeta hindu yeitokuleka ya itombi ya mwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Mbengalelu yeniheyi yokapi na itamaje panani jaka mmutu waka Yusufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Panani ja mmutu waka joala joakabhekakiki kubha nkolongwa pachilanda ja bhalongu bhake.”<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />“Benyamini nde ngati nakawa ja muchitengu jejibhi na injala ngolongwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">Lukela akula yeabhengike, na pakamihi agabhanya mateka.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Aghagha ghokapi nde makabila komi na ghabheli gha Izilaeli. Na ghanihagha nde ghaakaghapwaghili tati wabhu, na kubhapengalela, kila jumu wabhu ngati moikampalakile.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupotela na kutaghakika kwaka Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Bhela Yakobo akabhalaghalaki, akapwaghaje, “Nepani nyenda kubhonganwa papamu na bhandu bhango. Ndaghaje pambipi na akatati bhango, mu likolu lelibhi mungonda waka Efuloni, wa likabila la Bhahiti, <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />mu likolu lelibhi mungonda jaka Makipela, pambipi na Mamile ku inchi ja Kanaani, leakahemi Ibulahimu papamu na ngonda kwaka Efuloni, wa likabila la Bhahiti, kwa ndandi ja kutaghila. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Konihoku nde Ibulahimu na Sala nhwanu waki kobhataghakike, konihoku nde kobhataghakiki Isaka na Lebeka nhwanu wake, na konihoku nde konuntaghiki Lea. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Ngonda ghonihoghu papamu na likolu lelibhi mkati jaki lelakahemaliki kuhuma kwa Bhahiti.” <verse eid="GEN 49:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Yakobo paakajomwi kulongela malobhi ghanihagha kwa bhana bhake, akakunjiki magholu ghaki pachitanda, na kupotela, na kubhonganwa kwa bhandu bhake.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Bhela Yusufu akunjinamili tati waki, akaleliki na kunkumbatila. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Panihapa Yusufu akabhalaghalaki akasing'anga bhabhakabhi bhundwaha, bhunjeghala Izilaeli tati waki mitela nahuli ngaibhola. Akasing'anga bhakunjeghi mitela Izilaeli. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Bhakatumili machobha alobaini, maghambu nde chikahi chechipalika kwa kujeghe hyegha mitela nahuli ngajibhola. Nabhombi Bhamisili bhakundeli Yakobo kwa machobha sabini.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Machobha gha kundelela paghajomwike, Yusufu akabhapwaghi bhandu bha munyumba jaka Falao, akapwaghaje, “Ngati anambatiki chihomu pamihu jinu, chondi nobha mukumpwaghila Falao kwa ndandi jango. Mumpwaghilaje, <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />‘Tati wangu akanapili na kumbwaghila, “Nepani mi pambipi kupotela, ukandaghaje ku litengeli lenabachike paliganga ku inchi ja Kanaani.” Henu nukulobha unyetakalyaje nukuntagha tati wangu, nanatu anangelabhukaje.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Falao akapwaghike, “Ukwelaje, ujenda ukuntagha tati waku, ngati moakakulapile kuhenga.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Bhela, Yusufu akakweliki kujenda kuntagha tati wake. Bhatumika bhokapi bhaka Falao bhakapiti papamu naku, bhakolongwa bha pachengu, na bhazee bhokapi bha inchi ja Misili. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Na nyumba jokapi jaka Yusufu, na bhalongu bhaki na bhandu bhokapi bha munyumba jaka tati waki. Nde bhana bhabhu pela, papamu na mabhongelu gha mambelele, imbuhi na ng'ombi nde yeyahighalile ku inchi ja Gosheni. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Bhelabhela bhakapiti papamu naku bhakwela falasi, na magali gha kuhutwa, na kubha libhongelu likolongwa namaa.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Pabhahikiki pa lubhanja lwa kupulila ilebhe pa Atadi, jejibhi kwihi ja Nkoka Yoludani, bhakaleliki kwa sauti ngolongwa na kwa mabhinilu makolongwa, na Yusufu akapomulili konihoku kwa machobha saba kundelela tati wake. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Bhakanaani bhabhakabhi bhatama konihoku pabhaweni maombulezu ghaghahengakiki pa lubhanja lwa kupulila ilebhe pa Atadi, bhakapwaghike, “Maombulezu aghagha gha Bhamisili nde makolongwa nakanope!” Bhela pandu panipala pakalowakiki Abeli Misili, jejibhi kwihi ja Nkoka Yoludani.<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Bhela bhana bha chikambaku bhaka Yakobo bhakahengiki ngati tati wabhu moakalaghalakile. <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />Bhakuntoliki mbaka ku inchi ja Kanaani, bhakapiti kuntagha ku likolu lelibhi mu ngonda wa ku Makipela, upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa Mamile, leakahemi Ibulahimu papamu na ngonda kuhuma kwaka Efuloni, wa likabila la Bhahiti, nahuli pakubha pandu paki pa kutaghila. <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Yusufu paakajomwi kuntagha tati waki, akakelawiki ku Misili papamu na bhalongu bhaki, na bhala bhabhakabhi bhapiti papamu naku kuntagha tati waki.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu abhabhokeha choghoi bhalongu bhake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Bhalongu bhaka Yusufu pabhakaweni kubha tati wabhu apotile, bhakapwaghike, “Anakubya bhole ngati Yusufu anaatuhakalili na kutulepa kwa mahakau ghitu ghatunhengile?” <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Bhela bhakapeliki ubholu kwaka Yusufu, bhakapwaghaje, “Tati waku akabhohiki amuli mangane ja kupotela kwaki, akapwaghaje, <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />‘Mumpwaghila Yusufu anana: Chondi nobha ubhalekakya bhalongu bhaku mahoku ghabhu na mahakau ghabhu kwa ntundu mobhakuhengile.’ Henu chondi utulekakyaje mahoku ghitu tepani bhatumika bhaka Chapanga bhaka tati wako.” Ubholu aghoghu pawakunhiki Yusufu, akaleliki namaa.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Panihapa bhalongu bhaki bhakapiti, na kujinama mbaka pahi palongi jake, bhakapwaghaje, “Lingalyaje, tepani nde bhatumika bhako.”<verse eid="GEN 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Yusufu akabhapwaghile, “Ngamwijoghopa. Bho, nepani le mi pandu paka Chapanga? <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Chakaka mwehapa mkanholalili mahakau, nambu Chapanga akaghaholalili kubha ghambone, nahuli kukengalela matamu gha bhandu bhamaheli, ngati mokubheli lalenu. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Bhela sajenu ngamwijoghopa. Nepani ananungoha mwehapa mabhokapi papamu na bhana bhino.” Panihapa akabhajeghi mtima, na kulongela nabhu wichu.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupotela kwaka Yusufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Yusufu akatami mu inchi ja Misili, jombi papamu na bhandu bhokapi bhaka tati waki. Akatami kwa hyaka mia jimu na komi. <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Yusufu akabhaweni bhana na bhachokolu bhaka mwana waki Efulaimu, na kubhajopalela ngati bhana bhaki, bhana bhaka Makili, mwana waka Manase. <verse eid="GEN 50:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Bhela Yusufu akabhapwaghi bhalongu bhake, “Nepani nheghale kupotela. Nambu chakaka Chapanga anaanjangatya mwehapa na kuntola kuhuma mu inchi jenjenu na kumpeleka ku inchi jeakundaghili Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo, kwa kulapa.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Panihapa Yusufu akabhalapishi bhana bhaka Izilaeli, na kubhapwaghila, “Chakaka Chapanga anahikaje kunjangatila, nanamu anaimpalika kutola ihupa yangu na kuipeleka konihoko.” <verse eid="GEN 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Bhela Yusufu akapotile, akabya na hyaka mia jimu na komi. Bhakumpakiki mitela nahuli ngayibhola, bhakumbekiki mu lisanduku ku Misili hoku.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>